3dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.meowdoku\"]],[\"qgJeGlwIAEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMAoaChRjb20ub2FrZXZlci5tZW93ZG9rdRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Looking for a game that soothes the soul but keeps your brain spinning? Welcome to Meowdoku — a pure logic puzzle game that flawlessly blends the rigorous reasoning of Sudoku with the thrilling deduction of Minesweeper.\\u003cbr\\u003eHere, you have only one mission: find the perfect \\u0026quot;exclusive territory\\u0026quot; for every aloof little cat!\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Simple Rules, Deep Strategy\\u003cbr\\u003eThe concept is elegant and intuitive, yet anything but simple:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Exclusive Territory: The board is divided into colored sections. You must place exactly one cat in each section.\\u003cbr\\u003e• The Aloof Rule: Cats need absolute personal space! They absolutely cannot share the same row, column, or touch each other—not even diagonally.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Risk \\u0026amp; Reward: Double-tap a tile to place a cat. You only have 3 chances to make a mistake (hearts). Guess right, and you\\u0026#39;re rewarded with pure puzzle-solving satisfaction; guess wrong, and you lose a heart. Guessing won\\u0026#39;t save you; every single move must be carefully calculated!\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Key Features\\u003cbr\\u003e🐾 Pure \\u0026amp; Immersive Experience\\u003cbr\\u003e- Non-Intrusive Ads: Zero interruptions to your gameplay, letting you fully enjoy a completely focused, Zen-like flow state.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play Offline Anytime: No internet required. Perfectly fills up the puzzle-shaped hole in your daily commute, time spent waiting in line, or your morning coffee break.\\u003cbr\\u003e📅 Daily Brain Teasers\\u003cbr\\u003e- Wake up your mind with brand-new \\u0026quot;Daily Puzzles\\u0026quot; every single day.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Push your limits and see if you can break your fastest completion times on the global leaderboards.\\u003cbr\\u003e❤️ Why Meowdoku Will Stay on Your Phone\\u003cbr\\u003eMeowdoku won\\u0026#39;t hijack your attention with tedious social mechanics or endless daily grinds—it earns your love through pure gameplay quality. With its minimalist aesthetic and satisfying tactile feedback, it takes just seconds to learn. Yet, long after you put your phone down, its elegant logic loop will keep lingering in your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003eReady for a brain-teasing puzzle adventure filled with adorable felines?\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Meowdoku now, put your logic to the test, and become the ultimate feline puzzle master!\"],\"Oakever Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uwuSfBapAL6D7WhOM0dwIiO_icvIIQ8us7JQJiKk0mVyKhNHfgfvVbOtXe8W_L30lINIs0kamyJPg2BZb_qxYA\"],null,[247,226,202,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.meowdoku\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oakever.meowdoku\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,n