c Sort!\",[\"4.5\",4.526474],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.grandgames.magicsort\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.grandgames.magicsort\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.grandgames.magicsort\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIAkoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20uZ3JhbmRnYW1lcy5tYWdpY3NvcnQQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Dive into the Enchanted Realm of Magic Sort: A Mystical Water Sort Adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎩✨ Discover Magic Sort! Mix colors in a world where every splash of water is a step into mystery. This isn’t just a game; it’s a journey through puzzles that sparkle with charm, inviting you to sort, match, and puzzle your way through.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Quick Play Guide 🌈\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart Simple: Tap a bottle to pick it up, and another to pour the water. Organize the water so each bottle has only one color.\\u003cbr\\u003eThink Ahead: Pour water only if it matches the top color of the destination bottle and there’s room. Plan to avoid dead ends and strategically sort the colors.\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbrace Complexity: With each level, sorting and matching require more thought. Every move is crucial.\\u003cbr\\u003eUtilize Magic Tools: Stuck? Use \\u0026#39;Undo\\u0026#39; to reverse moves, or \\u0026#39;Shuffle\\u0026#39; to rearrange the bottles anew, making sorting a breeze.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔮 Cool Features 🔮\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpellbinding Levels: Each stage brings a fresh challenge of color sorting and magical fun.\\u003cbr\\u003eWizard’s Gear: Magic tools make your quest of water sorting smoother and way more fun.\\u003cbr\\u003eVivid Splashes: A riot of colors makes every move a delight, turning sorting into a visual feast.\\u003cbr\\u003eUnique Twists: Classic puzzles get a magical makeover for extra thrill, blending color, water, and puzzle elements seamlessly.\\u003cbr\\u003eBoosts \\u0026amp; Surprises: Stir up boosts in the cauldron to power through puzzles, adding a layer of strategy to your color sorting.\\u003cbr\\u003eMystical Ingredients: Gather ingredients to brew stronger magic, enhancing your water sort adventures.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎇 Why Magic Sort? 🎇\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSharpen Your Brain: Each puzzle is a fun test of wits, blending elements of color, water, and sorting into each challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003eChill Vibes: Dive into a soothing, colorful escape, where water and color sorting provide a tranquil experience.\\u003cbr\\u003eMagic at Every Turn: New potions and surprises make every level an adventure in water, color, and puzzle-solving.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 Get Ready to Cast Some Color! 🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Magic Sort now and start your magical, colorful journey. The world of mystical puzzles, where water, sorting, and color converge, awaits!\"],\"Grand Games A.Ş.\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mOuw9ILTWw84xU9nL6q5UlBUF9U0kW8yfAcnbyBsYyx_3ai6AoQ8TSNWK2otl0JTPZoNLlGm2n-00mrwKxGv0G0\"],null,[31,30,128,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Shares Location, In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googl