mes.royalsmash\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cyphergames.royalsmash\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cyphergames.royalsmash\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIA0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgogChpjb20uY3lwaGVyZ2FtZXMucm95YWxzbWFzaBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"BMLyG86PfIQ\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:BMLyG86PfIQ?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:BMLyG86PfIQ\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznNtRzHrOKFPKCmVXUt1EtfoIbo6_lmG9C36BIQDR1hMy_60PJ0q-11Yvk_IjB22vtYbxgbt25PxEZUuEBWaMr99clzm8qyWYPn9RwsPCQ0WGln2VZCQzvJQfrgDmj_dkV2ptosF_79EUwFqSv4MvGWzt718BHQJCOncVGkH7fqiK7sQWcT31CC95h2Evg0JKh6E9bIuiniQR8pgCkmKcLDpPHEsMYQiEvYiudJvxEel0eojPr2xt7xPrRbACIPwW-TrOqbDY-Ee3UBQlnxE-qhLn66HnL52zqHZe3Gn6IiPQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BMLyG86PfIQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Royal Smash! — the royal smash festival where every shot is a satisfying smash hit!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLoad the royal cannon, line up your angle and power, and smash the whole royal arena to pieces. Fire across the kingdom to smash fragile jars, crush heavy stones, and bring royal towers crashing down in glorious 3D. One clean smash can trigger an unstoppable chain reaction that smashes the entire scene at once.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to play in your first minute, but every royal level rewards precision, timing, and a little destructive genius.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 HOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e• Aim the royal cannon — set the perfect angle and power\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fire and smash through fragile jars and heavy stones\\u003cbr\\u003e• Trigger chain reactions to smash everything in one shot\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clear each stage to unlock the next royal arena\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 GAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e• Satisfying smash physics — every royal smash feels real\\u003cbr\\u003e• Stunning high-quality 3D graphics and animated festival scenes\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of royal levels packed with new objects and challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple one-tap controls anyone can smash instantly\\u003cbr\\u003e• Skill-based aiming that rewards the perfect smash\\u003cbr\\u003e• Colorful royal kingdoms to demolish, one blast at a time\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 WHY YOU\\u0026#39;LL LOVE IT\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love smash games, blast games, and royal destruction challenges, Royal Smash! is your next obsession. Relax with oddly satisfying smashing, or chase the perfect royal smash chain to master every arena.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrab the royal cannon, aim true, and smash the whole kingdom in Royal Smash! It\\u0026#39;s a total smash fest of destruction!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👑 Download Royal Smash! now and start smashing!\"],\"Cypher Games\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oMyLEtBDg9KKWFB_LfAapSjuxs-5-VuqI8fS-dji41pm6M2X8llO41PrXiLkd-51AVCOY5Y7PsirMIdLbD2eAA\"],null,[67,202,253,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cyphergames.royalsmash\