MZmtzYYv06grLqc_DGWgkz6-E3Fl5Gn4CN8erAfnzrYlW9k5I0T1S5PPO7260mOh1HfQCQ\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/61fDEUtRpHZrKZUVx8jVwfotTeCq32krpZY7_QTIrlXRebKFQDgTdYme0MCntiRFOfvGMlNqrpeNqwfh0iIg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hM5FHw21KjBc1NaUmhwKlcKkRXYLhAD5bbi1DBfUViMSfVCrJwHMq0b3dpjMdq7XytwbqMnduoH31y67kNZ-\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S69tJHuxnXxDSesz-cjVWfBDhxOgQ4w2d9xVPOwOVzBTe4SI3XzflknWIswkx73PvAo1fZ2fX7xJBFdKndrkIw\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3TPXEir1fszwXmqwA1FNETC2SyQdYbDv-O3xedCSSqRB30ooBy4lKP-kAH1mfn5LMlHB_hCT9mZoIIg3Wv5Urw\"]]],\"Amaze GO!\",[\"4.6\",4.620856],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\"]],[\"qgJcGloIB0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLgoYChJjb20ub2FrZXZlci5hcnJvd3MQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Amaze GO! A clean arrows puzzle game built to calm a busy mind. Every arrow points the way — what you need to do is to choose the right order. The design cuts visual noise, reduces chaos, and helps you organize thoughts as you play. Pick up an arrow. Find its lane. Repeat until the grid is yours. Enjoy the quiet flow offline anywhere and anytime. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat makes Amaze GO! great\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Streamlined arrows puzzle that declutters the screen and the mind\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Works offline with a clean interface that keeps attention on the board\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Calm play loop for smart brains: think clearly, move each arrow with strategy\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Smooth tap controls, clear path feedback, and satisfying release moments like ASMR\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e- Find an arrow with a free path to the edge\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap to slide that arrow off the grid and open a lane for the next move\\u003cbr\\u003e- Plan the order to secure a safe route and a clean board\\u003cbr\\u003e- Long-Press to use Guidance to highlight directions when your path is unclear\\u003cbr\\u003e- A wrong tap costs a heart for the level\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clear the board to finish the level and aim for a perfect run\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hints help focus when the grid feels tight\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy love this arrow puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e· Simple rules, profound strategy, and a meditative arrows puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e· Short breaks ease stress and sharpen focus\\u003cbr\\u003e· The last arrow leaves the board with a satisfying mental reset\\u003cbr\\u003e· Cognitive workout for sequencing and brain teasers\\u003cbr\\u003e· Quiet visuals, plus a satisfying whoosh as each arrow flies off the grid — feedback that soothes instead of nags\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMade for the in-between moments\\u003cbr\\u003e- The ten minutes before a meeting starts \\u003cbr\\u003e- The metro ride too short for a podcast \\u003cbr\\u003e- The flight where your signal drops\\u003cbr\\u003e- The wind-down after a noisy workday \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAmaze GO! - Puzzle Games is a quiet arrows puzzle made for sharp minds and calm moments. Learn fast, then master timing and order. Send every arrow off the board, untangle the grid, and feel disorder turn into clarity. Amaze GO! is the arrows puzzle you reach for when the rest of the day was too loud — one good move, then another, then a quiet board. Download now, plan smart paths, keep hearts safe, and enjoy pure focus anytime, anywhere!\"],\"Oakever Games\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wD29uFjv1CKZqtnCDOALEvoT7IFk9qzN19cGh7eMh1kVT4T5AwcengpEktlbZEid-0tva9Tnd9u3VmODuKmgog\"],null,[250,250,250,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oakever.arrows\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.block.juggle\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5FLR-EBlfNvoV9ydZkOMDqRF10nV64XcKdZzW_oQzmz2e8Me9PS5Zncnvviki0J3XumjO2a_lg6_IdwOqwnV\"],null,[18,18,79,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sogNkRq2d8VqbVUlTdHi-Ni1m5DkHQmWYlvG44CJ5pD6kmtBnkX_gk3xcL1RpOPV3Q4QrQEbt_lWTbo409Wh\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.