ure\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\"]],[\"qgJyGnAICUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBFwoVCOHKzNH+vs+LQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI8CiYKIGNvbS5wb2NrZXQuc29ydC5jb2luLnB1enpsZS5nYW1lEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"7xa_KmZCfA4\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:7xa_KmZCfA4?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:7xa_KmZCfA4\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkoofOa-8X7IDoj-lZCGcmrmIdUyyTaGrSKGS1cC-6EHZqp7QS9DYfArSCY2S-GtxNN60jFF2pj7FdtzUPVaWtDLxxembl68wm094lSEPC23fgVQGYTHU1sIU6PelGZKrVUQEpp9xjjCy-eV1baMkSL_Vd0qGZGQRZADh3JcKl-T2kPoXofPe7HYuxvDpGwaO2kuZQts249Zc0ts-j7R2_16H8OosQWiacrhUiVJC-6Rw1f57D5zjs0mAKheAB5msh1GTICzr96BlcyU-BjvFOCEdI74yi5Fu_-7bV42tUyAg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7xa_KmZCfA4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eSORT YOUR WAY TO HAPPINESS 😃\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster mergers, ready those fingers and get to matching in 3…2…1! This fun sorting puzzle features colorful coins that need to be matched up in their slots and then merged together to clear the playing field, making way for more. Bright colors, simple graphics, and lots of boosters ensure that your brain can focus on what it does best: noticing patterns and finding unique ways to shuffle everything around in order to win.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMASTER THE MATCH 🧩\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple in theory yet difficult in practice, players young and old will enjoy racking their brains for the best possible way to merge the different color coins and keep progressing. With no timer or pressure to trip you up, you’ll be able to sort, match, and merge the coins while also relaxing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFun features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🤑 Tons of coin types\\u003c/b\\u003e – In addition to your standard rainbow of coins to match, as you progress there will be all manner or fun new coins to keep things fresh. Hidden coins, linked coins, ice coins, and more await, so keep your eyes peeled!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🤔 Easy on the eye\\u003c/b\\u003e – As colorful as this sorting puzzle is, the whole point is to help you chill so we’ve done away with any crazy graphics or flashing lights. This also means the game is great to play wherever you find yourself, solo or perhaps with a little helper.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e💆\\u200d♂️ Relaxing to play\\u003c/b\\u003e – No countdown clock here! Take as much time on each puzzle as you need, and move the coins around as much as you want without being penalized. We believe in having fun, not getting stressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🧠 Train your brain\\u003c/b\\u003e – Sorting and matching puzzles are a great way to train your brain to recognize patterns and colors, and to work on your logic and thinking skills as you test out different ways to group coins. And it doesn’t stop there, the skills you hone in the game can be applied to other stuff in real life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📈 Keep growing\\u003c/b\\u003e – As you progress through the puzzle levels, more colors and coin types will be added, and things will get steadily more difficult. But no fear, even as you’re pushed to get better we’ve added plenty of fun boosters to keep it chill.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eGO ON A COLORFUL ADVENTURE ⛰️\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to start your merge adventure? This relaxing game keeps your mind sharp while also providing a fun escape as you enjoy sorting and matching, so hop on in to become the master sorter and put all this stuff where it needs to be!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eDownload Pocket Sort: Coin Puzzle today to see how good you are at locating different colored coins and slotting them in together.\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OXD-3tIqUp6a2ijmUkRqJmxB3GjyIkaix6U1ygnIRuNekI1FkcgJcxw1kEiys22IcXaDVH57Jh768azczbPz\"],null,[135,53,16,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.pocket.sort.coin.puzzle.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Sort\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.nebula.mahjongtile