VUUwMXAAZqdkBtmuYJ0yos4WwhJ1AoFDtx-E5f3ETa8pZdxgl2uLS1T2ri5zF8PD18-fZEDwuPHUpYlDfk\"]]],\"Mahjong Blast\",[\"4.9\",4.90111],\"Board\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.mahjongtile\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.nebula.mahjongtile\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.mahjongtile\"]],[\"qgJoGmYICkoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBFwoVCKz058CmhM6IQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIyChwKFmNvbS5uZWJ1bGEubWFoam9uZ3RpbGUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"☕️ Relax with Mahjong Blast, a fun choice for fans of Mahjong board puzzle games, classic tile puzzles, and relaxing board games. Enjoy a calm Mahjong board puzzle game that blends classic pair matching, tile puzzles, and laid-back board gameplay. Match identical tiles, clear each layout step by step, and enjoy smooth gameplay with no timer or pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you love board puzzle games, puzzle match games, or board games offline, play at your own pace. Mahjong Blast is an approachable board puzzle game for adults seeking low-pressure fun during quick breaks or longer sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003e🀄 INTUITIVE TILE-MATCHING \\u0026amp; LOGIC PUZZLES\\u003cbr\\u003eRooted in traditional mahjong solitaire, every board follows familiar pair-matching logic: find two free tiles, remove the pair, and clear the layout. Clean boards and readable tiles make this board puzzle game easy to learn and satisfying to complete.\\u003cbr\\u003eFans of logic puzzle games can observe patterns, plan ahead, and avoid blocking useful tiles. Each Mahjong match puzzle rewards smart choices instead of fast reflexes.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 BOARD PUZZLE GAMES WITH HUNDREDS OF LEVELS\\u003cbr\\u003eMahjong Blast combines tile pairing with the satisfying progression of puzzle match games. Match tiles, open new paths, and solve hundreds of layouts, from quick five-minute puzzles to longer challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003eFor players seeking puzzle games for adults with levels, every stage offers focused gameplay based on observation and planning. Progress at your own pace and master Mahjong skills one board at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e📅 DAILY MAHJONG \\u0026amp; MAHJONG PRACTICE\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy daily Mahjong with fresh layouts inspired by American Mahjong style. Each daily Mahjong match helps you recognize patterns, improve your strategy, and complete a clear goal.\\u003cbr\\u003eGentle Mahjong practice builds memory and attention without pressure, with fresh board puzzles ready whenever you return.\\u003cbr\\u003e📴 OFFLINE BOARD PUZZLE GAME WITH NO ADS\\u003cbr\\u003eMahjong Blast is a free mahjong solitaire board game that works offline. If you enjoy board games offline, every level remains available at home, while traveling, or whenever Wi-Fi and mobile data are unavailable.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy an ad-free board puzzle experience with simple controls, clear goals and calm gameplay wherever you go.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 3D PUZZLE MATCH \\u0026amp; CLASSIC PAIRING\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a smooth 3D puzzle match experience with polished 3D-style tiles. For fans of triple match 3D puzzles, this Mahjong match 3D game offers a calmer two-tile alternative based on observation and memory.\\u003cbr\\u003e🇺🇸 AMERICAN MAHJONG STYLE \\u0026amp; PATTERN PUZZLES\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore boards inspired by American Mahjong style, familiar symbols, and flexible choices. This relaxed take on mahjong solitaire offers pattern puzzles without competitive rules and builds pattern recognition through play.\\u003cbr\\u003e👴 MAHJONG FOR SENIORS \\u0026amp; ADULTS\\u003cbr\\u003eLarge tiles, clear layouts, and simple controls make this Mahjong board game comfortable and easy to follow for seniors. The calm pace also suits anyone looking for easy puzzle games for seniors, board games for adults, or low-pressure matching games.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿 WHY CHOOSE MAHJONG BLAST?\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Classic mahjong solitaire with pair-matching rules.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Daily Mahjong matches with fresh board puzzle layouts.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Mahjong practice based on observation and planning.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Board puzzle games with hundreds of levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Puzzle match games with satisfying progression.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Board games offline with no Wi-Fi required.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Relaxing board puzzle gameplay, free to play anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Logic puzzles with no timer or time pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Puzzle games for adults with progressive levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Large tiles and simple controls for seniors.\\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Ad-free gameplay with no interruptions.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love mahjong solitaire, classic tile matching and relaxing board games, Mahjong Blast is built for you. Enjoy a smooth blend of board puzzle games, daily Mahjong and logic puzzle gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mahjong Blast and enjoy a free board puzzle game with daily challenges, offline play, and satisfying levels for adults and seniors.\"],\"Nebula  Studio\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/K4Bup2nDE_2otDksD2bOU2RWmAWAqI8fXDWeVTFX7EWnjs6F3zsOcZ7Fbv5_BKUvr3jWwl78Np2WjtAsWBLOs5o\"],null,[21,63,38,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/google