U-SnpmcLHtuKUUIi3InuaKW_v9nJm4bx0y2C-g5WNRWXbPNBgp0AiHiYfQJSetw\"]],[null,2,[2358,1179],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UlCjcD7stjyeyvQeul5A1AC-uByqLUjy2cb3B94u83Z30G4OeJbgQxfCUWE7M-M2eT_Y8gHPx1hE2INnL2BLrA\"]],[null,2,[2358,1179],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X7AJETNqai1PUcM50vLmZ7zU-SnpmcLHtuKUUIi3InuaKW_v9nJm4bx0y2C-g5WNRWXbPNBgp0AiHiYfQJSetw\"]]],\"NBA 2K HQ\",[\"2.6\",2.6392157],\"Sports\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.VisualConcepts.MyNBASherpa\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.VisualConcepts.MyNBASherpa\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.VisualConcepts.MyNBASherpa\"]],[\"qgJuGmwIFUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQAokCh5jb20uVmlzdWFsQ29uY2VwdHMuTXlOQkFTaGVycGEQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgFEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Lock in around the clock with a host of exciting features designed to level-up your NBA 2K27 experience anytime and anywhere. Create unique builds with the built-in MyPLAYER builder, rally your friends with Crew management and social features, and claim rewards every day. Play beyond the whistle with NBA 2K HQ and stay connected to NBA 2K27.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMyPLAYER BUILDER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShape your game wherever you go. Access the full NBA 2K27 MyPLAYER Builder directly in-app and upload builds you create on NBA 2K HQ right onto your home console setup. Then, share them from anywhere via QR codes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSOCIAL AND CREW INTEGRATION\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTap into your squad 24/7 with full Crew management and NBA 2K’s social features. With both real-time messaging and Crew management, NBA 2K HQ puts the NBA 2K social experience in the palm of your hand.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDAILY REWARDS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your day with a fresh drop! NBA 2K HQ features mobile-exclusive daily login rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePROGRESSION TRACKING\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStay in the moment by viewing your progress and rank in real-time. NBA 2K HQ features continuous tracking for Daily Leaderboards and Crew Rewards so you can focus on your climb to the top.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFACE SCAN\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe new-and-improved Face Scan features a quicker, more accurate scanning process with high-fidelity texture quality–all designed to place you right into your very own basketball fantasy. Your game. Your look.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRequires internet connection and Android 11.0 or above (Minimum API level 30)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information: https://www.take2games.com/ccpa\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse of this application is governed by the Terms of Service (ToS) found at www.take2games.com/legal. Online and certain special features require an internet connection, may not be available to all users or at all times, and may be terminated, modified, or offered under different terms without notice. For more information on the availability of online features and services visit https://bit.ly/2K-Online-Services-Status.\"],\"2K, Inc. - a Take-Two Interactive affiliate\",\"0+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZNs8oLa8XBsNJGPHic802BmYDoI0G1Gsnk_as1_fcRkBZBtK_RO53WZgrmxCMu0Ce-YB405LD9JGBVeq8vwp0g\"],null,[64,1,1,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[27