ll,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EThHi-B10jCqmkxVJr2P9HA_SdPW0CAObAUNaANgr6OugoohF79Lvhkl-eWSYEHUH5IpOJF1k3cqFD5X8eut1CI\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2WheszQjXIEFWiTEClvi0zT57e2RpJX8qV4Akn7I4mYUQOXHnzRs70H9aZkDSjAjHj3i5R4Nr_XORgdx78s9QQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RsKAiaEU68nRxgr2uWHMk8qrGTLsCE9W6qkykdgmGS04fX-CfDUcOHfC7kX9zgMvRFy4XMDfaRwvFqkj6zs2rKQ\"]]],\"Zoodoku\",[\"4.6\",4.646409],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.zoodoku\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.nebula.zoodoku\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.zoodoku\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIGUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBFwoVCJLqlcj5t8SLQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIuChgKEmNvbS5uZWJ1bGEuem9vZG9rdRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Relax your mind with Zoodoku, an animal logic puzzle filled with clever brain puzzles, daily challenges, and adorable animal themes.\\u003cbr\\u003eFind the perfect territory for every animal. Place exactly one animal in each colored region while making sure no two animals share the same row or column or touch each other, even diagonally.\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery puzzle has one unique solution. There are no numbers, no math, and no guessing - only observation, deduction, and pure logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSIMPLE RULES, DEEP STRATEGY\\u003cbr\\u003e• One Animal per Territory\\u003cbr\\u003ePlace exactly one animal inside each colored region.\\u003cbr\\u003e• One per Row and Column\\u003cbr\\u003eNo two animals can appear in the same row or column.\\u003cbr\\u003e• No Touching\\u003cbr\\u003eAnimals need their own space. They cannot touch one another, even diagonally.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Logic, Not Guessing\\u003cbr\\u003eObserve the board, eliminate impossible spaces, and discover the unique solution.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA FRESH ANIMAL LOGIC PUZZLE\\u003cbr\\u003eZoodoku combines simple rules with satisfying logical deduction. Study the colored territories, recognize patterns, and work out where every animal belongs.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy logic puzzles, brain puzzle games, or relaxing brain games, Zoodoku offers a thoughtful challenge that is easy to learn and rewarding to master.\\u003cbr\\u003eInspired by Sudoku logic and Minesweeper-like deduction, each level delivers a colorful, number-free puzzle experience. Every move can be calculated using pure logic instead of luck.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA GROWING WORLD OF ANIMALS\\u003cbr\\u003eStart with a friendly meow and solve a charming cat puzzle before discovering dogs, cows, and more animal themes.\\u003cbr\\u003eEach animal adds personality and variety while preserving the clear rules and thoughtful strategy at the heart of every puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy Meowdoku and other territory-based logic puzzles, Zoodoku offers a familiar combination of colored territories, pure logic, and no-guessing deduction in a growing world of animals.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDAILY PUZZLES AND OFFLINE PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve a new Daily Puzzle every day or explore hundreds of handcrafted brain puzzles at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete a quick animal puzzle during a break or enjoy a longer logic challenge whenever you have time. Play offline anytime and anywhere - no internet connection required.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of handcrafted logic puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e• A new Daily Puzzle every day\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cats, dogs, cows, and more animal themes\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unique solutions with no guessing\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing brain training for every skill level\\u003cbr\\u003e• Sudoku-style logic without numbers or math\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clean visuals and intuitive controls\\u003cbr\\u003e• Offline play anytime and anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you enjoy animal puzzles, logic puzzles, brain games, Sudoku challenges, or relaxing brain puzzles, Zoodoku gives you satisfying logic gameplay in every level.\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you find the perfect territory for every animal?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Zoodoku and enter a relaxing world of adorable animals, clever logic, and rewarding daily challenges.\"],\"Nebula  Studio\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/muB9jI9cKR6typxGyBuyT7uluNWe9HfcDT8wORISPXjcVWPoxy2tW1U5FqaTNdqQVtT4iHnCYUIg-xTn5Pf0EQ\"],null,[246,241,234,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.nebula.zoodoku\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.nebula.zoodoku\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[