m/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergegames.gossipharbor\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mergegames.gossipharbor\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergegames.gossipharbor\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIG0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBFwoVCIukytfl6OyLQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugI3CiEKG2NvbS5tZXJnZWdhbWVzLmdvc3NpcGhhcmJvchABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"Kl-0KPlQ76M\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:Kl-0KPlQ76M?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:Kl-0KPlQ76M\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezm2e-m2J4yDQbh0EAFqM5gXOdoj_NO0EWHTSoUKr9FgarN_AvttZH6ix6xbyImiJzQOH4YWW0C_9x_IZevPcV2Cqk-9pdBonPqcY6jIzJ6_CsAf1O-iaSFFS4UQ_kSWJlPTecjhKjt227LVNaYR-Unk8S2nu6vgDRMkSLs5edk5tlCASpxF5o5K3ZZcFDGk8eo-uAZOO4bu2x5kNUoCQI9f7xEiMCcq_ARNHluBag8PdsauovObNw9LkxV_qy2Cj7xhDGEvdPbhe22LSV97ySbDUTM5W_6KyPoQKft__IEttA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Kl-0KPlQ76M/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Gossip Harbor 🌊\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Quinn Castillo as her picture perfect life on Brimwave Island crumbles around her. Divorce, sabotage and secrets. Help answer the question everyone\\u0026#39;s thinking: Who\\u0026#39;s trying to ruin her life? \\u003cbr\\u003eMerge flavorful dishes, restore and decorate Quinn\\u0026#39;s restaurant and watch the mystery unfold. \\u003cbr\\u003eBut who can you trust in Brimwave? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhip Up Tasty Dishes🥪\\u003cbr\\u003eServe coffee, sandwiches, seafood, and a range of other dishes, to your customers. The more you play, the more dishes you’ll find to add to your menu!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRestore the Restaurant🧰\\u003cbr\\u003eRebuild and design the best beach restaurant around! Choose the flooring, wallpaper and furniture to restore restaurant to its former glory! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild Relationships💞\\u003cbr\\u003eConverse with customers and hang out with old friends. Or explore the possibility of a new budding romance. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCatch up on the Gossip🤫\\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;ll renovate and merged to reveal clues, and uncover hidden secrets of the residents on Brimwave Island. And perhaps even unveil the Castillo\\u0026#39;s hidden secrets…\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoying Gossip Harbor? Learn more about the game on our Facebook Fan Page!\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/GossipHarbor\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed help? Contact us by sending an email to gossipharbor-service@microfun.com\\u003cbr\\u003eWe\\u0026#39;re here to help you! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.microfun.com/privacy_EN.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.microfun.com/userAgreementEN.html\"],\"Microfun Limited\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W1NmS0cARyAgrN5dPntQfM2yIDCKcO_m5oxTgfTG17-RgdJAkKRpDnTlZc3jwSeXVPckPLKugMUfZ3WHzJU6LA\"],null,[239,228,196,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mergegames.gossipharbor\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mergegames.gossipharbor\\u0026feature