0d54rfpPkz0qifFLMW4zXal9OIo4VVJ9zDud870VA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/abSqdCFaxPic3SfDEuH9bANef16EHYfbMCrGyuq6vacQCOa5jURUMkZiPgN6zQ_2-Qkv7zsAjIFm2CZCjQdztw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_SmiFvoVBvdSOi3eejLSTzLYQavg4--4PQHAB_KYMA7OefJ_dV7Agqs3jid416vbTSjeUhgKiwDfpUhF2rGZ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TNFc8WzMUkZOs-kGqQaXJrTvSQAcN8v6lSDtzdZnjOrqciFgq8NOwbdn6QE36oZsb1fmbKVaJhyzkFClRY95rQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0aTbZzOf4hKu14IfrQnk0CqfdYziowNEnBJG9PTjMF5VI0d54rfpPkz0qifFLMW4zXal9OIo4VVJ9zDud870VA\"]]],\"Stack Smash - Block 3D Puzzle\",[\"4.9\",4.9145174],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.blockssmashgame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tripledot.blockssmashgame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.blockssmashgame\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIHEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPwojCh1jb20udHJpcGxlZG90LmJsb2Nrc3NtYXNoZ2FtZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAUQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003d8t5qJQkn3NQ\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8t5qJQkn3NQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to the farm’s biggest little smash festival!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAim your cannon, line up the perfect shot, and smash through stacks of barrels, crates, jam jars, hay bales, fruit, veggies, and other farmyard goodies. Every cannon shot can send objects flying, trigger satisfying chain reactions, and bring the whole structure crashing down.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level is a playful physics puzzle where every shot matters. Look for the weak spot, choose the best angle, and shoot your way through clever stacks and tricky obstacles. Some levels can be cleared with one perfect smash, while others require careful aim, smart puzzle solving, and a few well-placed cannonballs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy satisfying physics-based destruction as wood tumbles, jars shatter, barrels roll, and colorful farm objects bounce across the level. With simple shoot-and-smash controls, Stack Smash is easy to learn, relaxing to play, and full of fun physics puzzles to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore a cozy farm festival filled with barns, market stalls, balloons, and cute farmhand characters. Take on new levels, discover new things to smash, and keep the festival moving with every successful shot.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fun aim, shoot, and smash cannon gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Satisfying physics-based destruction\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clever puzzle levels with limited shots\\u003cbr\\u003e- Colorful stacks, obstacles, and structures to knock down\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fruit, vegetables, hay, jars, barrels, crates, and more to smash\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cozy farm festival locations\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cute and friendly farmhand characters\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple controls with rewarding precision shots\\u003cbr\\u003e- Bright 3D visuals and playful animations\\u003cbr\\u003e- Quick puzzle levels for playing anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe cannon is loaded, the targets are stacked, and the farm festival is ready.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAim carefully, shoot the cannon, and smash your way through every level in Stack Smash!\"],\"Tripledot Studios Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DM6NoMDUBlbuVz_rJ_MmZgyEGW-KI19qufqbfNh5I7EXyrYrJM0K9BxEb2rWD1pVUK8tDKnERbRXLJTTHrZp\"],null,[110,204,255,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"