nt.com/0WOy-kCMCBxmSXUP5H7-8DXfPaaAlKvuDr2w3zA4DEY4nEDNh6RZEklVouPWkEGKUfQRoC6dhfRD5TSBaTK9hQ\"]]],\"Slow Mo Strike: Knives in Time\",[\"4.3\",4.298077],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.kayac.slow_mo_strike\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.kayac.slow_mo_strike\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.kayac.slow_mo_strike\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIH0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20ua2F5YWMuc2xvd19tb19zdHJpa2UQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Touch the screen — and time slows to a crawl.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTrace a line with your finger, and knives appear along your path — up to 30 of them, floating in frozen time. Let go, and the world snaps back to full speed: every knife flies at once, clearing the stage in a single neon burst. One-finger control, endless chain reactions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ One finger. That\\u0026#39;s all.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hold: time slows down\\u003cbr\\u003e- Trace: place up to 30 knives along your line\\u003cbr\\u003e- Release: they all fly at once!\\u003cbr\\u003eNo complicated controls — instantly satisfying from the very first touch.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ The longer you trace, the bigger the burst\\u003cbr\\u003eOne knife is nice. Thirty is spectacular. Clear the whole field in one perfectly timed release, and a cinematic slow-mo camera captures your finest moment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Think before you release\\u003cbr\\u003e- Set off reactive barrels for one huge chain reaction\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cut ropes to drop payloads from above\\u003cbr\\u003e- Break bridges and watch everything tumble into the pit\\u003cbr\\u003e- Send knives through a ×3 gate and they triple — timing is everything!\\u003cbr\\u003eThe right target, in the right order, at the right moment. Every stage is a little physics puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Targets that keep you thinking\\u003cbr\\u003eShielded targets, splitting targets, rolling giants, flying saucers, metal brutes that deflect your knives… every stage brings a new twist to outsmart.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ Unlock new ways to throw\\u003cbr\\u003eShurikens, boomerangs, blazing trails, chain lightning — each unlock changes how you draw your line.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e■ A world of pure neon\\u003cbr\\u003eMinimal, glowing, and satisfying — visual and audio feedback tuned for that perfect \\u0026quot;aaah\\u0026quot; moment.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for a quick, satisfying break — or a deep arcade session.\\u003cbr\\u003eFive minutes turns into \\u0026quot;just one more stage\\u0026quot; before you know it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStop time. Draw your line. Let them fly.\"],\"KAYAC Inc.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sTffzzo25bsyqf-av46BW5FEwj3sDX76KAP44AqZYIMet3CEkIk2aaRb7WGiSds-F-hGBDa296O6Jvd4FgB5\"],null,[0,0,4,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.kayac.slow_mo_strike\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom