spatial awareness.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a rewarding puzzle experience that requires both intuition and strategic thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe goal is simple, but you must never let your guard down.\\u003cbr\\u003eRemove the arrows in the correct order to clear them all from the cube.\\u003cbr\\u003eAnticipate your next move, visualize chain reactions, and discover the optimal sequence.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re a puzzle veteran or a beginner,\\u003cbr\\u003e“CubeAway - 3DPuzzle” delivers two distinct pleasures: the joy of thinking and a sense of calm tranquility.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle is a story that demands logic, patience, and precision.\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you remove all the arrows placed on the six sides?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTest your mental agility in a quiet, beautiful world.\\u003cbr\\u003e“CubeAway - 3DPuzzle” will become your new “healing time for the mind.”\"],\"GOODROID,Inc.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hP1-xCMINUDRjZIRfBKsz1uFRJu5unwY5kXfCQTeAkbW0X-nz6yepBO-x66chUyw9URurpS-uojWmz5qtNsU\"],null,[104,203,253,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1