\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:GTZEbDUzcnI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmhL8e4f_fKPYIbIbD_7xjhiLYhnJtwxMS9edkpmr0MPiYTsgHIQnS3PrjvEO-R9175dv3Rvh0LtCnB5Na9uMfXt7sSD0-L4YJ4GzzVAiGbuMeEM-DJ5lybRBt75wZ2pDETj9fqdZSdeobYcNA9liKQCndSz0-aa5ef4mB-QAguZbBwRjvDzPiWd-xCKEDYpVhkS2y4d-n2vWCUeCJxKRMux1Tq6LH1ZCWy4aWcYuxMl00-pp7CuEFBw4AvRMV2r1qDy3X8nVB0v5HyKV25JcO4viHkeBjqYUOBpx6QaBetwA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GTZEbDUzcnI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Melon Sandbox: Ultimate Sandbox of Chaos!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Melon Sandbox, a thrilling sandbox game where you unleash your creativity through brutal experiments with realistic ragdoll physics! No limits, no rules—just pure destructive fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e🧨 What can you do?\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Experiment with physics – Throw, smash, and test unique interactions between objects!\\u003cbr\\u003e🔫 Massive arsenal – Use firearms, melee weapons, explosives, and vehicles to tear through ragdolls!\\u003cbr\\u003e💣 Create chaos – Stab, crush, burn, or vaporize with custom devices!\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Open-world sandbox – Explore diverse maps and build your own playground of destruction!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready for endless mayhem in the ultimate ragdoll simulation! Get on board now and start experimenting! 🚀\"],\"playducky.com\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dKauIsgUpa8KZ094j_M4a0Eqr23DmhdFdr3HvMr5kFcFuSVC00ixH49XBfaZlXxkiHrb5DL0JZ8x69YnlO1edA\"],null,[54,49,45,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://