null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m1sGYPwnl1PpItYmAtlLMtUYbE6oi1KB2IiB4yq9ipZHZqtkqTO9qup2e5HACpJ45eXoffYOSD50EaWPbVrIfQ\"]]],\"RAID: Shadow Legends\",[\"4.6\",4.643611],\"Role Playing\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plarium.raidlegends\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plarium.raidlegends\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plarium.raidlegends\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIKUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBFwoVCPjt6azX5u6LQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIzCh0KF2NvbS5wbGFyaXVtLnJhaWRsZWdlbmRzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAD\"],[[[null,null,\"WzV2BD4c5zs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:WzV2BD4c5zs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:WzV2BD4c5zs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezm_1d0MZ_x1h5g-kAzj_gNgqazbAoF5Whmv0eVXuXTXD-EMd_WFxfBlK43s5E82D0fFNnOqLCfH9pjOA2azvYWvrT3Lykk9pqpMKu4ODsgz7P4w4zV4U9gsTyF40Zv4EpSxrSIop7j7NxchvxJBYkYvWs2KRQXAlNndDsh9y0X22Nz4Ekkcr8lTLkYXTJrZp0tSmz9aiGS-w1hPLuY5PNMoN2NNvz_6ljBG0MHRRX2tnqJaX32vf_5s5jiWfv302VdtgX8CvDUtShVwbnDQui1k17BiAbsgFwQFLtJyoOJqew\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WzV2BD4c5zs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Summon over 800 legendary heroes from 16 factions to battle bosses like fearsome dragons and colossal demons. Explore dungeons, enjoy turn-based multiplayer action, and master tactics to free Teleria in this epic role-playing game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTactical battles await in this turn-based dark fantasy role-playing game, where you can summon hundreds of Champions from 16 playable factions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFight the forces of the dark lord Siroth with your legendary band of immortal warriors. Train them for battle, craft the perfect strategy, and assemble the greatest raiding party ever seen.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEpic clashes await in online modes like the multiplayer Arena, where you can put your team of Champions against others in strategic RPG battles. Experiment with over 1+ million possible Champion builds, craft the ultimate team and their battle tactics, and be the best!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith over 5 years of free content updates and a community that grows bigger every day, join millions of players in the war to liberate Teleria from Siroth and his legions. Become a hero of legend!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e| Enjoy deep RPG features |\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect powerful Champions\\u003cbr\\u003eSummon 800+ warriors from 16 factions in this tactical role-playing game. Call upon orcs, knights, elves, and more dark fantasy creatures to defeat any threat that stands in your way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStrategic turn-based RPG gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEquip your Champions with amazing artifacts to aid them in battle. Rank them up to unleash devastating skills, AOE attacks, magic powers and more as you lead them in combat.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFight epic boss battles\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you dare take on the Magma Dragon, the Fire Knight, or the Ice Golem? Vanquish challenging bosses in dangerous dungeons for loot, XP, and special Champion drops. Then, in classic turn-based RPG style, fight them again for more powerful gear!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the visceral 3D artwork\\u003cbr\\u003eBeautiful, fully-rendered 3D heroes offer stunning detail down to the cracks in their armor. Marvel at a vivid fantasy world with thousands of unique skill and attack animations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin forces with your Clan\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with fellow players and take on challenges like the fearsome Demon Lord with Clans! Battle other Clans in special tournaments and show them that they’re out of your league.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFace the multiplayer PvP Arena\\u003cbr\\u003eGo head-to-head with other players in fierce turn-based combat to unlock special gear. Rise through the ranks and become an Arena legend.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDevelop and manage your Bastion\\u003cbr\\u003eUpgrade your own personal fortress to manage your Shards and ready your Champions for dungeon runs, multiplayer arena combat, and the story campaign.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClear our massive PvE Campaign map\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience epic dark fantasy done right through 12 spectacular RPG locations spread over a sprawling, fully-voiced story campaign. Heed your heroic duty and conquer the forces of Darkness.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into a deep fantasy world\\u003cbr\\u003eLearn about Teleria’s heroes and villains with our growing collection of Champion bios. Then, check out our animated limited series, RAID: Call of the Arbiter, on YouTube!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease note:\\u003cbr\\u003eIn-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items): Items are available for purchase in this fantasy MMO role-playing game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRAID Official Website: https://plarium.com/\\u003cbr\\u003eRAID Support: raid.support@plarium.com\\u003cbr\\u003eOur RPG Community: https://plarium.com/forum/en/raid-shadow-legends/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://plarium.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy/\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://plarium.com/en/legal/terms-of-use/\"],\"Plarium Global Ltd\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/49nom060KVE8YiqOmndIEPdzQGWs8d3YbGkKxH3c3ESBJRBdBGP6pE4L0KUbelFCs8ToRCwzVYGv66RupDVH\"],null,[13,20,38,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Mild Blood, Suggestive Themes\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plarium.raidlegends\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plarium.raidlegends\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $199.99 per item\",[false],[]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Role Playing\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Turn-based RPG\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Battling\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.youmusic.magictiles\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AHmha0RTMkNchGnLfchmuFzdC0EVE9WRxVjNXIGJDUhknEMmucwFdW9noBSinYdq_sdITW1LKqNE_nlhfjRR\"],null,[243,151,254,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZfF407AO4GH4N4XyLNU3clxKwsrrbiuAiZ09j_Jygc_t3CnOkl1QSTH7ZZkzB9jT2g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rvU9MgN8aLR48iTizs_lGBIN9F4shZ1Uk-181IKIMCLo2gdR7IhwiVmRgPcBT2Jpg94\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0ZABBtNFbj3vDtL3d2ct0iAKZR5FT-fjaRkXYteIq5iaI1HwBQIkRGb_3ccczR-X1M3d_8BNp-rt9EgP687J_g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/U-gAz8IPNcpF8IaNaOwMByR2gqH1OVzrWBGhm5YNUpZztKp1-pRM88vZYW8pgIptfpQ\"]]