VcwgJbEjfepdqxslmaj7CekRm9rT61jLw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VzcixnqC_UA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Magic Tiles 3 – The Ultimate Piano Game \\u0026amp; Music Game Experience! 🎶\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into Magic Tiles 3, the definitive piano game loved by millions, best music game all the time. Magic Tiles 3 blends rhythmic gameplay, vibrant visuals, and a massive library of official and licensed music. Prepare to unleash your inner pianist in this addictive song game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTap Piano Tiles, Feel the Music!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMagic Tiles 3 is an intuitive yet challenging piano game. Tap the black piano tiles as they cascade down, matching the beat of the game songs. Miss a tile, and the music stops. Hit every note perfectly to create beautiful melodies, experiencing the magic of piano playing. This engaging mechanic makes Magic Tiles 3 one of the most rewarding music games. It’s about feeling the rhythm in this top-tier song game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnbeatable Library of Official and Licensed Music!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMagic Tiles 3 stands out with its huge, growing library of 45,000+ game songs. We feature official and licensed music from chart-toppers across Pop, EDM, Disco, Violin, and Hip-Hop. There\\u0026#39;s a song game experience for every taste. New hits and classics are added frequently, ensuring this premier piano game stays fresh. You won\\u0026#39;t find such a diverse, quality collection of official and licensed music in many other music games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Magic Tiles 3 is the Piano Game You Need:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Massive Song Catalogue: Enjoy 45,000+ game songs! Featuring official and licensed music, Magic Tiles 3 offers endless musical fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Authentic Piano Game Feel: Designed for piano lovers and rhythm gamers, the piano tiles gameplay provides a uniquely satisfying piano game experience. Feel the music under your fingertips.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multiple Difficulty Levels: From casual play to hardcore challenges, Magic Tiles 3 adapts. Master easy tunes or conquer the fastest piano tiles tracks. Push your skills in this dynamic music game.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Thrilling Multiple Player Battle Mode: Don\\u0026#39;t just play alone! Engage in real-time multiple-player competitions. Challenge friends or global players in the intense battle mode. Prove your rhythm skills in this exciting multiple-player arena, a key feature differentiating this piano game.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play Anywhere - Game Offline Mode: No internet? No problem! Magic Tiles 3 includes a fantastic Game Offline mode. Enjoy your favorite game songs and practice piano tiles anywhere. This reliable Game Offline feature means the music never has to stop, perfect for commutes or travel.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Game Free Access: Start playing now! Magic Tiles 3 is a Game Free to download and play. Access a vast selection of game songs and core piano game features without initial cost. Enjoy hours of entertainment in this superb Game Free music game. (Optional purchases available).\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fun for All Ages - Great Game for Kids: With intuitive controls and diverse music, Magic Tiles 3 is a fantastic Game for kids and adults. It’s a family-friendly music game promoting rhythm and fun. If you need a safe, engaging Game for kid, this is an excellent choice.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rewards \\u0026amp; Customization: Keep playing this engaging song game to unlock gifts, new game songs, and challenges. Personalize your piano game journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stunning Visuals \\u0026amp; Smooth Play: Immerse yourself in a beautiful music game with vibrant graphics and flawless performance, enhancing your connection to the official and licensed music. It truly feels like the best music game all the time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the Global Magic Tiles 3 Community!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBe part of the massive Magic Tiles 3 player base. Share scores, challenge friends in multiple player battle mode, and celebrate music. See why it\\u0026#39;s ranked among the top music games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed Help?\\u003cbr\\u003eEmail: magictiles3.support@amanotes.com\\u003cbr\\u003eOr use Settings \\u0026gt; FAQ \\u0026amp; Support in the piano game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLegal:\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: amanotes.com/terms-and-conditions/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: amanotes.com/privacy-policy/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Magic Tiles 3 Now - It\\u0026#39;s Game Free!\\u003cbr\\u003eTap the piano tiles, master incredible game songs using official and licensed music, compete in battle mode, enjoy Game Offline.\"],\"AMANOTES PTE. LTD.\",\"500,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GvD6i9BslDcUIO8QgprbfxuQwa7HdCwWAUF_OHh72vLLWa3hTzZvnGoCZ2K_WySV7rnx5iWD-l7Qzd82ght4\"],null,[156,69,232,255]],null,[\"Everyone 10+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/csiz76udPjXmaJddU_1sanHGlQAAbKkvlprK3DSUNmwu1nY3U6qnXRrI2IDMaivooYK1x11oxz3PEO4z\"]],[null,\"Lyrics\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bxs95MghtAOuZR_LPwVCUmUPYEvXsGVOH3chF1OCX0-Ns_S0qdHnzml2CGCgOGbYlftKsmt9gtpxLb8U\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.youmusic.magictiles\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.youmusic.magictiles\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0