dJ-CxiDtVfHJnkiAl70QW6aYgzH9RJ-wqurL8lsDi3dP6A9YBuqCos2oQDsN1KlH92Iv-22sN5HY\"]]],\"Cube Land Puzzle Game\",[\"4.5\",4.5442176],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rotatelab.cubeblast\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.rotatelab.cubeblast\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rotatelab.cubeblast\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IMEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwodChdjb20ucm90YXRlbGFiLmN1YmVibGFzdBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dvcnsxpTRgjA\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vcnsxpTRgjA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Cube Land Puzzle Game is a colorful 3D block puzzle game where every tap turns into a satisfying blast. Match color blasters with the right pixel style voxel blocks, clear cube structures, and solve clever puzzle boards one move at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSATISFYING BLOCK PUZZLE ACTION\\u003cbr\\u003e• Bright pixel style voxel blocks with smooth blast effects\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple one tap controls for quick play sessions\\u003cbr\\u003e• Short levels built for relaxing breaks\\u003cbr\\u003e• No timers and no pressure, think at your own pace\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play offline anytime, no wifi needed\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRELAXING 3D BRAIN TEASERS\\u003cbr\\u003eCube Land Puzzle Game is easy to start and rewarding to master. Each level gives you a small set of blasters and a colorful cube structure. Plan your moves, match colors carefully, and clear the board without getting stuck.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, new shapes, colors, and puzzle layouts make each level feel different. The challenge grows gradually, so the game stays simple to understand while still giving your brain a real puzzle to solve. It is built for players who like clear rules, clever levels, and that satisfying moment when the final block disappears.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY PLAY CUBE LAND?\\u003cbr\\u003e• Color match puzzle action with a fresh voxel look\\u003cbr\\u003e• Satisfying blast effects and relaxing visual feedback\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple controls, and a steady difficulty curve\\u003cbr\\u003e• Bright 3D cube worlds for one handed play\\u003cbr\\u003e• Great for fans of block puzzle games, block jam, block blast, pixel flow, color sort, tile sort, bubble pop, brain teasers, pixel puzzles, and offline puzzle games\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCube Land Puzzle Game is not a timed racing puzzle. Take a short break, think through the board, and choose the blaster order that clears the puzzle cleanly. If you enjoy relaxing puzzle games that are easy to learn, satisfying to play, and smart enough to make you plan ahead, Cube Land Puzzle Game is made for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Cube Land Puzzle Game and start blasting colorful cube puzzles today.\"],\"Rotatelab Yazilim ve Bilisim A.S.\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y8LgQfoOuWRqpapEyOE-23X22mPm3nXVQMcE4OPca2mUw8Cx_1cX8b_l9F2xcQqEFRQ8lvLXP5LIsXLQWflh\"],null,[255,179,21,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]