"4.8\",4.7737575],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.blockbash\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tripledot.blockbash\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.blockbash\"]],[\"qgJhGl8INEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwodChdjb20udHJpcGxlZG90LmJsb2NrYmFzaBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"lvGREXLDlN4\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:lvGREXLDlN4?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:lvGREXLDlN4\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlxasGvwMDpPpSPEpEAtXXDf-RIckpxOc0aR4Qr-phySJWDmAWh2zfXFNtx_hddCPk3o4Yp0YFYUxjSmHxLhhRRXsGze2XlcgsLvsE8PrlDv_w5QsibS1prWY2DEfjfEEfE5iF6VZqdFxATwApI_yL-uCfjQvix1lKIt5g5CFfbxDBqRALCd1Sylu-2V1KyVriEilQWSZWZmvaCtSi_EiHx_ruhbHMpX7reRNCVx71Xtms99wF6HU-6NSBsKvYEiOpSFHP8jLNpm1yFu9yfHW1aSYWy4HbKJwrAxSqehp7GKg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lvGREXLDlN4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Woodoku Blast: The Mesmerizing Colorful Block Puzzle Game!\\u003cbr\\u003ePrepare yourself for an addictive puzzle adventure like no other, where you can blast blocks on  Sudoku grid. Woodoku Blast is here to captivate your senses and challenge your puzzle-solving skills, even offline and with no Wifi. Dive into a world of vibrant colors, creative challenges, and endless block puzzle fun – all in the palm of your hand.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to Learn, Challenging to Master:\\u003cbr\\u003eWoodoku Blast\\u0026#39;s simple and intuitive gameplay makes becoming a block master accessible to players of all ages. Place colorful blocks on the block puzzle grid, clear lines on the Sudoku inspired layout, and score points to progress through the levels, all while enjoying the game offline with no Wifi required.. But don\\u0026#39;t be fooled by its ease; as you advance, the block games become more intricate, requiring strategic thinking and clever moves to conquer. Can you rise to the challenge and become the block master?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBoundless Levels of Colorful Fun:\\u003cbr\\u003eWith a vast array of levels, Woodoku Blast ensures you\\u0026#39;ll never run out of exciting block games to solve. Explore diverse landscapes and themes, from tranquil gardens to futuristic cities, each offering a unique and immersive puzzle-solving experience that is playable offline with no Wifi required.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax and Recharge:\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed a break? Woodoku Blast offers a soothing and meditative puzzle experience that you can enjoy offline. Unwind, clear your mind, and recharge your mental energy while surrounded by delightful visuals and calming sounds anytime and anywhere with no Wifi required!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStay Tuned for Exciting Events:\\u003cbr\\u003eThe fun never stops in Woodoku Blast! Keep an eye out for thrilling events, limited-time challenges, and exclusive rewards on the Sudoku-inspired grid. Participate to put your skills to the test and earn unique prizes that set you apart as a Woodoku Blast block master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to Embark on a Colorful Puzzle Adventure? Download Woodoku Blast’s Block Games Now!\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready for a mesmerizing and challenging puzzle experience? Download Woodoku Blast now and immerse yourself in a world of colorful blocks, creative challenges, and endless excitement. Blast blocks on a Sudoku grid and show off your strategic skills, design your puzzles, and conquer the world of Woodoku Blast!\"],\"Tripledot Studios Limited\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IgcMAhwGgpH9-Hkz0Mgld6qyJr163svZEIrrMQ0Y14_IKs4PD8QQf