ASo-yKI9Rve4yY7XjrHnMv5cJ50yypR6L_DoMDA4ibxJlKYy8E8afB5_YsXM0Sf2SaBhDRHXdY5z8daoF4fg\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OsewG97KR8hqMaSZzgPYfZhAvB7b145OfYao9nSpV1OeJm-jFzqVL6ZaInN5zztj0iVOQ9c2ztqaLt1NCwC66Xw\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_HWStAFNS-_barY__DWMwmL9FmLdGD_a1CduoItg_mqLX7o17tZcJ5Gvho0greN2ESeW2HbTEkWcJt3QekV-qw\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/A_8sjCgzqhAyGPL9i_7bEbylZtyc7yHw_i9LA5qXAB0C0in9eY_mvHL28t2691luDYckn5XhGjHQa3C0yltS\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bRrXKR1ahg5kwWYTbO-N1tJnisH0qqAYkzMuaptcE6ajk7lv4oqrcWb2NRo7OWWEebFCTnn5c7Ty6eOZUUYhJw\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zkFAu-yh07P3hb7EZ1AA7f_aKEQ7LpVzYe62mOkwcPF6wW5FW7I0VtS6mBwfXNnn7EpaWtMklby_i-JHr7dVag\"]],[null,2,[2064,2752],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6LeC0HLPciEJz9JpQmYg4f8UTlXRrTd1UtwKw30R70SLRuaS2tJD1ikxAvIwMNjGokNTwCEJ1aPjFRDVO5RLxg\"]]],\"Toca Boca World\",[\"4.3\",4.349341],\"Educational\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\"]],[\"qgKMARqJAQg5ShMIrZXW/Y6/lgMVhXmEBh0ogilS+gEsCg0IABIJCgVlbi1VUxAAEhsSBAgBEAAYmJWe1bTkycBzIOy1g/7LvYPokQGIAgK6AjYKIAoaY29tLnRvY2Fib2NhLnRvY2FsaWZld29ybGQQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEATKAgQIAhAB\"],[[[null,null,\"zjdUU4c5Fzs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:zjdUU4c5Fzs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:zjdUU4c5Fzs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlvHnMFriFlibV-9NHCYYQ3v0jugZCy_ga4uufZktGuAOLlsE2HLYAN5p1jihWlc03KSV7cbAuJVXNc3OOst2DAO0iQ8i39x4Fv9DdLF-vHcJ0n5dEcGvrDg-SXvYi_AgBI302Y7rX885IMqZ5ba76KRWvzLAmQm-jUgv8FWypUQFDnTdtuX_KFAvRbkttdxifrAOmh0IjNHAvDxEbESZwIjJNh6BWEsadn6YzgC3_1auEcIXJkfRjYS8w6Lh2FhRJOf6RWIQhApfMOQ69KolroCQtWMudvayyu3E5Gs-GHDA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zjdUU4c5Fzs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to a world where your imagination comes first! ✨ Make up stories in the colourful locations, and customize your own buildings – you can style your own outfits too!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eToca Boca World is all about open-ended play. 🥳 There are no rules, just colorful ways to be creative. Build your world, and fill it with characters, pets, shops and all kinds of houses!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlmost everything inside Toca Boca World is customizable, or you can jump straight in and play! 🛝 Try running a café, become a hair stylist, camp in the forest or throw a rooftop party. It’s a safe universe where kids explore and discover at their own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR OWN WORLD\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏬 Explore apartments, shops and hangouts in Bop City \\u003cbr\\u003e👭 Design your own characters with unique hair, faces, outfits and accessories \\u003cbr\\u003e🏡  Decorate spaces with Home Designer. Change the walls, furniture and colors \\u003cbr\\u003e🐶 Add pets, food, toys and silly items so each place feels like your own\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY YOUR WAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤘 Create your own stories. Become a chef, spa owner, rockstar, or teacher \\u003cbr\\u003e🏭  Mix and match locations to invent your own mini games and challenges \\u003cbr\\u003e🚌 Move characters between homes, schools, shops and secret spots \\u003cbr\\u003e🏥 Try roleplay like running a pet hospital, opening a fashion studio or hosting a sleepover\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE, DISCOVER AND COLLECT\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💎 Find hidden gems, secret rooms and surprises in the locations\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Visit the Post Office every Friday for free gifts including furniture, outfits, decorations and pets\\u003cbr\\u003e🌎 Grow your world as new packs and locations are added to the in-app shop\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMADE FOR KIDS, EASY TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👍  Simple, touch-first controls make it usable for all reading abilities\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 No time limits or high scores. Just creative play\\u003cbr\\u003e🌊  Open-ended design lets kids follow their own curiosity\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSAFE, SINGLE-PLAYER AND AD-FREE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😊 Toca Boca World is a single-player kids\\u0026#39; game, not chat and no strangers\\u003cbr\\u003e🤝 COPPA compliant, and carefully designed as a safe space for kids\\u003cbr\\u003e❌ No third-party ads ever. Play is never interrupted by adverts or pop-ups\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAWARD-WINNING FUN FROM TOCA BOCA\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur game has been recognized as App of the Year and an Editor’s Choice for its playful design and dedication to kids’ safety. Our award-winning kids game can be downloaded on phones, tablets and computers, with optional in-app purchases for families who want to expand their world. We believe in the power of play. That’s why Toca Boca World is built as a high-quality, ad-free game that lets children explore, create and imagine freely.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSTAY CONNECTED\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover new locations, events and collaborations by following Toca Boca World on social media and inside the in-app shop. There’s always a new story waiting.\"],\"Toca Boca\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"Ages 6-12\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6O0MIKi-3jljHyPUlYWFuLtH4ccoAWSYX9a-14nDbOxOclDE5Vk8WIM4Z58_1ONT6xc5fCAvHgRITZXa6ZffdQ\"],null,[132,209,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tocaboca.tocalifeworld\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $199.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Educational\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Life\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"puzzle.yarn.fever.unravel.puzzle\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EwNZrV06YdtHeQcJmEOqb2IaBDMmZHzZmS4dF3tWMNNBzNyP2cfEWvK9i1y461Kv2k3D-CfsEuTbAEOXAx52jw\"],null,[255,171,202,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/z6RCdHPBB7Ubsnsq2FGepfpLUu40KVCghbUiBn4sVU5efGzfwfS693V2qGNH0AMDph88-VWIJR7pHS2faF-aRQ\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GFLMkXLRi9pZAzFE1ZZlO5KfbJUA2yhTER-ZD6OJODVKSoJ_HQC3lNR6oSsMJHdTXQT98Hnc6WgA883b-Atee-s\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TWzaepwWXASlc_htqWfj4AtJTxjrxjcQP1xF6fP5DOOHdbtbFiUKHSkTHsd-ygur9WNuYkSP4nSDCuOa