e testing your logic and organizational skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧵 Gameplay Overview:\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’ll need to collect colorful threads from various knitted objects and place them into matching colored boxes. Think carefully before placing your threads into temporary slots, and use your strategic mind to avoid filling up the available space. As you progress, you’ll unlock new levels, each more complex than the last.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Key Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenging \\u0026amp; Rewarding Puzzles: Test your logical thinking as you sort threads and complete intricate puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Boosters to Help You Progress: Get support from helpful tools like New Hole, Magic Box and Broom 🧹 when you face tough levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Customization Options: Tailor the game to your liking by adding extra boxes and slots for a personalized experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Beautiful Graphics: Relaxing and calming visuals of colorful threads and knitted objects that add to the fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧘\\u200d♀️ Why You’ll Enjoy It:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Perfect blend of relaxation and mental challenge to keep you engaged.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy-to-learn gameplay that becomes progressively more challenging.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Ideal for quick play sessions or long, relaxing gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Great for puzzle lovers who enjoy sorting games and testing their brain.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧶 Ready to Unravel the Fun?\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Yarn Fever! Unravel Puzzle and dive into this soothing yet challenging world of colorful threads and exciting puzzles. Start organizing, sorting, and unlocking the joy of unraveling these fun puzzles while listening to some good music! 🧶🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us on Facebook: \\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/yarnfever.unravelpuzzle/ \\u003cbr\\u003eJoin our Community: \\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://shorturl.at/DWdVT\"],\"Brave HK Limited\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",