\\u003dcolor.number.paint.pixle.art.sort.jigsaw\"]],[\"qgJyGnAIPUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRAouCihjb2xvci5udW1iZXIucGFpbnQucGl4bGUuYXJ0LnNvcnQuamlnc2F3EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"9LLAMmAsbtU\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:9LLAMmAsbtU?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:9LLAMmAsbtU\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezndbeLqLabGpXuamzKmz_-kvh_9OF8OVk2FCiqc6akgKfjJvUhzBydA4985GyZvnUV9jlkFfu12o1DdrbEi50V2ll34G4kI5c02xQyCXi78jsvIWtC7z3lfmHPgrPP1WfhjMREXk-ml9C1UNDiEP4DWvb9byWSuAXG0V_SbzpOfV12FHwdjTfFcJZeL56eo-zoFplV_7Sl6BvqvCx5XULyA6PHNUfhmGGQfgbGkz-k_OUumg7pZNu77stoJpY8l0rcPByQyINJ4AyR_QdfFsRDLcVRUkZhrjU8uFpTy4hDD4A\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9LLAMmAsbtU/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Jewel Coloring: Sparkle \\u0026amp; Create with Pixel Art Puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter a vibrant world of glowing jewels where creativity and puzzle-solving come together in perfect harmony! Designed for easy, relaxing fun, this one-of-a-kind experience combines color sorting, pixel art creation, and satisfying casual gameplay all in one. With smooth, user-friendly controls and levels that gently grow more engaging, it’s the perfect way to unwind while keeping your mind active.\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play: Color, Sort, \\u0026amp; Craft Beautiful Pixel Art\\u003cbr\\u003e- Sort Jewels by Color with Ease: Just tap and arrange sparkling jewels into their matching color groups. No confusing rules or complicated steps—just simple, enjoyable sorting action.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Plan \\u0026amp; Organize Your Workspace: Keep your jewel shelf neatly arranged and think ahead to clear each puzzle efficiently. Every small choice helps you complete the picture smoothly.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Uncover Stunning Pixel Art Masterpieces: As you sort and place each jewel, watch as hidden pixel art designs slowly come to life. Every level reveals a brand-new, dazzling image to enjoy.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy Endless Creative Satisfaction: There’s no pressure—just calm, rewarding gameplay that turns every moment into a peaceful artistic break.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat Makes Jewel Coloring Special\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of Unique Levels \\u0026amp; Themes: Enjoy a huge variety of pixel art puzzles, with fresh themes and exclusive limited-time collections added regularly.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Polished Visuals \\u0026amp; Immersive Feedback: Bright, detailed 3D jewels, crisp visual effects, and satisfying audio feedback make every tap feel smooth and rewarding.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play Anywhere, No Wi-Fi Needed: Play offline whenever you have free time. Pause, resume, and play at your own speed, no internet connection required.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy for Everyone, Fun for All Ages: Simple mechanics make it accessible for casual players, while thoughtful level design keeps it interesting for puzzle and art fans alike.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You’ll Love Jewel Coloring\\u003cbr\\u003e- Gentle Brain Exercise: Sorting, planning, and matching help support focus, logic, and spatial thinking—all while having fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Natural Stress Relief: Lose yourself in calming, rhythmic jewel sorting that helps you relax and unwind after a busy day.\\u003cbr\\u003e- For All Skill Levels: Whether you’re looking for a quick distraction or a creative hobby, it’s made for kids, adults, and everyone in between.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Jewel Coloring today and step into a bright, peaceful world of color, jewels, and pixel art. Create, sort, and relax—your next artistic adventure is just a tap away!\"],\"TaTa Game Technology Limited\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HSb66W3Mx1_rZcoHt24hmMuEbkaCBn2xQNJPMZBxFwwC1-IuZQIeU6NwUBGLemCl6KF0X9nDhJRBJTYQz18t\"],null,[253,213,213,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0L