5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoYChJjb20uY29tYm8ua25vY2tvdXQQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAMKBAgFEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Ready, aim, and clear the board! Knock Out is a fun and satisfying block-shooting puzzle game where every shot brings you closer to victory. Blast colorful blocks, topple clever structures, and clear every last piece to complete the level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFire matching blocks to create explosive chain reactions. Knock down towers, break through obstacles, and watch satisfying physics-driven destruction unfold with every perfect shot. Each level presents a new puzzle to solve, challenging you to think ahead and make every move count.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple to learn, hard to put down. Whether you\\u0026#39;re clearing rows of colorful blocks or bringing down giant constructions piece by piece, Knock Out! delivers quick, rewarding gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e-Addictive shoot-and-clear puzzle gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e-Satisfying block destruction and chain reactions\\u003cbr\\u003e-Hundreds of handcrafted levels to master\\u003cbr\\u003e-Unique structures, obstacles, and level objectives\\u003cbr\\u003e-Smooth controls and rewarding precision shots\\u003cbr\\u003e-Colorful 3D visuals and playful environments\\u003cbr\\u003e-Easy to learn, challenging to master\\u003cbr\\u003e-Relaxing gameplay with exciting puzzle moments\\u003cbr\\u003e-No internet required! Play anytime, anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery block is standing in your way. Every shot matters.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Knock Out! and see if you can clear every block from the board!\"],\"Combo Game\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xJ528-ovQiqz94Ygk3KbGom-vGrVh4RxiVwkGOnFwrjBNMXkQx2q5zpRvtH5nB89lq5imh5TW9UO3jFsNvvMYrM\"],null,[32,152,241,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",