20,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-WsVR5EBTHNRSh0oc-B7QvwFD9ZAcjN2E8v3FFyLNOs5j-Oz9ZxIIktks26RtzbZvu-iO5UhleDSWV5ITmxd0AI\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0I7Tmk500mkCV2ivxJmw-m0W2ArPJlarqn-6YuG203hghSja-ZRQ_5ffSUWmWKIUvdJFDWGlCasYX1cRDFpKaA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/04ZIq7MAdSQefqv0j8EP7unB0xkTqYhCeoo432gnrkyCPYs8xW-yd_anE-2Af9MxziktjmqRL1nXOok3_9k3sQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iLydwZZboJ1Bmupi6qcDZXGBRKIttxZYhPBnngFZonUY5thgpNwFuzJMsAFn9DZeFVyCMjDHTsJtTiowTkCi-g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1t-DuPuwv8MmBcmfamk1U9UAX3DyD4nh6H1LsmRZerqAMquRnZOPO1NaCL6qtgsFfaaijNZbJz2t0rzyJfQyrw\"]]],\"Color Block Jam\",[\"4.1\",4.0899973],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.GybeGames.ColorBlockJam\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.GybeGames.ColorBlockJam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.GybeGames.ColorBlockJam\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIP0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNwohChtjb20uR3liZUdhbWVzLkNvbG9yQmxvY2tKYW0QARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAM\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"tqxl-WbaD0I\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:tqxl-WbaD0I?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:tqxl-WbaD0I\",null,[1920,1080],null,null,\"AXH1eznaQtOtUY2ngmB27oMjUGSTPVN4oSP1n3onHGyrsIlDIFUboVNeOUMR3LPAatWSg1hRwsrxGjLC3bxV05GwsRjnETu_5kNfiWENcOnqa_PqLHuthXh9MIKmaK0YZfizpZqs2NIIKsCfV826vxNktRqdcEnzNPquQ2GCqsOMEdcha7bQQ5oYkP38iQHlraYYR0YAWxxpuvs_J5rq4kDlRuwq9fBVJs7bLZQIb3DoaE_3JSBkh0_UEPVjBILzFMSDe3-UdpsTnaZEUN12oo9sHJeOlehAJE9wLNYhyM-XIWmj1w\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tqxl-WbaD0I/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Color Block Jam: The Ultimate Puzzle Adventure\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your puzzle-solving skills in Color Block Jam, the ultimate block puzzle game that will challenge your mind and keep you hooked for hours! In this captivating and strategically engaging game, your goal is simple: move colorful blocks to their matching colored doors to clear the way. However, each level introduces new obstacles and challenges, requiring you to think carefully and plan your moves to master every puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless Puzzles, Limitless Fun\\u003cbr\\u003ePrepare yourself for puzzles designed to test both your logic and strategic thinking. As you progress, the levels become increasingly intricate and creative, keeping you engaged with new challenges at every turn. Whether you\\u0026#39;re sliding blocks to clear space or navigating through tough barriers, the thrill of solving each puzzle intensifies.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e* Unique Block Puzzle Mechanics: Every puzzle offers a distinct challenge! Slide colorful blocks and clear paths by matching them to their corresponding colored doors. Each level tests your ability to think critically and act strategically and plan the perfect moves.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Hundreds of Levels to Explore: With countless levels to conquer, you\\u0026#39;ll never run out of new and exciting puzzles. Each one is designed to push your problem-solving skills further, offering hours of stimulating gameplay. Whether you’re a puzzle enthusiast or just looking to pass the time, there\\u0026#39;s a level for everyone.\\u003cbr\\u003e*Challenging Obstacles and New Gameplay Mechanics: As you advance, you\\u0026#39;ll face new types of obstacles that require clever solutions. With every level, you\\u0026#39;ll unlock fresh gameplay twists and fun surprises that will keep you coming back for more!\\u003cbr\\u003e* Strategic Gameplay: The key to success in Color Block Jam is carefully planning your strategy and thinking ahead. Use your moves wisely, and you’ll clear even the most difficult puzzles with ease.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Beautiful Visuals and Smooth Controls: Enjoy a vibrant world of colorful blocks and stunning visuals that make solving each puzzle a visual treat. The simple yet intuitive controls ensure a seamless and enjoyable experience for players of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Earn Rewards and Unlock New Levels: Clear tricky levels to earn rewards and unlock new, more challenging puzzles. Each victory brings you closer to becoming a puzzle master, and the satisfaction of conquering every block-filled challenge is unbeatable.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e* Slide the blocks: Move the colorful blocks to their matching colored doors.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Solve each puzzle: Plan your moves carefully to clear the path and complete the puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e*Think strategically: Every level presents a new challenge, so use your wits to find the most efficient way to clear the blocks.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Unlock new challenges: With each level you complete, new and more difficult obstacles open up, keeping the excitement going!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love Color Block Jam:\\u003cbr\\u003e* A must try for puzzle-lovers: With a variety of levels, challenges, and obstacles, Color Block Jam offers a dynamic puzzle experience that’s easy to learn but hard to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e*A Perfect Balance of Fun and Challenge: Solve puzzles before running out of time, test your speed and skills in more complex levels. This game is the perfect blend of relaxation and brain-teasing fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Sharpen Your Mind: Plan each move strategically, think ahead, and make every decision wisely.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re a strategic thinker or someone who loves solving creative block puzzles, Color Block Jam offers endless fun. Get ready for a puzzle adventure where your skills are tested, your creativity is unleashed, and your puzzle-solving abilities will be put to the ultimate test. Download NOW and start your Color Block Jam adventure today!\"],\"Rollic Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sxauVdqkVP-z6Zn-KDRcQejVUDyWbn0SAkFAnWQB1TFlqk_Mz8wiJwvJh3UXX6wPVYWZh9Nctk6Lb8q-ySAIzg\"],null,[42,95,24,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.GybeGames.ColorBlockJam\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.GybeGames.ColorBlockJam\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $179.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.arrow.out\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lY-IKzG8bhPfrpUBTlmx6WRI4R4MM_vUFwUDvKmxBfAZtuVDtUfo3-XOKNG5sXmMx6x2Rgoo4qc-OUYjHrP0hA\"],null,[3,27,58,255],null,null,null