bi1VUxAAugI0Ch4KGGNvbS5wZW9wbGVmdW4ud29yZHNlYXJjaBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"Hj2WIBN1zd0\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:Hj2WIBN1zd0?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:Hj2WIBN1zd0\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmhDm6CoWKMmlj-_LMS7_6PO9iUJp4aRXVaiyVJs7O6Ub5RjJIfuPaQeFiwGxKbZsjf7SgdpCmUOLE_oKksHH3uh1eskyzRoiHAK_j9vLJhHNhNMLLp_z7fohNro43fD73UzYnKWDx8U2euejcbKshld-pe-Y4WkdZ4EnXlY-OLoUcdqXZ3fmIbDdCFY1fk07X3CjD8WKFUjeioN_Ugdxlh1UzfFStIBrmZTg3i_n1fb8mK7tgxfYV-kJD-_qv5JbtIMoPnB0lqrI0t5fWMRgpYpN_t0hFunO_lumygGXJShA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Hj2WIBN1zd0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"💕Would you like to relax, exercise your brain, and expand your vocabulary-all at the same time? With \\u003cb\\u003e Wordscapes Search \\u003c/b\\u003e, the NEWEST game from the makers of Wordscapes, you can! These incredibly engaging word search puzzles are brain-blasting fun! 💕\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect letters to find every word on the board and sail through thousands of classic puzzle levels set against stunning nature backgrounds. Training your brain has never been easier —or more relaxing. Once you start playing, you just won\\u0026#39;t be able to put it down!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFEATURES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e➤Escape and train your brain by visiting the beautiful destinations of \\u003cb\\u003e Wordscapes Search \\u003c/b\\u003e!\\u003cbr\\u003e➤CHALLENGE your brain and vocabulary \\u003cbr\\u003e➤LOTS OF LEVELS. Play 1000’s of puzzle board levels- with more coming soon\\u003cbr\\u003e➤EARN POWER-UPS. Use boosters to find words when you get stuck\\u003cbr\\u003e➤ COLLECT BONUS POINTS. Find extra words to earn rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e➤ Think you can find every word? These word search puzzles are easy at the start, but get challenging fast!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWHY PLAY?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCalling all brainiacs, quiz whizzes, puzzle pros, and crossword fiends! If you like to relax and unwind with a crossword puzzle, trivia and quiz games, board games, scrabble, or solitaire —you’ll love \\u003cb\\u003eWordscapes Search\\u003c/b\\u003e! It’s easy at first, but gets challenging fast. Can you beat the game? Start playing and find out!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e Wordscapes Search \\u003c/b\\u003e is a modern twist on classic word search puzzles, combining the features of crossword, scrabble style, word find, and word connect puzzle games. This BRAND NEW word game is proudly brought to you by PeopleFun, the makers of Wordscapes. Join the PeopleFun family and connect with us!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA bit of trivia….\\u003cbr\\u003eQuick quiz! How many words are in the English language? Answer: about 170,000 in current use. And how many words are in the average person’s vocabulary? Answer: between 20 and 30 thousand. Is your vocabulary above average? Start training your brain and become a word search brainiac: download \\u003cb\\u003e Wordscapes Search \\u003c/b\\u003e and start your word puzzle adventure today! With 1000’s of puzzle board levels you’ll never be bored!\"],\"PeopleFun\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hfYY5UOGvQRoI2Z_rfZtLr4QlF0nzASWGgYfinXNMoi-Yi9C3MFkduTprOVvbF0laSZ6uMari-3-aPCWNkVY\"],null,[24,8,96,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,