9R9DQXKyw_-LoUyA3KHjqIIbTiJr70Jg\"]]],\"Bus Fever! Car Jam Escape\",[\"4.5\",4.4603176],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIRUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQofChlncmlkcGx1cy5idXNqYW0uY2FycHV6emxlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Bus Fever! Car Jam Escape – The Ultimate Traffic Puzzle! 🚍💨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe streets are gridlocked. A massive traffic jam has blocked the road, and the bus traffic fever is heating up! 🌡️ Can you organize the chaos? Bus Fever! Car Jam Escape is a strategic challenge that tests your brain. If you love the thrill of solving a complex traffic jam, you are in the right place. 🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Master the Bus Fever\\u003cbr\\u003eYour mission is to unsnarl the gridlock and get every vehicle moving. Mastering bus traffic fever is the key!\\u003cbr\\u003e🚦 Tap to move buses and create a path.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚌 Sort passengers and match them to the correct bus in this bus fever game.\\u003cbr\\u003e🔄 Escape tricky obstacles to cool down the bus traffic fever and keep the flow moving. 🧠\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Why Play Bus Fever?\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Addictive Bus Fever Action: Experience the intensity of this challenge as you solve each traffic jam puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚌 Unique Mechanics: Navigating packed roads makes every bus traffic fever level unique and engaging.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Visual Sorting Fun: Enjoy vibrant levels filled with traffic jam challenges and Bus Fever puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 Power-ups: Stuck in a heavy traffic jam? Use boosters to win this Bus Fever game easily! ⚡\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏁 Conquer the Bus Traffic Fever!\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a special adventure. Whether you prefer relaxing logic puzzles or a high-energy challenge, you\\u0026#39;ll find it here in Bus Fever.\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you the king of the road? Download bus fever now and prove your skills! 🚍✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCONTACT\\u003cbr\\u003e📧 lumigamesteam@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003e📞 +447871573653\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/pp-of-lumi-games/home\\u003cbr\\u003eEULA: https://sites.google.com/view/eula-of-lumi-games/home\"],\"Lumi Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/No9bLxZkFM_V3zOjgBH_WfmYBfydxQtdpEzBAlMWmJxrEOo_y9G-6Jw1GpRvKW6Cedrc64NgFC_Fe8N658HH\"],null,[111,202,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dgridplus.busjam.carpuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $99.99 per item