BAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Block Crush, a relaxing block puzzle game for fans of block blast, block sudoku, wood block puzzles, and colorful puzzle challenges. Place blocks, clear rows and columns, create satisfying combos, and enjoy thoughtful gameplay through smart block placement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 How to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e• Place blocks on the board\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete rows and columns to clear lines\\u003cbr\\u003e• Create combos with careful planning\\u003cbr\\u003e• Keep the board open and find the best placements\\u003cbr\\u003e• Challenge yourself with every puzzle layout\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Features\\u003cbr\\u003e• Classic block puzzle gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Block blast inspired line-clearing challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e• Strategic block sudoku style mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing wood block puzzle experience\\u003cbr\\u003e• Colorful visuals and satisfying clear effects\\u003cbr\\u003e• Thoughtful gameplay for puzzle lovers and adults\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smooth controls and intuitive design\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play online or offline anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBlock Crush combines the best elements of modern block puzzle games. Fans of block blast gameplay will enjoy satisfying line clears and combo chains, while players who love block sudoku and wood block puzzles will appreciate the strategic depth behind every move.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesigned for players who enjoy block puzzle games, color block challenges, and relaxing puzzle games for adults, Block Crush offers a rewarding puzzle experience with endless replayability. Whether you want to relax, improve your strategy, or enjoy a satisfying challenge, every game presents a fresh puzzle to solve.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Block Crush today and enjoy a satisfying block puzzle experience for fans of block blast, block sudoku, wood block, and color block style gameplay.\"],\"Wonderful  Studio\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RzNXrXKV8Fb70cDSkYcjrS-uWQ_eWoacPnx1AxTdLbE6kJGnOIFPAH0oQHnuzzQ0meyKgq7pc5fiPm1cizSWtg\"],null,[121,73,29,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.wood.block.sudoku.puzzle.bm\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.wood.block.sudoku.puzzle.bm\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Block\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.run.tower.defense\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cs59HOM5uSmSzgnmMyFpqYw9sMtQkYxMUTRZ1TSCZK6t6T-cjluQW_9krAcgeEozBYQWKl2DmUTeETdYtKhq\"],null,[153,237,247,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2SjEnPLGNRsB4MEmbk_AzwcNFcDUywBimj8ja