bile FPS is the definitive online multiplayer FPS shooter and battle royale game on mobile. Jump into fast-paced shooting games with iconic Call of Duty maps, modes, operators, and weapons in one free-to-play experience designed for fans of gun games, sniper games, and tactical shooters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin millions of players in Call of Duty®: Mobile as you rank up, unlock powerful loadouts, and dominate competitive multiplayer and massive battle royale matches. Whether you love 5v5 FPS games, large-scale battle royale games, or tense ranked competitive play, Call of Duty: Mobile delivers authentic Call of Duty action wherever you play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fast-paced online multiplayer FPS shooter gameplay built for mobile.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Massive battle royale modes with squads, vehicles, and tactical combat.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Competitive ranked play that rewards skill and progression.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMULTIPLAYER AND RANKED COMPETITIVE\\u003cbr\\u003e• Classic multiplayer across legendary Call of Duty maps like Nuketown, Shipment, Rust, Terminal, Raid, Hijacked, and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play core modes including Team Deathmatch, Domination, Search \\u0026amp; Destroy, Hardpoint, Frontline, and limited-time playlists.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Climb through Ranked Multiplayer, earn seasonal rewards, and prove your skills against players from around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Reach Legendary rank to unlock new levels of competition inspired by professional Call of Duty esports.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBATTLE ROYALE ON MOBILE\\u003cbr\\u003e• Drop into large battle royale maps built for mobile FPS action.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Squad up, pilot vehicles, and use tactical gadgets to outplay other teams in 100-player survival matches.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Experience intense gunfights, strategic rotations, and high-stakes final circles as you fight to be the last squad standing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSEASONAL MODES, EVENTS, AND CHALLENGES\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play rotating limited-time modes and seasonal events that refresh the action.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Take on in-game challenges and missions to earn themed rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLEGENDARY WEAPONS AND LOADOUT CUSTOMIZATION\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unlock and upgrade iconic weapons from across Call of Duty history, from assault rifles and SMGs to sniper rifles and LMGs.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Customize your FPS loadouts with attachments, perks, scorestreaks, operators, and skins to match your playstyle.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Experiment with different builds for close-range aggression, long-range sniper play, or balanced all-around gun game setups.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNEW SEASONS, EVENTS, AND REWARDS\\u003cbr\\u003e• Enjoy frequent updates with new maps, modes, events, operators, weapons, and themed rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete seasonal challenges, event missions, and battle passes to unlock exclusive content.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOPTIMIZED FOR MOBILE\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smooth controls, adjustable settings, and multiple HUD options tailor the FPS experience to your device.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Optional HD resources, maps, and content downloads let you control game size while keeping top-tier graphics.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Call of Duty®: Mobile now to experience one of the top FPS shooting games on mobile. Jump into online multiplayer, battle royale, and competitive ranked modes—all in a single Call of Duty game you can play anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e_________________________________________________________\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNOTE: We welcome any feedback during your experience to improve the game. To give feedback, in-game go to \\u0026gt; Settings \\u0026gt; Feedback \\u0026gt; Contact Us.\\u003cbr\\u003eSubscribe for Updates! ---\\u0026gt; profile.callofduty.com/cod/registerMobileGame\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e_________________________________________________________\\u003cbr\\u003eNote: An internet connection is required to play this game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease note this app contains social features that allow you to connect and play with friends and push notifications to inform you when exciting events or new content are taking place in the game. You can choose whether or not to utilize these features.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e©/TM/® 2026 Activision Publishing, Inc.\"],\"Activision Publishing, Inc.\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Uyg6Q5ZmvIUbtXN5VnQnY44Ho5KANrNGoY-eOQv-1Uw2HCz_8URkNeQRrMB93m9MkvnUHc-algqQaIFfZU-V\"],null,[192,191,192,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Strong Language\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8TmeYqtEq_9kcV2_pw_YXR9bvGw0PJI_H67wFyWIKepZ2vzD0nib786iY3ypWcbVxxRqmeaMObMh-sMf\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.activision.callofduty.shooter\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.activision.callofduty.shooter\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Tactical shooter\"]],[null,null,nu