pps/details?id\\u003dcom.WalkTalk.FlightMaster\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.WalkTalk.FlightMaster\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.WalkTalk.FlightMaster\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIW0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQofChljb20uV2Fsa1RhbGsuRmxpZ2h0TWFzdGVyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"E5E9LoNRWDk\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:E5E9LoNRWDk?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:E5E9LoNRWDk\",null,[1920,1080],null,null,\"AXH1ezn-F8Z6AXu2Sd5fvKm_LahNGAwUNFsbqmKPTKev-vc1EVDd1fcznZhXxtOkNsKtdUposWOHWzpCcnOO5N-psZyn16_Y1vHO7hKwkJHJ_5OgDZfqOPrqp2iQhwHDgBBnuNh-K2GOr9SHHko2k4a7CyjNaoqnyhUA_jXe0v4ze-ZwfCW48H0GSmoMsGSfbbIF0yYJePVSCCER5vo_Zyg2pLyemxT53tSalM9SJi3NDTTPAfNsaoom3u7nPsqYC_cla8wVO458m7PcDZAF7__vio8nQbXB4dm6XZG2CoqCvw5XOQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/E5E9LoNRWDk/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Launch, Upgrade, and Conquer the Skies with your plane!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrepare for an exhilarating aerial adventure in Epic Plane Evolution, where your piloting skills and strategic upgrades determine how far your aircraft can soar. Launch your plane, navigate through diverse terrains, and evolve your aircraft to achieve maximum distance. Whether you\\u0026#39;re a casual gamer or a flight enthusiast, this game offers a captivating blend of action and strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEpic Plane Evolution is a physics-based flight game that challenges players to launch their aircraft using a slingshot mechanism and guide it through various environments. As you progress, collect coins to upgrade your plane\\u0026#39;s components, enhancing its performance and unlocking new flight capabilities. Each level introduces unique challenges, requiring precise timing and strategic upgrades to succeed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Slingshot Launch Mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003eInitiate each flight by pulling back your plane on a slingshot, determining the initial speed and angle. Mastering this mechanic is crucial for achieving optimal flight paths and distances.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 Aircraft Evolution and Upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003eAccumulate coins during flights to invest in upgrades such as wings, engines, and fuselage enhancements. These improvements not only boost your plane\\u0026#39;s performance but also unlock new visual designs and capabilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Diverse Environments\\u003cbr\\u003eNavigate through a variety of terrains, each presenting unique obstacles and weather conditions. Adapt your flight strategy to overcome challenges like wind currents, mountainous regions, and urban landscapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧭 Strategic Flight Control\\u003cbr\\u003eWhile airborne, adjust your plane\\u0026#39;s pitch and angle to maintain momentum and avoid obstacles. Strategic in-flight decisions can significantly impact your flight distance and coin collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💰 Rewarding Progression System\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn coins based on the distance traveled and successful navigation through obstacles. Use these earnings to continuously upgrade your aircraft, pushing the boundaries of how far you can fly.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Daily Challenges and Rewards\\u003cbr\\u003eEngage in daily missions that offer additional rewards, encouraging consistent play and providing opportunities to test new strategies and upgrades.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📲 Download and Take Flight!\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbark on your aviation journey today. Download Epic Plane Evolution and experience the t\"],\"VOODOO\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C8S-b9Hxmh_brsH4UIkXcx6n3bOe1appCV1fRRg8jvtwnz86lOZSKW-XXFJF35YUXX-SWzxVWKUha4M_Bcvadg\"],null,[19