/i.ytimg.com/vi/Wmba3ZkJydM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Matching Go, a thrilling match-3 puzzle game where you explore the world alongside Chloe and her adorable corgi Ollie! Whether you’re a casual player or a puzzle expert, Matching Go offers endless fun and a delightful journey. Get ready to match, collect, and build as you travel to breathtaking destinations!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin Chloe and Ollie on their adventure across the globe! Start your match-3 journey now and see where the next puzzle takes you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES OF MATCHING GO:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Engaging Puzzle Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Match 3 or more colorful objects to unleash exciting combos and power-ups!\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Levels designed for players of all skill levels, from easy to challenging!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Travel the World \\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Discover iconic cities like New York, London, and Paris, alongside imaginative realms like Christmas Village, Fairyland and so on!\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Build exquisite landmarks as you pass new levels and gather mallets!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Stunning Visuals\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Every map comes to life with vibrant colors and fabulous designs!\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Enjoy the thrill of matching as explosive animations and unique effects make every game more satisfying!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Special Rewards \\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Earn daily bonuses and participate in exciting events to win prizes!\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Speed up with various winning streak boosters!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Compete with Others\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Challenge other players on the leaderboard!\\u003cbr\\u003e‒ Climb the ranks and prove your puzzle-solving skills to become the top player!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to embark on a world of fun and puzzles?  Download Matching Go now and start your trip!🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGot questions or feedback? Reach us at dingshan.support@gmail.com. We\\u0026#39;re always here to help!\"],\"Lynn Mobile Puzzle Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MO8RXp8Pln4ZsALiE8A9qgN_PbybvSGfr7vhryj-bdHh_6JHjl9bgFR54uSTeJkvTl0JXj03WazLCi8c4GrJhw\"],null,[160,103,51,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.matchinggo.puzzlegames\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.matchinggo.puzzlegames\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Match 3 adventure\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.zroute.global\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/M8SRl5xNMoiBXvNadN9U5Mt2UryAtDwd-OZxXhT0UxUYQfGeD6aSR7VmM3Z7fZl4N3Zwba-51Zx5Q5ZLbkJ1gFc\"],null,[124,117,115,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yod5y_CL738y8IGxogiqyf