lobal\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zroute.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zroute.global\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IXUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwoXChFjb20uenJvdXRlLmdsb2JhbBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAwoECAUQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"The world has turned to ash, dominated by zombies. Z Route—it is your final path to redemption, and the last battleground of the apocalypse. With nowhere to hide, you can only advance, weapon ready! Redemption or doom? The choice is in your hands!\\u200b\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u200bCrash through every gate of choice and tear through the horde amid roaring engines. Only speed and ruthlessness will keep you alive. Are you ready? This is your war.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u200b- Trust Your Alliance\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003eIn an apocalypse, no one survives alone. Recruit warriors with different specialties and build the ultimate squad. Strategy and teamwork are your only path to survival.\\u003cbr\\u003e- \\u200bChoose Wisely\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery gate is a gamble between life and death. Choose right, and you\\u0026#39;ll find supplies. Choose wrong, and face the horde. Time is short, so you must decide fast. \\u200bOnly the smartest and toughest will achieve redemption!\\u200b\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u200b- Arm Yourself\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003eThe stronger your weapon, the better your chances. But fate is fickle; survival also depends on luck.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u200b- Speedrun Stages\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003eSpeed is your shield. Dash, dodge, counter—don\\u0026#39;t stop! Only by pushing forward can you keep death at bay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u200b- Conquer Powerful Enemies\\u200b\\u003cbr\\u003eYou never know what monsters await you at the end of the road. The only thing you can do is to keep arming yourself and be ready for anything!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Z Route: Redemption now!\\u200b\\u200b Gear up and make your stand. Danger lurks everywhere on the highway of death. Your battle has already begun. Never back down. Survival favors the bold!\"],\"37GAMES GLOBAL\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HR6I2II9Rwkf8cQ79xJ-KFU9Gty-_mb7sd-feZKtwJpym7S_GIMpKzvOJ1mcTsjPgrHSYImbSEK4SvB-3HUBZmk\"],null,[56,48,27,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood, Suggestive Themes\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zroute.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zroute.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,null,[]],[null,null,null,[\"Strategy\"]],[null,null,null,[\"4X\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.novas.craft.battle.mod.block.war\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/E208PHqFgw-m7qi4BWMRXIVWosEOm9pqIW6