82xT_r_d4CeP76KYxgOJQeoR\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PuHs3nexLNmBQy3QTVRJGePBjvPgi6r3UKxUZ0ZgL-t9foriRABAW43JrJ9TCWGkvC7M3hIlZQZNoMWWYG5gApc\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5YCVu3E-U2VYcDr9Z8oZnJFhxCT_4_CJtrFwjEAh77SI3sCyIpmnN0uBGQiDdw7zDmfEf0QGxrbBhz8lHCELTKI\"]]],\"Craft Battle: Block Wars\",[\"3.9\",3.8888888],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.novas.craft.battle.mod.block.war\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.novas.craft.battle.mod.block.war\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.novas.craft.battle.mod.block.war\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIIXkoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRgoqCiRjb20ubm92YXMuY3JhZnQuYmF0dGxlLm1vZC5ibG9jay53YXIQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgFEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Build. Spawn. Dominate the Battlefield.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Create insane mob battles in a fully customizable block world sandbox.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Craft Battle: Block War — the ultimate mix of building + battle simulator where you control chaos. Design your arena, spawn powerful mobs, and watch epic battles unfold in real time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 CREATE EPIC MOB BATTLES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your imagination with unlimited battle possibilities:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpawn monsters, zombies, mutants \\u0026amp; bosses\\u003cbr\\u003eMix different mobs for unpredictable fights\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch real-time mob vs mob combat\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your own battle scenarios\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery fight is different. Every battle is yours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 BUILD YOUR BLOCK WORLD\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesign your battlefield from scratch:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate cities, arenas, and custom maps\\u003cbr\\u003eUse powerful block building tools\\u003cbr\\u003eCraft your own war zones and battlegrounds\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom simple arenas to massive battle worlds — you decide.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 EXPLORE \\u0026amp; EXPAND\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a massive sandbox environment:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOpen-world block exploration\\u003cbr\\u003eForests, mountains, and custom terrains\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless creativity and crafting freedom\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild, destroy, and reshape the world your way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 GAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Epic mob battle simulator gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e🧟 Huge variety of monsters \\u0026amp; battle mods\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Advanced block building sandbox\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Open-world exploration\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Unlimited creative freedom\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 WHY PLAY CRAFT BATTLE: BLOCK WAR?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBecause this isn’t just a building game…\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is where creation meets destruction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Build your world\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Spawn your army\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Watch them fight\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡️ START YOUR BLOCK WAR NOW\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Craft Battle: Block War and create the ultimate battlefield today.\"],\"Coup Coup LTD\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vGtKiDub0a8-F3uyjOd2QtnuKXZGwNSiehFC8qEw9ZiM9eGg9Jb6Qvrowlc2XLvaG08u5jBZxOvJynh9zzVj\"],null,[238,234,237,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003