4b2CXCA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9qvAY5IG3_a7IvLrsewq3hAMF0MCUZbscDgWS-OIerdm1A_6w_TO6pXp1_iJnslMuL_FcmTIBKLc0I2XQllavg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t4dxtjiyiKsUhKX1FfniEJEiEJ3uEBf5sF_--NCJWrzVCRQI9XDjQc8GIOnENao-BHu6STQ9UQAxXHF2E6MbTA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QaFoXn-LjafQWuL7I1j6artqOcMc1_f70DdYT1Pe-QVyQl16z-80SseJ_AOx0VnIMYiTmcfRUiWEpaaUo6VA\"]]],\"Warline: Sniper Strike\",[\"4.9\",4.897985],\"Strategy\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.farlightgames.warline.gp.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.farlightgames.warline.gp.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.farlightgames.warline.gp.global\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIYUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPwopCiNjb20uZmFybGlnaHRnYW1lcy53YXJsaW5lLmdwLmdsb2JhbBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Fight on the front line as an elite sniper while commanding the battle on a larger scale. Experience a seamless blend of intense tactical shooting and real-time strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 One Shot to Turn the Tide\\u003cbr\\u003e• High-Stakes Sniping: Eliminate key targets to break through enemy defenses. One perfect shot can shift the momentum of an entire battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Heavy Ordnance: Master more than just sniper rifles. Command machine guns, rocket launchers, and even tanks to blast your way to victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Immersive Gunplay: Fluid controls and visceral slow-mo kill cams. Feel the recoil and impact of every trigger pull.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏙️ Take Back the City\\u003cbr\\u003e- Urban Combat: Take on intense shooter missions. Clear out hostiles block by block and reclaim occupied districts.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Secure Your Base: Restore captured facilities to establish your foothold, turning tactical victories into the foundation of a military empire.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rise to Command: What starts as a solo infiltration turns into a massive strike. That first shot is only the beginning of your rise to ultimate command.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎖️ Assemble Your Elite Force\\u003cbr\\u003e• Draft Your Roster: Build a squad of specialized operatives. From seasoned combat vets to covert agents, put together a team that fits your playstyle.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Combined Arms: Deploy fighter jets, main battle tanks, and drones to gain the upper hand across the battlefield.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Forge an Elite Army: Train your soldiers, upgrade your officers, and unleash devastating tactical synergies on anyone standing in your way. \\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Command the Global Front\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fortify Your Stronghold: Expand your base, research cutting-edge tech, and prepare your forces for all-out global conflict.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Forge Powerful Alliances: Team up with players across the globe. Coordinate massive strikes, share resources, and crush any force that opposes you.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tactical Supremacy: Push the frontlines, outsmart your rivals, and carve your name into history as a true legend.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOfficial Website: https://warline.powerfantasygames.com/\"],\"Powerfantasy HK Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1_VoPdjH4tVmzma_AlYLA8bnT0NYwPEs7ympL8OwWq2RXEiYsHVqg1AkSRwJQ2yik0U5oo5yq1-1tVY-4BZ1kA\"],null,[52,50,45,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"