eStep into the new 9th Anniversary 3D party lobby. Explore freely, enjoy fun social interactions, and take on arena challenges as you join the celebration. Complete tasks to unlock event items and milestone rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Themed BR]\\u003cbr\\u003eFactory in Bermuda gets a limited-time 9th Anniversary makeover. Complete anniversary quests to earn valuable loot and upgrade Coin Machines, vending machines, and Revival Points. If a teammate is eliminated, you can interact with their loot box to revive them on the spot!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[CS Perk Points]\\u003cbr\\u003eCS now features a new Perk Point system that lets you unlock skill boosts, Awakened Weapons, and other buffs, adding more strategic choices to every match.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Skill Boost \\u0026amp; Awakened Weapons]\\u003cbr\\u003eNew skill boost and weapon awakening systems are now available in both BR and CS. Strengthen character skills, choose different upgrade paths, and use Weapon Awakeners to increase weapon power for a richer combat experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[BR Match Review]\\u003cbr\\u003eWant to improve your BR tactics? After ranked matches, review replays to track movement paths, eliminations, and enemy positions, helping you break down every match and sharpen your strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFree Fire is a world-famous survival shooter game available on mobile. Each 10-minute game places you on a remote island where you are pit against 49 other players, all seeking survival. Players freely choose their starting point with their parachute, and aim to stay in the safe zone for as long as possible. Drive vehicles to explore the vast map, hide in the wild, or become invisible by proning under grass or rifts. Ambush, snipe, survive, there is only one goal: to survive and answer the call of duty.\\u003cbr\\u003eFree Fire, Battle In Style!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Survival shooter in its original form]\\u003cbr\\u003eSearch for weapons, stay in the play zone, loot your enemies and become the last man standing. Along the way, go for legendary airdrops while avoiding airstrikes to gain that little edge against other players.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[10 minutes, 50 players, epic survival goodness awaits]\\u003cbr\\u003eFast and Lite gameplay - Within 10 minutes, a new survivor will emerge. Will you go beyond the call of duty and be the one under the shining lite?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[4-man squad, with in-game voice chat]\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate squads of up to 4 players and establish communication with your squad at the very first moment. Answer the call of duty and lead your friends to victory and be the last team standing at the apex.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Clash Squad]\\u003cbr\\u003eA fast paced 4v4 game mode! Manage your economy, purchase weapons, and defeat the enemy squad!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Realistic and smooth graphics]\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to use controls and smooth graphics promises the optimum survival experience you will find on mobile to help you immortalize your name among the legends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Contact us]\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer Service: https://support-freefiresg.garena.com\"],\"GARENA INTERNATIONAL I\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gCqKm2I9J_UYBHsDOr1JdlBoG4kmBexI6FaY60s_E6j-m5ktRM645ybBcSuhFSdgNF6U_t8g_cYH7Em_i4rzMA\"],null,[136,164,195,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"http