Gg5pY-w_vf8X1ATSadvmJ2IwnETnipRmddsxu0920IEQY6_N2PMmeCLd1sMg\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/egW0zfy4ejI8v2I4XZG3Wh1akZFc9UrS8-b7_KniO2TSgngW_ncwBb-BF9tsH8M0Ay_ZCvCWP7bh4Yz9GEceCoI\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bgDsWztHOLc9sXoIPT9LVvK1FKRgU8mG6pI9a8F6oCXKcv-hw1nkRNZp2bS9yaOsL6873o6FRopVcIpCdunoCQ\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q5kcymCoBAlHRZcYPUxP1i5omq4eym3GyQJL4bfeJxg_VW0vTRcfZNSVvvW-1PcM8ZbdSe58W8m4HFLcupl_Lw\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6bO9PYEqp3ghJnDuuVBSF1_9wFGg5pY-w_vf8X1ATSadvmJ2IwnETnipRmddsxu0920IEQY6_N2PMmeCLd1sMg\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/egW0zfy4ejI8v2I4XZG3Wh1akZFc9UrS8-b7_KniO2TSgngW_ncwBb-BF9tsH8M0Ay_ZCvCWP7bh4Yz9GEceCoI\"]]],\"I Am Cat\",[\"4.5\",4.478447],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.NewFolderGames.IAmCat\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.NewFolderGames.IAmCat\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.NewFolderGames.IAmCat\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIbEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQofChljb20uTmV3Rm9sZGVyR2FtZXMuSUFtQ2F0EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"🐾 I Am Cat – The Ultimate Mischief Simulator!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the paws of a mischievous kitty and join millions of players in I Am Cat. Experience life as a virtual cat in this casual house pet simulator.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe I Am Cat original game lets you become the ultimate feline troublemaker in this hilarious cat simulator, where your mission is to cause chaos in a world built for humans! Knock over vases, scratch furniture, steal food, and sneak into forbidden places - all in the name of being the most mischievous kitty! 🐱\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 CREATE CHAOS \\u0026amp; HAVE FUN!\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Fans of sandbox games will enjoy exploring a detailed world filled with interactive objects.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Unleash havoc - scratch, jump, knock, and be as naughty as you want!\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Play mini-games and complete feline challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Customize your virtual pet with different skins and accessories.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Show off your favorite look.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Outsmart humans - how much mischief can you get away with?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😸 HOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Explore every room of the house.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Jump onto tables, shelves, and furniture.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Interact with a variety of objects.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Experience hilarious cat and granny moments in every room.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Complete tasks and fun cat challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Discover hidden secrets and rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Earn rewards and unlock customization options.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you want to be a curious pet, a playful prankster, or a complete troublemaker, the choice is yours. Fans of cat games will love exploring the house and creating their own adventures in this fun cat life simulator.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 CREATE CHAOS EVERYWHERE\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery action creates funny situations and unexpected reactions that make the game endlessly entertaining. If you enjoy simulator games with freedom and humor, you\\u0026#39;ll feel right at home causing chaos as a bad cat. Fans of sandbox games will discover countless ways to interact with objects and create their own mischief.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👵 OUTSMART GRANDMA\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Steal snacks and surprise Grandma with unexpected gifts.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Throw objects, make a mess, and see how she reacts.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Change TV channels and cause chaos throughout the house.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Hide, escape, and outsmart Grandma before she catches you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrandma tries to keep everything under control, but a naughty kitty always finds new ways to create chaos. Fans of prank games and grandma games will love testing their skills against Grandma while planning the perfect cat escape.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate your own unique style and experience life as a playful kitten or a mischievous bad cat. There are plenty of ways to express your personality throughout this cat life simulator adventure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐱 PERFECT FOR PLAYERS WHO LOVE\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy sandbox games, simulator games, prank games, cat games, and funny adventures, I Am Cat is the perfect game for you. Discover secrets, create chaos, and enjoy endless cat and grandma adventures in one of the most entertaining games around.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😼 Unleash your inner cat and start your adventure now!🐾\"],\"Estoty\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ac0rTMMUAftc99k9cJcGh9TZ_kvwB2fCIDbWZKAumzyQspdywoswBM0VGrqsQz9WFCBLbW07_fMnId2cN1U1L1Y\"],null,[75,43,26,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Crude Humor\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.New