QPmUZCCG89jzLR4k_041GTucHRbgchVi6GJsedZuf6ZuQ1K25sWa6TUuqdPfoORgV4\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m_xfMAm4xqJnT1tdzuZPHys2Yg-Z0XPhZEBxuRsPyfbbH6rtlxXYDWzPLWhxQs2fkmRZHYZWvgbJiQjyacyQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C6nhLEvtovqdh4qKSP23jxlhzYZkCZO5wwJ35uW4HUo3r72D5IxRB5jOxKBF1K5fYSLVZKGoN_RCmL0N9Z5a\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9mSf0XiUU8u5kI5cwTwkUrQ0uImTO0Ta4k4oouDzJkJiwPmm5aoNzwZKdNJ5QsJlQJbAiB-unJISrQlyv97QcQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AmdszMCE84T19TYdT1HbFElcFCclcDdzSDONZCJfd5_D3NjB3u-jiqAzdZ-tJYp37kSr-Jy0KJcXhz3zxU6L\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Zji9FWrEFUafKKvvSMDwyQPmUZCCG89jzLR4k_041GTucHRbgchVi6GJsedZuf6ZuQ1K25sWa6TUuqdPfoORgV4\"]]],\"Arrow Pro 3D\",[\"4.8\",4.785714],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003darrow.cube.escape3d\\u0026rdid\\u003darrow.cube.escape3d\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003darrow.cube.escape3d\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIbkoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLwoZChNhcnJvdy5jdWJlLmVzY2FwZTNkEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Arrow Pro 3D, a relaxing 3D cube puzzle game where observation, timing, and planning come together.\\u003cbr\\u003eRotate the 3D cube, release arrows, and clear the board one move at a time. In this arrow puzzle 3D experience, every move matters. As you progress, each puzzle becomes more complex and rewards careful thinking, spatial awareness, and smart sequencing.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe controls are simple to understand, while the layouts continue to encourage deeper thinking throughout every level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA fully rotatable 3D puzzle environment\\u003cbr\\u003eArrow Pro 3D takes place on an interactive three-dimensional cube. Unlike flat puzzle games, every face of the cube contributes to the solution. At times, the answer may be on the opposite side, requiring rotation and observation from different angles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers can rotate the cube freely, zoom in to inspect details, and study each surface before choosing the next move. This freedom supports thoughtful planning throughout every 3D puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelease arrows and clear surfaces\\u003cbr\\u003eThe core mechanic focuses on releasing arrows in the correct order. Tap an arrow to activate it, and it will travel forward along its direction, removing other arrows encountered along the path.\\u003cbr\\u003eSome arrows travel short distances, while others move across larger areas. Understanding how arrows interact allows multiple elements to be removed efficiently. Careful sequencing often creates satisfying chain reactions that clear large sections of the cube in an arrow 3D escape style challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHundreds of handcrafted puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003eArrow Pro 3D contains a wide collection of handcrafted cube puzzles designed to maintain interest over time. Early challenges introduce fundamental behavior and basic movement patterns. As progress continues, layouts expand and require stronger observation and structured planning.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers will encounter:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Beginner-friendly compact cube layouts\\u003cbr\\u003e- Medium difficulty spatial arrangements\\u003cbr\\u003e- Large cube structures requiring careful reasoning\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multi-stage solutions that reward planning and patience\\u003cbr\\u003eEach layout presents a different arrangement that supports flexible thinking and encourages experimentation in arrow puzzle 3D gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth and relaxing interactions\\u003cbr\\u003eThe overall experience focuses on steady pacing and visual clarity. Arrows glide across the 3D cube surfaces in a fluid motion. As elements disappear gradually, the cube becomes less crowded, creating a consistent visual rhythm.\\u003cbr\\u003eA minimalist visual approach keeps attention on puzzle solving while maintaining readability during longer play sessions. Subtle animations provide visual feedback without distraction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDevelop thinking skills naturally\\u003cbr\\u003eArrow Pro 3D offers a structured way to exercise reasoning skills while maintaining a calm environment.\\u003cbr\\u003eRegular play supports:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Spatial awareness\\u003cbr\\u003e- Logical reasoning\\u003cbr\\u003e- Planning ability\\u003cbr\\u003e- Pattern recognition\\u003cbr\\u003e- Problem-solving confidence\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers may spend time studying puzzle layouts carefully or proceed quickly through simpler puzzles. Each session supports observation and structured thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesigned for flexible play sessions\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether there are only a few minutes available or a longer period of time, Arrow Pro 3D adapts comfortably to different schedules. Short puzzle layouts fit brief moments of play. Larger structures support longer sessions that encourage focused attention.\\u003cbr\\u003eSuitable moments to play include:\\u003cbr\\u003e- During short breaks\\u003cbr\\u003e- While traveling\\u003cbr\\u003e- Before rest\\u003cbr\\u003e- During quiet moments\\u003cbr\\u003eThe structure supports gradual progression while maintaining a balanced level of challenge. Early puzzles provide clear learning opportunities, while later layouts require deeper reasoning and patience. Completing a puzzle often feels similar to solving a small mechanical structure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDeveloper Phone: +85254296520\\u003cbr\\u003eSupport Email: lumen.customerservice@outlook.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/pp-lumenstudio\\u003cbr\\u003eUser Agreement: https://sites.google.com/view/lumenstudio-eula\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOne cube.\\u003cbr\\u003eHundreds of puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless possibilities.\"],\"Iridium Mobile Team\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HEPm5spsrlGfIYZ9k09V8lL3hcIurfPzyDH_x5IIw5xNTHOhcgELiPTuTR7R7pW2kPu2Sd4ULJgsO_APWbo4\"],null,[246,224,161,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003darrow.cube.escape3d\\u0026rdid\\u003darrow.cube.escape3d\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.gimica.treasuremaster\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_lYcwhk15kEQDqliKxajVrdi9tsEDrS-ipQdIONx8wGW5OBbi0gReAukFre-7YQ5cfiD3WRi1c2P9SOe1HYcJ5g\"],null,[59,124,181,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6DjBVPuBgLoAmZtNMGRt0qS9VA6D8wOwgonqZrKDA5YhOHHZNBCKq5UsvHVU-GzqE9bQD81BUXPdUJoO88E-VQY\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1OxqMxGCkA9WRQLBRNMi8N2Ut4tqeE-42zeRfdVUSaylNQsFVtzJI-nkyqvmtzXNeH1XXRhfSi4JEeeJ5bPg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BTm8sXjaiWiyEr2f2bEXtQ1yQ_oJSfXcS3sBWxvUkQT7xWSSlonyoUZ70LzBXw2YZJD0fRWf0-ReNprGGN8Ga20\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jaCyCs9qvMthWM6T-0eZAmZBzUSjhTKdktIg6YmDrE0WNcL3A2OXQa0WI214cXMsEwWben6nTWPcWJ0punGvYQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/clUFLdHSkXoDO9d_f9_QdAH4HMOA73LgEwzBDmuWRUQP48LruPViMmI021JoXD3NKgGucee-1O0cPI6SMU4_1TI\"]]],\"Treasure Master\",[\"4.5\",4.4894786],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gimica.treasuremaster\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gimica.treasuremaster\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gimica.treasuremaster\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIb0oTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQofChljb20uZ2ltaWNhLnRyZWFzdXJlbWFzdGVyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAC\"],null,[null,\"Enter an endless monster hunt in Treasure Master! This arcade blade-thrower game tests your aim, timing, and nerves as you hurl knives at greedy monsters and towering bosses.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYOU THROW THE WEAPONS\\u003cbr\\u003eForget wooden logs and static targets. In Treasure Master, you attack fierce enemies, fling knives, swords, darts, and spears straight into the monster until it surrenders all its treasures to you. Land clean hits, watch the creature react, and keep your streak alive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAIM, TIME, SURVIVE\\u003cbr\\u003eEnemies spin and change rhythm, so every throw is a small decision. Wait too long and you’ll lose your chance; throw too early and you may miss. Keep a cool head, learn the patterns, and turn tight moments into perfect hits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMONSTERS \\u0026amp; BOSS BATTLES\\u003cbr\\u003eEach stage brings new opponents and tougher patterns. Survive the waves, then face a boss that demands true precision. Read the motion, pick your moment, and strike!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR ARSENAL\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock a growing collection of weapons and enjoy the feel of each one. Swap between quick knives, heavy swords, pinpoint darts, and sharp spears to match your style. The more you play, the more skins you’ll have to tackle epic monsters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCOLLECT \\u0026amp; PROGRESS\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn gems as you play and push further to unlock more stages and stronger runs. Chase your best performance, rack up clean streaks, and climb through level after level as the difficulty ramps up. The deeper you go, the faster the action gets - and the more satisfying your victories feel.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEASY TO PLAY, HARD TO MASTER\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple controls: tap/aim and throw\\u003cbr\\u003e- Different weapon skins for your excitement\\u003cbr\\u003e- Quick sessions for breaks, long sessions for high-score chasing\\u003cbr\\u003e- Endless challenge that keeps getting harder\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to prove your skill as a Treasure Master and become the ultimate monster-slaying knife-thrower?\"],\"Gimica GmbH\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hM4DSkKCVRQFfPzIyxisBwMjxtDE1igHRgIcgTi2u4e7G3d3Jc3xu3cZJTYT1MoypjnaBLkE1os_3RAI2ram\"],null,[33,21,51,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb