LPWur8N_hZOHoXdjKZEZPYvGgiHKyxxjtfdcCae6U6zLA\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/so3ByaIJ5I5FB-NhBsmKtOZorW7KwJ7r9rJN8c6IZ26OAb71fo-ynQl2MMEw3eO6X1PF_hNBBMPBn_bDR0Docw\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y-rvq0LV8MXzBAoG_PzTzoXmtwS1aoXaLELPXM3STiQHLjbKPLOCDYPPaiJANf7cl7CI_XHYDyzSjaNVAFqX\"]]],\"Grass Master – Cutting Game\",[\"4.7\",4.705128],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.grass.cut.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.grass.cut.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.grass.cut.game\"]],[\"qgJcGloIcUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLgoYChJjb20uZ3Jhc3MuY3V0LmdhbWUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"61eUbVQdTBs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:61eUbVQdTBs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:61eUbVQdTBs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmenF5Agbw6iabYb0TLGL1F_0SAHoQSEAANjFKNElkXcTpAWBtUMuIJAKKumrg2Vmmq8FiDNq2n01C-Nmko6q1RRAXoQS6iMdbcReyJhI99ZgRWevGXyut3_M7_uoPR8gOmNl2GbJr97wN83oCkpdTYy6X-IAi90lzboAPf0owWk6EEHHZFl-Jd5QPhTUgYdxH7TndgJeKX5zUcnZCw_SjDoaXFngv7ni1Mxj5Bhv1JYzY0DwUbDptrCVR0-AsZycmqMG7xiqzWMPYdWo2AyjOP6ZSdm24TY1z_N3jmLSoaDw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/61eUbVQdTBs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eTHE MORE YOU MOW\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMowing the lawn usually means hot, sweaty work, but thanks to this grass cutting lawnmower game you’ll be able to enjoy all the satisfaction of a job well done, with none of the hard work! Grass Master is a fun and relaxing mowing simulator where each level you’ll work to cut the different grasses in flowers as fast as possible. With great graphics and that ASMR feel it’s the perfect answer to a hard day of work – so satisfying!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eMOW, MOW, MOW THE HAY\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eArmed with your trusty lawnmower, each level you’ll receive a list of items to cut: orange grass, red tulips, green shrubs, the list goes on! Once the timer starts it’s up to you to figure out the best and fastest way to cut everything. As you cut the grass, your mower will grow and speed up, so think ahead to what bigger items might be coming up that you need to prepare for. Relaxing and cheerful, this lawnmower game does it all!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFun features:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLawnmowing madness\\u003c/b\\u003e – Who ever thought grass cutting could be fun? This game will change your mind! Different types of grasses, flowers, and even trees await trimming, making this an enjoyable game for all skill levels. As you progress you’ll start to recognize which plants to go for first to make the biggest impact.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eRelaxing ASMR\\u003c/b\\u003e – Nothing takes the edge off of your stress like a little haptic action – not only that, but the accompanying graphics really help set the mood! While you do need to beat the timer there are boosters a’plenty in case you’re just not feeling it, and the levels flow seamlessly together, allowing you to keep playing to your heart’s content.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSatisfying gameplay\\u003c/b\\u003e – Great graphics, smooth controls, bright colors, and straightforward play means you don’t need to mess around learning strange rules or fighting against flashing colors. Sit back, relax and guide your lawnmower through the maze of plants.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSteely strategy\\u003c/b\\u003e – It’s not all mindless play here. Different levels have different objectives, so why not try out some different ideas and see which ones move you along the fastest? Whether you cut the grass in a circle or head straight towards your objective, there’s never a dull moment (or blade.)\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eTHE MOWING SIMULATOR THAT LEAVES YOU SATISFIED\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrass cutting can be so relaxing, at least when done in a lawnmower game! A mowing simulator with impeccable ASMR vibes, Grass Master is your ticket to a stress-free day. Guide your lawnmower through cheerful flora to cut them down as you enjoy trying out different strategies: will you stick to just the areas you need to move on or cut it all? Whatever your choice, let Grass Master mow your stress away!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fGUJ64UD_LnFg1XjopPxGuWVuwajyGhCJiSrQZBwwAEMdlCgb5kHjjocAlH8LHIaGdYxo2G0aP1YADSaNrIp-w\"],null,[185,235,253,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.grass.cut.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.grass.cut.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026of