ontent.com/aEtHm5tgPKLnF_cNuiuU-mPeCoO4maVvKTDERMApAkBvXb-egmojyf866yiqBlyHlfqptbSB36dFpxaeQn4t\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aDCqlfphsJYwH7pf_nPchGaUY37_si4F0K5PfRMZUFJC5XphchBtCWPsz8R6M_EPVLHvyci74lF7r3Ft3BRmiA\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yX9R29UowvR-cTxseh68rwGOruxULVs8l-VjVEjfYBlTNZkFK4xzxg75JnfamiKGMn_freSrJhBNo7E26a1seg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F5t-RNG3vp_1iflsmqUDCd1Og3JBPKgHL_n9hMTmz3sBaW92kJVKJbvkpndSoZ9JxG-lY2cydREHP38tp1op0bs\"]]],\"Get Color Pack: Sort Puzzle\",[\"4.8\",4.7533336],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zm.waterpack\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zm.waterpack\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zm.waterpack\"]],[\"qgJaGlgIckoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLAoWChBjb20uem0ud2F0ZXJwYWNrEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dkQmxP2nqFzY\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kQmxP2nqFzY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"🧪 Get Color Pack: Sort Puzzle - A Fresh Take on Color Sorting Puzzles! 🧪\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into a deeply soothing and incredibly satisfying puzzle game where logic meets fluid mechanics. Your objective is crystal clear:\\u003cbr\\u003emeticulously separate vibrant, mixed liquids so that each beautiful glass bottle contains only one unified color. With every single level you\\u003cbr\\u003econquer, the challenge deepens - and so does the immense satisfaction of getting that final pour just right. If you love brain teasers, color\\u003cbr\\u003ematching, and relaxing offline games, you have found your next puzzle addiction!\\u003cbr\\u003e💧 Simple Concept, Smart Challenges\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re presented with an array of beautifully crafted bottles filled with chaotic, layered colors. To solve this mesmerizing water sort puzzle,\\u003cbr\\u003eyou must carefully pour liquid between the bottles, adhering to strict color-matching rules:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Pour liquid only onto the exact same color, or into a completely empty bottle.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Stack identical colors together until the tube is full.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Use your available empty space strategically to maneuver trapped liquids.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete the level by achieving perfectly sorted, single-color bottles.\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, new layers, hidden colors, and tighter layouts appear, meaning every single decision counts.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Strategy Over Speed\\u003cbr\\u003eForget stressful countdowns! There’s absolutely no timer in this game - just you, your mind, and the puzzle. Take a deep breath and think\\u003cbr\\u003ecarefully before each pour. Because you are given a limited number of empty bottles, you cannot simply move colors around endlessly. To\\u003cbr\\u003ebecome a master sorter, you’ll need to:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Anticipate your future moves and visualize the flow of the puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Uncover and free trapped colors at the bottom of the tubes.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Prevent frustrating dead ends by planning your bottle usage.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Reorganize efficiently with minimal space to keep your board clean.\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s a magnificent game of foresight, clever rearranging, and cognitive training that will keep your brain sharp.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 Designed to Unwind (ASMR Experience)\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a world of ultimate relaxation. Enjoy stunning, fluid animations and beautifully rendered, vibrant colors that make every successful\\u003cbr\\u003epour feel incredibly satisfying. The clean user interface, gentle pace, and soothing aesthetic create a highly relaxing environment designed\\u003cbr\\u003eto melt your stress away. Hidden colors and surprise mechanics add moments of discovery, making this the perfect ASMR-inspired digital\\u003cbr\\u003eretreat after a long day.\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠 Tools When You Need Them\\u003cbr\\u003eWe want you to feel challenged, not frustrated! If you ever hit a tough spot or make a mistake, our helpful in-game features are there to\\u003cbr\\u003esave the day:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Undo recent moves: Made a wrong pour? Simply rewind and try a different strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Add an extra bottle: Stuck with no empty space? Drop in a brand new, empty tube for ultimate flexibility.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Reveal hidden layers: Peek at what\\u0026#39;s underneath to properly plan your next combination.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Seamless progression: Continue advancing through thousands of levels without ever feeling hopelessly stuck.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Why You Will Love Get Color Pack:\\u003cbr\\u003e• 1000+ uniquely designed levels with steadily increasing difficulty.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Stunning, vibrant graphics and satisfying liquid pouring effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e• No internet connection required - enjoy this relaxing offline game anywhere, anytime!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy to learn with one-finger controls, but hard to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Perfect for all ages, from kids learning colors to adults seeking a daily mental workout.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re sharpening your logic skills, training your brain, or simply looking for a peaceful, stress-relieving way to pass the time during\\u003cbr\\u003eyour commute, this captivating color-sorting challenge delivers a perfect blend of mental strategy and pure relaxation. Start sorting today\\u003cbr\\u003eand see how smoothly you can solve every single puzzle!\\u003cbr\\u003e🤝 Support \\u0026amp; Feedback\\u003cbr\\u003eWe are always working to improve your puzzle-solving experience! Do you have questions, feedback, or need assistance with a tough level?\\u003cbr\\u003e• Email our support team at: zephyr.support@tripledotstudios.com\"],\"Tripledot Studios Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vqFBIJ2Xk4RCpEw4QbM39TuBRrCWZJFBc_0MNJRKJSTrCAcLFKWtCIcSjNvqN3uAHBEP66e1nXtinayVJgBl8g\"],null,[20,12,80,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zm.waterpack\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zm.waterpack\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $89.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.wilds.craft.mysticland.explore\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/r3IKo3jCvwssyH_Ls71RYv2TrELAQXB9s6O19__3tLUj4l-vPX-CWGuJ1CnNmmqJ9MHwj89NVovZaeQCnjtathA\"],null,[137,109,43,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1Bym