C5leHBsb3JlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"sRGDvPd7e5A\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:sRGDvPd7e5A?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:sRGDvPd7e5A\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznkCu_IEy8zICqW0axJJ5_GM5nSk4H26dhbHWz4INQ-fpNNVN-Ml2vENusnjd5A1v1DrJsimV59t-q975OezFAyZ8f58FSr7KAneRNY8P6vA5O7z8paYsX8sGJZ4JhjY47UwHcFXNU2q3HO8e60eemn4d-Z4Kzmzxo78okn5BCpeBR45OynpF_BjJIhmpmAnRSJASQkKKKD_VMmSctNDtWMi2DRiSME14D6wSvMGQtpBWnzdeST_UDt2P3SUIHeovphJtR25E55jdpv3J8kOLLRB3vKtvtJgGFHbO7vLKYf0g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sRGDvPd7e5A/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"🧱 Block Craft 3D: Realm Builder is a creative sandbox game where you can explore a vast block world, craft resources, and build your own realm from the ground up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Start with a small land and turn it into a unique world. Place blocks freely, design buildings, shape terrain, and expand your realm without limits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⛏️ Collect materials, craft new blocks, and unlock more building options as you grow your realm. There are no strict rules – just pure creativity and freedom.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏰 Build houses, towers, cities, or anything you can imagine. Every block you place helps shape your personal realm.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Perfect for players who love crafting, building, and exploring open worlds.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Sandbox block craft gameplay with full freedom\\u003cbr\\u003e🏗️ Build and customize your own realm\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Explore a vast open block world\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple controls and smooth 3D experience\\u003cbr\\u003e😊 Relaxing and creative gameplay for all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👑 Create, build, and rule your own realm in Block Craft 3D: Realm Builder.\"],\"Metagame.Ltd\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,