/3KMGZ53fJ545Aw9eKEXfLldlyHF1Oz8KEIwBv-trLZn4E1sOnaZubNB36TrSScDFw9XadHlCtNJKfmH6rMZe73k\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DJp0_zzDpIE0dLhHWLLhAiLqhCFea4JN8I90vAy25bCR3KCyEdpMjp35z9MYSR2J1t-wGT0RAqrx9Iw5AIJpTW8\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iCOnKXLIs9QsS9xma65CoXrugymkKFf_0Frls-WFqdTUb1Mq51lmze2izZPLiUSpvhY2LeoZ3wXZ7aQcwLHVYA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/neeFaknU_RrJpMEmOcKvLR_H4_fZ5t9L49ISJCHNFLylqS9sROR_HuX8QUuLB6ydiSucDSAYwNZma8F8UzOv\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uA0m3OEvE4YUYIvVoCYtumMtzkkcdEhX9Voz-M5WaVTKxRUm7UoLBZNrwIBWM8JpgSb8D8xr1RqHYwiffLTtBg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t58lUUGujKyjydRWi_GJnlzxoOoitk9siAVGxQWaZop_n3ZMdPeweafVhjEdKauylEla_r-XxUukTte7TCpe8Do\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ihW2Q2QvanzD9Yqy9AQ-NzaF0V5pUh3-BlokgZYfVY2Jlluu9aP1uWKJa9gUUtTohyhrrYKHa5Q9FTF0wQswzfk\"]]],\"Hole Stars: Puzzle Game\",[\"4.7\",4.7123094],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.moonactive.holestars\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.moonactive.holestars\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.moonactive.holestars\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIdEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoeChhjb20ubW9vbmFjdGl2ZS5ob2xlc3RhcnMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"OTeLNZm-rWo\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:OTeLNZm-rWo?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:OTeLNZm-rWo\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmjICTORuvFNxZHPfac4t8JTIGlFA2_BWeY3il5x1OdUYL9nsIDn7V4d5Grebxx7sDaTM7jvgZ57t4OixKOqycvfUlPRMP1TbCJH2iE8hXRkraI3wEM2YPzCnTC63Y7PJwhjZzvI4N9JAxTEtdGUoMb980P0rqx9Qfwnq1wruH9wMc3lWYJ0W1LbPhPfRUEAIFomFwChGjxSdqncbTCG-gdc4-5VTXRwDAoIrBQ06wBCbrZYI15XO8D19RekKjQCe9xKioJeDeKScBe4vzuyHNHedOvq8o5Ta2fLx6U-k9s-g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OTeLNZm-rWo/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Hole Stars – Scoop, Solve, and Shine\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for a game that’s fun, fast, and totally satisfying? Meet Hole Stars — a relaxing puzzle game where you guide a growing black hole through colorful levels, collect everything in sight, and beat the clock in style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom tiny objects to giant surprises, every level is packed with items to collect, puzzles to solve, and obstacles to outsmart. Whether you’re in it for the challenge or the relaxing vibes, Hole Stars is the perfect break-time pick-me-up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to Play, Hard to Put Down\\u003cbr\\u003eSwipe to move your black hole and start collecting! As you gather more, your hole grows bigger, letting you scoop up larger items and clear the board even faster. Watch out for tricky objects and blockers that’ll keep you on your toes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink Fast, Move Smart\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level is a puzzle with a twist: time is ticking! Use strategy, quick thinking, and helpful level boosters to collect everything before the clock runs out. Whether you\\u0026#39;re sorting, planning your path, or just going with the flow — every move matters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying, Soothing Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy smooth animations, crisp visuals, and gentle ASMR-style sound effects as you play. Hole Stars is built to be relaxing and satisfying — perfect for short sessions or deep puzzle streaks.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay, Compete, Repeat\\u003cbr\\u003eWant to challenge yourself even more? Compete with friends, rise through the leaderboard, and show off your speed and puzzle skills. It’s easy to pick up and play — but there’s always a new challenge waiting.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat Makes Hole Stars Shine:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Addictive black hole gameplay with a unique twist\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dozens of clever puzzles and satisfying levels\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Swallow items, grow stronger, and clear the board\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Use smart boosters to tackle tough spots\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Avoid sneaky blockers and stay one step ahead\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Clean design and smooth, ASMR-inspired effects\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- A relaxing mix of strategy, action, and fun\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Ideal for fans of sorting games and brain teasers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the leaderboard and race to the top!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re chasing high scores or just want a satisfying way to unwind, Hole Stars is your new favorite way to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe stars are waiting — download now and shine bright!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/terms.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://static.moonactive.net/legal/privacy.html?lang\\u003den\\u003cbr\\u003eQuestions about the game? Our support is ready and waiting at:  https://support.holestarsgame.com/\"],\"Moon Active\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MMVyPEBh1hfEgvbeG-7W9Rld_tk_1iETGnz2jV8vfg5vtV9z8IshxdikeXO5AnbVUIMt2jGfl6Lr00PoyrDouv8\"],null,[252,251,63,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn mo