\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VfvP4EycVKP7NBz0FV5QpWP4NqxjiqCns9WjVMklmYvwiJs7icPyrEdLJo0r4B4J1DIBum6WThO7pxDt8eSJ-Vw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jbC3UEC55EVYXy6uvNUg1skacg6z3cO2_bWIlu0eZx6eO0J2gsW1Ljlmv9-Bwj0pFgYPZU4Or1waqTanRuqh\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OEeY43Pw8nPsXXVcmlJN49GaywqhUlctbr0fDPYaxEasTdrqVGmwLfVI_231qmYfP_LSO0LwpDYUZN4rJxwzlw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YoDo03299QV9XQiy9Wp8shpH3MVG3dlah5gQlxlIbIgTRxE59qb-drJfGg2S1gz7961I1RzuTXqv8MfAbBWfMg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eiW9EYr9Rhp_XLZ5y6o_9xzWIsUX8oHh-cdu4bZnSa0ZbohBMF28TFT4prD9uVv7_jLl7pmq6BySRdUlKdFmBA\"]]],\"Merge Cooking®\",[\"4.6\",4.587783],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.cooking.theme.restaurant.food\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.merge.cooking.theme.restaurant.food\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.cooking.theme.restaurant.food\"]],[\"qgJxGm8IeEoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQwotCidjb20ubWVyZ2UuY29va2luZy50aGVtZS5yZXN0YXVyYW50LmZvb2QQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"btN5-iCw4NY\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:btN5-iCw4NY?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:btN5-iCw4NY\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlSusYyAevDTg5V2dVVoFFjoH4CSbBxOr5gUEtcDSfNV7O-FQeJngGPh474CaZTn_RYqR9FkJNNjpVPdz4mLUizkmeK0cYFOs0Fkvx_FiX56xMmCls148OOOuEigaPi54-xLbwHERZPURaspY04v7SRsjGc-6HixPMWJ29E2bDa2Rjo5s0kYqznOfcXlB30NyDVS2i0a3L2psTnu0FyKH6NIFvi3H7vWvEUPRVUm8siNMaMAPsZJlSfakzlCt9ENPoXHNP2FW7-FX1fKIBoVQtpY44W0-_9G86CkfYpWVyxNg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/btN5-iCw4NY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;Are you ready, Chef?\\u0026quot; SpongeBob is making a splash in Merge Cooking!\\u003cbr\\u003e[Limited-Time Collaboration Event: Dive into Bikini Bottom!]\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin SpongeBob and his friends on a special culinary adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003eServe Bikini Bottom Residents: Your favorite characters are here! Merge special underwater ingredients and serve delicious dishes to our new guests.\\u003cbr\\u003eSpongeBob Pass: Take part in the brand-new limited-time merge event, level up your pass, and claim exclusive F.U.N. rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Notice] This collaboration content and related events are available for a limited time and only in select countries/regions. Please refer to the actual in-game availability.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you know you can enjoy the food around the world without traveling?\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you know you can master the secret of cooking with just a few simple steps?\\u003cbr\\u003eTie your apron and put your chef hat on! Looking for relaxing food games? In Merge Cooking, you can cook anything!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Welcome, Chef!\\u003cbr\\u003eYour assistant Lea is waiting for you to start the adventure of opening your own merge restaurant and serving customers around the world. Merge Cooking not only allows you to cook as a star chef and master the world cuisine but also helps you realize your designer dream and renovate Michelin star restaurants! Experience engaging simulation games that bring your culinary dreams to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Start a food tour!\\u003cbr\\u003eENJOY Eggs Benedict in New York, DRINK Tom Yam Gong in Bangkok, ROLL Sushi in Tokyo, DINE on Escargot in Paris… Merge Cooking takes you on a world tour, city by city! You will unlock a world-famous dish every day and discover more exciting and challenging recipes to hone your skills in these cooking games.\\u003cbr\\u003eVarious local cuisines – Taco, Kebab, Ramen and more.\\u003cbr\\u003eNumerous restaurant themes – fast food, BBQ, seafood and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play with ingredients!\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge food ingredients with the simple steps – tap, drag \\u0026amp; merge! Quality delicacy requires nothing but basic ingredients!\\u003cbr\\u003eCOOK with the help of machines – seven pieces of equipment that bring you extra fun in this addictive puzzle game! Simulate real-life cooking and prepare the food in a fun way! Frying pan, juice blender, oven and cocktail shaker… everything you need to prepare a decent meal will be on standby. Say goodbye to overcooked pies and charred steaks!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Eat outside the box!\\u003cbr\\u003eMozzarella, pecan, coconut, lobster, champagne… Find everything you need to become a world-famous chef in exciting restaurant games. Merge them to serve hungry customers! Discover more as you play! Unlock special souvenirs as you travel. How about sending a postcard from Hollywood?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Every flavor tells a story!\\u003cbr\\u003eNothing makes people more connected than good food. Get familiar with the American restaurant owner who\\u0026#39;s also a football coach and the French restaurant manager who\\u0026#39;s elegant but picky. Greet customers from all walks of life. Learn their stories and write more of your own in this captivating merge game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Merge Cooking you’ll:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e√ MERGE food, fruits, vegetables, cheese and UNCOVER other numerous ingredients.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ COOK exotic and fantastic dishes and TRAVEL to different countries in exciting cooking games.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ SIMULATE real-life cooking in immersive simulation games with different equipment.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ RENOVATE restaurants with fresh new designs, perfect for fans of design games.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ UPGRADE culinary skills and MASTER global recipes.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ PLAY anywhere! Enjoy merge games offline with no Wi-Fi needed.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ RELAX by solving fun puzzle games with no time pressure!\\u003cbr\\u003e√ CLAIM amazing rewards and gifts.\\u003cbr\\u003e√ ENGAGE yourself and ENJOY extra fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge Cooking, cook anything!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e—————————————\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e Need help or want to share your feedback?\\u003cbr\\u003e We\\u0026#39;d love to hear from you!\\u003cbr\\u003e Email us: support@happibits.zohodesk.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us for the latest news and updates:\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: facebook.com/mergecooking.themerestaurant/ \\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: instagram.com/mergecookingthemerestaurant/ \\u003cbr\\u003eTikTok: www.tiktok.com/@mergecooking_official\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://game.happibits.com/privacy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://game.happibits.com/terms\"],\"Happibits Game\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/op_NzBBTLAS8rSPGoYvgLTfSTfon_1U3LcP3wDpXuwZ6BZyEca8v7cHLdzpDFPtXJe8m8Nms9cSS8S2Y0Qz6\"],null,[126,203,219,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.cook