CG7friAHViJFw5zsd4bKJejou1fyPbtHvwAZ_rbDewVkRbe8fly34hDWT0YZzKnBpC3h9cyJlCNj\"]]],\"Dog Escape: Cute Pet Care Life\",[\"4.4\",4.3876653],\"Simulation\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgg.sunday.dog.escape.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dgg.sunday.dog.escape.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dgg.sunday.dog.escape.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIeUoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNwohChtnZy5zdW5kYXkuZG9nLmVzY2FwZS5wdXp6bGUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"BJ2RmvSfimI\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:BJ2RmvSfimI?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:BJ2RmvSfimI\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmrpA5f1TuuS3f5gLw7p1uaT2_QHRhG5TDd6sMLGnA2GTMvKa_bC75xDzOAC9UpPx9QeseH_TotYl35TO3-yRulgRTvrxSTPtncTPfJDrKcGNQY7oMdLVpjwENAO0k_mAfSJ8rCNkT__sDncBUDte4pweRHl2FuJ0C3OfhpMM2uqiLtWY3ga1RTO9X6SGzxnz1gUIVSb5m7ss6WS4BD1F9a22PJyEMujXgs5XhFipdWvylYHxG-639gvO3zpybIq2dURT9leCZkofqVmdnOQ9nnMTC2yfp_DH-tEyNJFNo3-g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BJ2RmvSfimI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Have you ever dreamed of having a puppy? 🐶\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet your new virtual friend in Dog Escape. 🐾 Rescue a cute pup, take care of them, and help them feel safe again, with cozy moments and satisfying escape gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDog Escape is a virtual pet care adventure with escape gameplay. 🐶💖\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePet lovers and animal games fans, welcome to a world full of cute puppies you can rescue, collect, care for, and play with. Guide every pup through fun dog escape puzzle levels, then bring them home to a cozy shelter where the real bonding begins. If you’re into puppy games, dog games, and feel-good rescue stories, this one’s for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐶 RESCUE \\u0026amp; ESCAPE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Help lost pups make it to safety through rooftop runs, tricky roads, and hidden maze paths.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Outsmart traps in satisfying dog escape puzzle levels\\u003cbr\\u003e- Guide your puppy through obstacles, timing challenges, and clever routes\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rescue more pups to unlock more shelter progress\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 CARE FOR YOUR PUPPIES\\u003cbr\\u003e- This isn’t just “save and go.” Your puppies need love.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Feed, heal, and care for rescued pups\\u003cbr\\u003e- Watch your shelter fill up with adorable dog personalities\\u003cbr\\u003e- Create a heartwarming second-chance story, one pup at a time\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎀 COLLECT, CUSTOMIZE \\u0026amp; DRESS UP\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap into that cute collector feeling. More pups, more looks, more surprises.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlock adorable skins and cute styles\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect shelter upgrades, items, and new zones\\u003cbr\\u003e- Build your own cozy dog world that keeps growing\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 PUZZLES + PUPPY FUN (ANIMAL GAMES STYLE)\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dog Escape blends quick, satisfying action with clever puzzle moments.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Light, fun gameplay for fans of animal games and puppy games\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini challenges and variety so levels don’t feel the same\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to pick up, fun to master, great for short play sessions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 EVENTS \\u0026amp; REWARDS\\u003cbr\\u003e- Limited-time events bring fresh goals and collectible rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Earn rare items, badges, and cute unlocks\\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover new content through regular updates\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👨\\u200d👩\\u200d👧\\u200d👦 FAMILY-FRIENDLY PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003eDog Escape is designed to be a cozy, feel-good experience for dog lovers and it\\u0026#39;s parents approved! It’s great for families and friends looking for light, cute dog games and puppy rescue games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📲 Download Dog Escape today\\u003cbr\\u003eRescue, protect, and care for every puppy in Dog Escape, and build the shelter they deserve. 🏡🐾\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐾 Dog Escape: Puppy Rescue Shelter Story 🐶\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the heartwarming world of Dog Escape! In this fun yet lovely rescue story, your mission is to rescue every lost puppy, bring them to safety, and build a cozy dog shelter they can finally call home. This isn’t just a game, it’s a puppy rescue saga built for dog lovers everywhere!!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready for a blend of dog run, dog chase, and dog games adventure with brainy puzzles and emotional moments that’ll tug at your heartstrings. Whether you\\u0026#39;re dodging obstacles or planning the perfect escape, this is dog escape at its best - fast, fun, and full of heart.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐶 Build \\u0026amp; Grow Your Dog Shelter\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery rescued dog finds a new home in your puppy shelter.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Feed, heal, and take care of your rescued pups\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play meta layers that feel like a cozy dog sim\\u003cbr\\u003e- Expand your space with new zones, puppies, and items\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTurn your rescue efforts into a full-blown dog town for pups of all sizes! This is dog shelter gameplay done right.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Why Players Love Dog Escape\\u003cbr\\u003e- Combines rescue missions with rich emotional payoffs\\u003cbr\\u003e- Includes elements of dog games, puppy rescue games, and shelter care sims\\u003cbr\\u003e- Great for kids, families, and anyone who dreams of helping a dog find a home\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love playing games about puppy town, furry friends, puppies, or dogs, you’ll find everything you need right here and so much more!!\"],\"Sunday.gg\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[n