WjW35fD9DfsdV5rqCxzBIKepYK6KgWHm5WaJZgk_1BC6q3IrHqvDFTQmaIhgSmB6gxZGp445PoNLT\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ViQJMKX19CDAcG15-Rrapx-NfKfPQruaqLXv1_U1z9lxWoH_TW0Q316J96R6lvLI3DVB9017tZ4RtYklvsSAaw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BUh2-xQG84nuCn478VR1sadmQStAJ08kumUEoSss41r7uMFnj6WeLKQQYHieCiSrl7WMkNuAjDfj9p0Hgi_e0w\"]],[null,2,[1440,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FMG2Ui8r8rKZhZC5A6BYcnKWe7tpXIuA_RPUseJg1Gwb5gcF6uoGo0SyRHSr8IrFewRP0HQCdM-jevw3GsoJtWM\"]],[null,2,[1440,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5KM-t1B5gPKX614-xxHyPaMFN7Pcm_ZLV5jyR5MR3pmIzfQYOebFtnh-zdLmWwkjxlJ68qMGDbCRsp9A_Xrj\"]]],\"Loop Master™: Color Jam Sort\",[\"4.8\",4.78877],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.loop.clear.cube.free.card.puzzle.sort.match\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.loop.clear.cube.free.card.puzzle.sort.match\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.loop.clear.cube.free.card.puzzle.sort.match\"]],[\"qgJ/Gn0IfkoTCK2V1v2Ov5YDFYV5hAYdKIIpUvoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCUQo1Ci9jb20ubG9vcC5jbGVhci5jdWJlLmZyZWUuY2FyZC5wdXp6bGUuc29ydC5tYXRjaBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAUQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Loop Master™: Color Jam Sort is a relaxing puzzle with a fresh conveyor twist, blending colorful sorting, smart crate filling, and smooth loop-based logic into a calm but satisfying experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 In Loop Master™: Color Jam Sort, you sort colorful cubes and cards into matching crates in a relaxing conveyor loop puzzle with no timers and no rush. Just pure color sort gameplay that clears your mind while you clear the board. If you love sorting games with unique conveyor mechanics and cozy puzzle vibes, this is your perfect match.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌀 Sorting in Motion\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is more than a simple color sort. The loop keeps everything moving, so timing, order, and space management matter just as much as matching the right colors.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 One Conveyor Loop, One Goal\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Loop Master™: Color Jam Sort, every move is about keeping the conveyor flowing, matching colors efficiently, and making smart use of limited space.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap to send cubes onto the conveyor and set the loop in motion.\\u003cbr\\u003e• As cubes travel around the belt, they wait for the right crate to open up.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Gather four cubes of the same color in one crate to combine them into a complete piece.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKeep the Loop Clear\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Watch the conveyor capacity carefully, because only a limited number of cube groups can stay on the loop at once.\\u003cbr\\u003e• If the conveyor fills up and no useful moves remain, the round comes to an end.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Every open slot can change your next move, so keeping space available is part of the puzzle itself.\\u003cbr\\u003e• In some levels, only the top color is visible at first, while the cubes below stay hidden until they are revealed one by one.\\u003cbr\\u003e• This hidden-color twist makes every early move more important, because one choice can affect which colors appear next.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlan your moves, control the flow, and enjoy the satisfaction of every perfect merge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Tools to Keep the Loop Moving\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen the conveyor gets crowded, the right tool can help you fix mistakes, reopen space, and keep your sorting plan alive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Undo – Take the card on the conveyor back to the box and undo your last move. It’s perfect for correcting a rushed decision before it causes bigger problems.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Shuffle – Select a plank and shuffle the color cubes inside. Use it to reset a tricky arrangement and open up new matching possibilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Extra – Add 2 more capacity slots when you need more room. It gives you valuable breathing space when the loop gets tight and every open spot matters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 More Levels, More Rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery completed level gives you something to look forward to. Win more levels to earn rewards, collect level gifts, and unlock limited-time perks like 30-minute unlimited lives that let you keep playing with fewer interruptions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👍 Why You’ll Love It\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• A fresh conveyor loop twist that makes every sort feel more dynamic.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clean, low-randomness puzzle play where smart planning pays off.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Great for a quick break, with enough depth to keep longer sessions rewarding.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Offline-friendly gameplay that fits wherever you want to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e• A great match for fans of color sorting, card puzzles, and calm brain games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to clear the loop and master the flow? Start Loop Master™: Color Jam Sort now and enjoy a fresh sorting puzzle built around calm strategy and satisfying progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClear the Loop. Match the Card. Sort the Cube.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://orangeonelimited.com/useragreement.html\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://orangeonelimited.com/privacy.html\"],\"Pleasure City\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9L2IDVaYNswL0NIJTY1TcKNGIptFPvZ2IV7XQCBuDQBKZ4z5zwklB4Xx9ngHd_D7WJP54V-veTxKNKJ02ud_XQ\"],null,[151,149,177,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuser