fb7D0r_vAjRk80BgS9JqNPXlEUlKA\"]]],\"Wheelie Master: Moto Ride 3D\",[\"4.5\",4.4649124],\"Racing\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwheelie.master.street.elite.bikegame\\u0026rdid\\u003dwheelie.master.street.elite.bikegame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwheelie.master.street.elite.bikegame\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IgQFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AkAKKgokd2hlZWxpZS5tYXN0ZXIuc3RyZWV0LmVsaXRlLmJpa2VnYW1lEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],null,[null,\"𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗲𝗹𝗶𝗲 𝗠𝗮𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿: 𝗠𝗼𝘁𝗼 𝗥𝗶𝗱𝗲 𝟯𝗗 is a skill-based riding game where balance, timing, and control matter on every road. Get on your motorbike, move through busy city traffic, and keep the front wheel raised as long as you can.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLearn to control speed, lean at the right moment, avoid vehicles, use ramps, and land safely after jumps. The smooth wheelie 3D gameplay is easy to understand, but longer rides require practice and precise control.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy one-wheel riding, bike challenges, or stunt gameplay, every run gives you another chance to improve your skills and discover a better way through the road.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏍 𝗧𝗮𝗸𝗲 𝗢𝗻 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗲𝗹𝗶𝗲 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝗹𝗹𝗲𝗻𝗴𝗲\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKeep your balance while moving through traffic, ramps, and changing road sections. Control your throttle carefully and react quickly when vehicles or obstacles appear ahead.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach wheelie challenge tests your timing and control in a different way. Some roads reward careful riding, while others give you room to jump, flip, and experiment with new moves.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStay balanced, improve your distance, and work toward becoming a true wheelie master.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ 𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗬𝗼𝘂’𝗹𝗹 𝗗𝗼\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏍 Keep the front wheel raised across busy city roads\\u003cbr\\u003e🚦 Dodge traffic and react to changing road conditions\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Perform jumps, flips, and motorbike stunt moves\\u003cbr\\u003e🛞 Control balance, speed, and landing timing\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Enjoy smooth wheelie 3D riding with responsive controls\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Test your reflexes across ramps and obstacles\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Improve your skills with every run\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠️ 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗶𝘇𝗲 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗥𝗶𝗱𝗲\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your collection and choose a motorbike that matches your style.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock different bikes and skins as you play. Try new looks, switch between available rides, and head back onto the road to practice your control.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDifferent setups can make each run feel fresh while you continue improving your timing and riding technique.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 𝗚𝗮𝗺𝗲 𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝘀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Easy and responsive controls\\u003cbr\\u003e* Smooth 3D riding gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e* Fun physics and natural handling\\u003cbr\\u003e* Traffic, ramps, obstacles, and varied road sections\\u003cbr\\u003e* Different bikes and skins to unlock\\u003cbr\\u003e* Skill-based balance and timing challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e* Jump and stunt action with clean landings\\u003cbr\\u003e* Fast sessions that are simple to start and challenging to master\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery run starts with a simple goal: stay in control for as long as possible. Build speed when the road is clear, adjust your balance when traffic gets tight, and prepare carefully before using ramps.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you improve, you can connect longer rides with jumps and flips. A clean motorbike stunt depends on good timing in the air and a stable landing, so rushing is not always the best choice.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe wheelie 3D experience focuses on simple controls with room for skill. New players can quickly understand the basics, while experienced riders can work on longer distances, cleaner landings, and more controlled movement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can also experiment with different routes and bikes to find the setup that feels right for you. Take on another wheelie challenge as you practice through busy sections, learn when to slow down, and use open road sections to regain control.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you enjoy motorbike games, stunt challenges, or skill-based riding, there is always another run to improve.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you stay balanced through traffic and become the next wheelie master?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e𝗥𝗶𝗱𝗲, 𝗯𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲, 𝗷𝘂𝗺𝗽, 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗺𝗮𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗿𝗼𝗮𝗱 𝗶𝗻 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗲𝗹𝗶𝗲 𝗠𝗮𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿: 𝗠𝗼𝘁𝗼 𝗥𝗶𝗱𝗲 𝟯𝗗!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFor support, feedback, or suggestions, email us at gamewayfu@wayfustudio.com.\"],\"Wayfu Game Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LyAEKxHD_E6-6cMKCDbctB_TPMCE8DtNKsB9HMIGnG760r8v5pEhV43-pC8yCpCaCC35Y3dEbi-n6i6E537u-HU\"],null,[206,146,69,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,nu