with realistic car driving simulator!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you looking for the thrill of driving car simulator like super luxury cars, engaging in fast, furious and realistic driving experiences? Do you want to become a racing master in the wackiest, winningest car game? Keep this addictive car game in your pocket and you\\u0026#39;ll get to experience everything you desire and never know what\\u0026#39;s coming next around the track\\u0026#39;s twists and turns.\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect coins to unlock high-end vehicles, customize your own supercars, explore breathtaking environments, compete against top racers worldwide and time-limited events in this car racing game to become a race master. Get your car prepped, fine tune your ride, keep your foot on the gas and race against other players from all over the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBe the racing master in this amazing extreme car game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eWith this Car Race 3D game, you can:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Experience many unique car racing levels with a huge range of different surfaces and obstacles to race over and around at breakneck speed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Go head-to-head against top racing master around the world in real-time challenges to get more rewards and coins for upgrades. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Customize your dream supercars by selecting authentic engines, luxury add-ons, and bold designs.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore special modes and take on exciting challenges to prove car master skills in the car game\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy outstanding 3D graphics and the rich sound world of Car Race 3D that make you feel like you\\u0026#39;re driving a real car racing, with supercar details, environments, and crash effects while playing the car game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eThe perfect car racing game experience!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo not miss out a racing game that’s easy to play, provides real driving challenges, and offers excitement and endless variation, cools cars and dangerous rivals, all in ultimate races that can be run in a matter of minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the car game today to find out if you can become the racing master of our most adventurous, amusing and challenging tracks!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCar Race - A product developed by iKame Games.\"],\"iKame Games - Zego Studio\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZAz-B4CYbtHW-HyoRVfGHNrAvrqUg3-nCkl88IQGrBQzHHr-fPnO3dsuhFoKWuma3_0rt73Lbp-HAtmB0Jme\"],null,[128,157,206,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.dino.race.master\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.dino.race.master\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $21.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Racing\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Stunt driving\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],