ogleusercontent.com/xp9SNaTt8c1-wHb5BFofIvAxLoTMaOQcWJ1GNRXynhkHaiUre3G3hokPLd8MPeeUsGyMO7VKG-GeicmT_WVZKw\"]]],\"Foodstars: Merge \\u0026 Cook\",[\"4.6\",4.585284],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.game.foodstars\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.merge.game.foodstars\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.merge.game.foodstars\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIhAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjQKHgoYY29tLm1lcmdlLmdhbWUuZm9vZHN0YXJzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"4L9MwUHStsY\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:4L9MwUHStsY?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:4L9MwUHStsY\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkAWdZSTzWj5Mt6ayDKuqGc46-FEpjc5E3FdqDTIrdSV9eKCDUf0FHQdAPYnzlpDGw1dnNqAkeIGoqo4fWhFxXyffl_gZM5XwaETZN21m5IFckFqJm7vGdwBwTgyJNfQ1mkNRfZakwWrYBYmDNeojPiKMgPDEwM3FfzTTMpX_sGBVGpU2gHDvhFmGwgmtlLAyPAbXnW7EQ3oyAr1DL1YLUEUO0H9DK-9WY8n3CHgv8JV6PFurXo424lFPofZEU-4HYahLwA1KVBDSiK3lQwT0cJhl6Ydr4atCKU6Tm_-lEp8g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4L9MwUHStsY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Dream of becoming a Star Chef? Now’s your chance!\\u003cbr\\u003eEver imagined learning the secrets to perfect macarons in a Parisian kitchen under a Michelin-starred chef?\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Foodstars – the ultimate cooking adventure where global flavors meet culinary creativity!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍅 Merge Ingredients \\u0026amp; Discover Secret Recipes\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom recreating Italian classics with tomatoes and basil, to savoring refined French flair with gin and lemons, and even to experiencing the authentic taste of Germany with sausages and bread rolls, you can merge ingredients and unlock hundreds of mouthwatering recipes from around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍽️ Design Dream Restaurants Across the Globe\\u003cbr\\u003eRenovate unique restaurants, from a roadside diner in New York to a traditional Kaiseki eatery in Tokyo, from Marseille’s bustling seafood bistro to a cozy coconut curry spot in Thailand. Complete orders and renovation tasks to rise to culinary fame!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👨\\u200d🍳 Train Under World-Class Chefs\\u003cbr\\u003eTravel the world and take on challenges from world-class chefs with different personalities. Complete Chef\\u0026#39;s Trials to earn their recognition and master their signature dishes!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 Collect 500+ Recipes \\u0026amp; Earn Michelin-Level Chef Stars\\u003cbr\\u003eShow off your skills in global cooking challenges, master regional cuisines, and earn prestigious Chef Star badges. Will you rise to become a Foodstars legend?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Download Foodstars now and start your journey from kitchen rookie to star chef!\"],\"Happibits Game\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ID8FpOGBbi0M3056hON-QynS3xki-OITZIDAXZg8VXpiJc5fochweqKkENtl-C_VVPaXeaxBjFrNxYtar4refA\"],null,[236,221,194,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,