ee multiplayer games*\\u003cbr\\u003eAdventure, action, strategy, puzzle - there’s something for everyone. Play solo or team up with friends, anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*Play and Connect*\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet new friends or invite your crew. Join live games, chat, and share moments as you play together. Complete quests, unlock rewards, and climb leaderboards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*Show Your Style*\\u003cbr\\u003ePersonalize your avatar with fresh outfits, hairstyles, and emotes. Make your look as bold or chill as you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*Share Your Moments*\\u003cbr\\u003eExpress yourself and relive your favorite moments by sharing photos and videos, including spatial media and cloud content, with your friends.\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to jump in? Download Meta Horizon and start exploring, playing, and connecting today.\"],\"Meta Platforms Inc\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ETIBfcYHndx7f2AzT0zsIsC63GezH5pK1LlGQN8vnTjYR3foLHLtI3SUBuNaPOAopJ6ocR9v0RwpAzA6oPIyjQ\"],null,[0,0,0,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Diverse Content: Discretion Advised\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-App Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oculus.twilight\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oculus.twilight\\u