ontent.com/azQOa-YV4vIJe2wTtfJZ-TlX3cm-c6tSLhcD-gnGYuig62iE616lSECrvp6chNyBz0RhvUCXwY2QRzTYJxMheJ0\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PJvS1kh0bI7uJ5SBOybT8ckl8aZVsJ0UmP5MGZqbDYk7jXjOp98Akh0EPCed-DGws2NF4dGhMhbN0MLHmunF4w\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lz5CGZg417w8GmyAlUpnyXxN_8tt-8xcSeBtXd9O_DI5VPBLtIY88P0AVxZmdkmJxnebSELqhZ2U0mId8CZl4w\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mYwXohPBgwCxh7xihmUIeQaS-9H_moItnAzoonCGJ5g8gRi-m44q71k_begHvH0X7MG5jd7613b0g_biMbK7TQ\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/p9HGZGCPezosfid8ZnHI3aBKe0ZAerdjehwIaA0A2KmWqvz8GGxgasPhDILK7FPfrYoHXV0KC5BuiO8E8vGX6A\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/azQOa-YV4vIJe2wTtfJZ-TlX3cm-c6tSLhcD-gnGYuig62iE616lSECrvp6chNyBz0RhvUCXwY2QRzTYJxMheJ0\"]]],\"Vigor Mahjong\",[\"4.8\",4.8236938],\"Board\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.godlike.vigormahjong\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.godlike.vigormahjong\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.godlike.vigormahjong\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIiAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjQKHgoYY29tLmdvZGxpa2Uudmlnb3JtYWhqb25nEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"Get ready for an exclusive and original Mahjong Solitaire game! Vigor Mahjong combines innovation with classic gameplay of Tile Matching, meticulously crafted for the senior audience. It offers large tiles and a user-friendly interface compatible with pads and phones.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEscape in the tranquil beauty of Vigor Mahjong where hundreds of tile matching puzzles are ready to solve in this popular game of strategy, memory, and skill. Our goal is to provide a relaxing yet mentally engaging gaming experience, particularly focused on older adults.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003eThe goal of the game Mahjong Solitaire is to remove all the Mahjong tiles on the board by matching pairs of Mahjong tiles. Tap or slide two matching tiles, and they will disappear from the puzzle board. You can only remove majong tiles that are free and not covered. When all tiles are removed from the board, it signifies successful completion of a mahjong game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVigor Mahjong Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Immerse yourself in breathtaking graphics and beautifully crafted tile designs that staying true to the original gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Large, easily readable font sizes to alleviate the strain caused by small texts.\\u003cbr\\u003e- From classic layouts to unique puzzles, Vigor Mahjong offers over 20,000 levels to keep you entertained for hours.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose your own score system: no timer, no pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e- When you consecutively match mahjong tiles during the game, you will unlock special combos.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Use HINTS or SHUFFLE tiles for ease of play. Earn extra points when you solve puzzles without help.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Special daily challenges available for you to complete each day.\\u003cbr\\u003e- No Wifi, no problem! Play offline if you wish.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay among gorgeous backgrounds, relaxing sounds, and unique themes to match any mood in Vigor Mahjong now!\"],\"CanaryDroid\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DxniebgebuGCRxqcwZE1nbuXe2SKoE8H6qASXnpznX4iiwmStbf6V-N_hhiAGlhu6yJTzkw5kS8Ks0qISvdpvQ\"],null,[4,70,36,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"http