jgsz9rgzvMOWiVuX5KyLHcPRkDCtccmpbdU7CafPP8Q\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ly_FyhsLWvC6m45NDfRaGCNQbfGXZO7VbD67eyQvfoSf7O52a8NZygxGzkQgZ2p4NeaUvByYoeRVilGRSy0H\"]],[null,2,[1440,2560],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zovc-wZznFdiPRREaXFz_aVyYEIBYpzpK8mSjNdEhtl7OI_7wsVCEGt-3Xb8E3tjkEzCrhdbfnW8qITPEVZboHA\"]]],\"Tiles Survive!\",[\"4.3\",4.3317795],\"Strategy\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funplus.ts.global\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.funplus.ts.global\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funplus.ts.global\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IiQFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjEKGwoVY29tLmZ1bnBsdXMudHMuZ2xvYmFsEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"Enter the world of \\u0026quot;Tiles Survive!\\u0026quot; and guide your team of survivors through a harsh wilderness. As the core of your survivor team, explore the wild, gather key resources, and use them wisely to strengthen your shelter.\\u003cbr\\u003eVenture into different tiles and expand your territory. Improve how you manage resources, build and upgrade structures, and connect electricity to speed up production. Create a self-sufficient shelter where every decision shapes your survivors’ future.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Operations \\u0026amp; Management\\u003cbr\\u003eEnhance your production structures for smoother workflows. Use electricity to run your shelter more efficiently. Unlock and upgrade more structures to meet your growing needs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Assign Survivors\\u003cbr\\u003eAssign jobs to your survivors, like hunters, chefs, or lumberjacks. Pay attention to their health and morale to keep productivity high.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Resource Collection\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore further and discover unique resources in different biomes. Gather and use every resource to your advantage.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Multi-map \\u0026amp; Collectibles\\u003cbr\\u003eTravel through multiple maps to find loot and special items. Bring them back to decorate and improve your shelter.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Recruit Heroes\\u003cbr\\u003eFind heroes with special skills and traits who boost your shelter’s capabilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Form Alliances\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with friends to stand against common threats, such as severe weather and wild creatures.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn \\u0026quot;Tiles Survive!\\u0026quot;, every choice matters. How you manage resources, plan your shelter, and explore the unknown will decide your fate. Are you ready to face the challenge and thrive in the wild? Download now and begin your epic adventure!\"],\"FunPlus International AG\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BMdiIZIq18kiW-f1Ak2xzME39eMXTJ0liha2CSv3ugte0PCpEhto3qj08KKPvQ1Qwoobb6aE_i5Xx9IT_6atgTA\"],null,[237,245,243,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence, Mild Blood\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,