qqsxfOc4/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"From the creators of Toy Blast comes the ultimate puzzle game with unique gameplay and endless fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter the crazy cartoon world starring Cooper Cat, Wally Wolf, Bruno Bear and enjoy loads of whacky and challenging levels! Blast cubes and create powerful combos to pass levels. Solve puzzles to help the Toon gang as they travel around magical worlds! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the wildest adventure of your life and have a BLAST!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e● Complete tons of challenging levels and unlock new episodes!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Play with unique game objectives and dozens of entertaining obstacles!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Unlock whacky boosters to blast your way to the next level!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Collect stars by completing levels to win awesome rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Create your own team \\u0026amp; compete with others to rule the puzzle world! \\u003cbr\\u003e● Receive lives from your teammates to keep on playing! \\u003cbr\\u003e● Sync your game easily between your phone and tablet!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Easy and fun to play yet challenging to master!\"],\"Peak\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4CWw3VSpzuSc877HySfyIoyK9pG14wd3fL43GkyPhT3M8XEUtOGXQobA_zZAlO3TJKC2b7cipHMfYtUeppGGNOs\"],null,[217,124,54,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,nu