null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sRBQrAXPslKFocxIFIuLyVZjy5jsw5tFfx1eWfkkNBd_J0Z5Wh-48ENTMREFTZkivFl-_LmjlswJQmtAEZWel7Y\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DDO7ln_sv3l2S4G54rhP23awJxHd-FzI6h7n6FYRA3OXI4ll97edQ-VVCpg8xX_tIBo0zE0bakcTB7qKevoPaD4\"]]],\"Mystery Town: Merge Games\",[\"4.8\",4.8390446],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cedargames.mysterytown\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cedargames.mysterytown\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cedargames.mysterytown\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIjAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjYKIAoaY29tLmNlZGFyZ2FtZXMubXlzdGVyeXRvd24QARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Embark on a mysterious investigation in Mystery Town: Merge Games！\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you merge everything into better and more useful items to solve thrilling puzzles? In Mystery Town, every match counts! Uncover hidden secrets and discover that here, the right merge can change everything.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Mystery Town, where you can unlock new themed adventures every week—experience cooking delicious food, hunt for clues, catch culprits in new cases, and rebuild parts of the town you\\u0026#39;ll love.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a world where your merge skills help you restore a broken town, uncover hidden truths, and perhaps even find love. Join Aurora on an exciting quest and discover the truth about her uncle\\u0026#39;s sudden disappearance.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 MATCH \\u0026amp; MERGE\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match \\u0026amp; Merge: Drag identical items to upgrade them into powerful tools.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete orders to help upgrade buildings and restore the town. Start with your house!\\u003cbr\\u003e• Infinite Variety: Explore hundreds of levels and discover over 500+ fantastic objects.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Satisfying Gameplay: Experience the ultimate puzzle game flow—simple, relaxing, and addictive!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌍 UNLOCK NEW THEMED ADVENTURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003d Discover and restore a mysterious world—from dusty mansion halls to the foggy harbor.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003d Unlock breathtaking new areas and serene landscapes as you progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003d Build your perfect town while solving challenging puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔍 SOLVE THE TOWN MYSTERY\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hunt for Clues: Catch culprits in new cases and piece together hidden evidence.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Drama \\u0026amp; Secrets: Meet intriguing characters—who can you trust in this mystery?\\u003cbr\\u003e• Follow the Story: Every match brings Aurora closer to the town\\u0026#39;s FINAL secrets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 REBUILD THE TOWN YOU LOVE\\u003cbr\\u003e• Restore \\u0026amp; Design: Use your merge rewards to rebuild parts of the town you\\u0026#39;ll love.\\u003cbr\\u003e• From Ruin to Glory: Transform the dusty mansion into breathtaking landscapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Personalize: Be the hero of Mystery Town and build your perfect world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to uncover the truth?\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mystery Town: Merge Games now and start your investigation today! ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLearn more about the game on our Facebook Fan Page!\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/MysteryTownGame/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eContact Us: Click on the feedback icon on the map of town in the game (feel free to reach out to us!)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://cedargamestudio.com/tos.html\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://cedargamestudio.com/pp.html\\u003cbr\\u003eSend us Emails: mysterytown-support@cedargamestudio.com\"],\"Cedar Games Studio\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null