gJLLP5iVAnaoQExpcc6ZW_CK0QucUjjj4L-QHDYQ1Sufe8C6bg\"]]],\"Word Connect Association\",[\"4.8\",4.783415],\"Word\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003din.playsimple.wordtrip.association\\u0026rdid\\u003din.playsimple.wordtrip.association\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003din.playsimple.wordtrip.association\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIjwFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6Aj4KKAoiaW4ucGxheXNpbXBsZS53b3JkdHJpcC5hc3NvY2lhdGlvbhABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Word Connect Association: A Fun and Addictive Word Puzzle Game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you enjoy brain games and word matching challenges? Then get ready to explore Word Connect Association — a clever mix of word puzzles, matching logic, and associative thinking. And yes, it’s completely free to play!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 How to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn every level, you\\u0026#39;ll see a group of words that appear random.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour goal: figure out how the words are related — by category, theme, or concept.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFind connections even when the answers aren’t obvious.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDrag and connect the right words to complete the puzzle!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAs you progress, the word puzzles become more challenging, keeping your brain active and entertained. It’s more than just a typical word game — it’s a smart and calming way to test your mind and expand your vocabulary.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 What Word Connect Association Helps With:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnhancing logic and word association skills\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStrengthening memory and cognitive flexibility\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrowing your vocabulary and knowledge\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you’re into word linking games, category puzzles, or relaxing word challenges, you’ll love this!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Why You’ll Keep Coming Back:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHundreds of levels full of interesting word combinations\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBeautifully designed categories and clever associations\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCalming, no-pressure gameplay for all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA fresh new word puzzle experience every time\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re a fan of word puzzle apps, daily brain games, or relaxing logic games — Word Connect Association is a must-try. Discover how many word connections you can master and keep your brain in top shape!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Start playing Word Connect Association now and enjoy the most satisfying word puzzle journey!!\"],\"PlaySimple Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W9GBv3MTf2q-8AVS8bITdN67De7Bw0SFuS6ZbuUg2zFfTbgark4UXMvAODEzOHb4wcBDfd37pn9U1fF_Vxx2\"],null,[89,118,223,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,nul