tps://i.ytimg.com/vi/vPl_B-yfeHA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Number Match is a logic puzzle game with simple rules: match pairs of numbers and clear the board to succeed. Playing Number Match is a useful pastime for your brain. Train your logic and concentration skills, and try to beat your high score in the numbers game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTry a mobile version of the pen and paper game from your childhood, known as Take Ten, Numberama or 10 Seeds. Now you can take your logic number game with you wherever you go. Solving free Number Match puzzles on mobile is much easier than using a pencil and paper.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImmerse yourself in the world of math number games! Take a break and play Number Match puzzles whenever you feel tired or bored. Refresh yourself by solving addictive logic and math puzzles and matching numbers! If you like classic board games, try Number Match. Enjoy the magic of digits and give your brain a great time. Become a match number master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNumber Match is an easy to learn math game that puts your gray matter to work! Merge numbers to clear the board. Coordinate your eyes, hands and mind. Enjoy hours of fun with this free number game. Time flies when you\\u0026#39;re having fun with this number drop game! Install the number game now to try it and you won\\u0026#39;t be able to stop!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to play this logic puzzle:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• The goal is to clear all the numbers from the board.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Find pairs of equal numbers (1 and 1, 7 and 7) or pairs that add up to 10 (6 and 4, 8 and 2) on the number grid.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap on the numbers one by one to cross out them and get points.\\u003cbr\\u003e• You can connect pairs in adjacent horizontal, vertical and diagonal cells, as well as at the end of one line and the beginning of the next.\\u003cbr\\u003e• If you run out of moves, you can add the remaining numbers to extra lines at the bottom.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Speed up your progress with Hints if you are stuck in this math game.\\u003cbr\\u003e• You win once all the numbers are removed from the number puzzle grid.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBeat Your Score\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe emptier the board is, the better your score! Score the most points by crossing out all the numbers on the field (+150 points), and removing rows (+10 points). Score +4 points by connecting numbers that are far apart. Merge numbers and enjoy these math puzzles!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThere are a lot of ways to solve the logic number puzzle. But it’s not as easy as it seems. Tease your brain and enjoy an engaging number games experience! If you like merging numbers mechanics, you will definitely enjoy this logic game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat you get:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy to learn logic puzzle\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hours of gameplay in this number merge games\\u003cbr\\u003e• Daily Challenges. Play every day, complete daily challenges for a given month, and win unique trophies\\u003cbr\\u003e• Seasonal Events. Take part in game events and open exclusive postcards\\u003cbr\\u003e• No time limit, so no rush, just relax playing math number games\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hints to help you reach the goal faster\\u003cbr\\u003e• New math game with numbers from a top developer!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge your brain and logic with Number Match puzzle and become a master! Play this number game anywhere, anytime!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://easybrain.com/terms\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://easybrain.com/privacy\"],\"Easybrain\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pjw3Qr9U_rEA-YBp64LxWl8U1Ua3X6SOBXPJFkzdtkST1OxW4UGVobdmq-CWJKPEZojXE8EwGimxfBKDfgBf9A\"],null,[46,134,237,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"htt