ir to perform flips. It perfectly restores the whole diving process: flip, twist and dive into the water.Master your charging strength and flip rhythm to make textbook-perfect splash-free entries, earn high scores and unlock great rewards.Advance through levels to unlock harder flip moves and brand-new scenes. Relaxing and addictive! Join the pool party right now and become a master of the splash disappearing trick!\"],\"Free Inc Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_c6dMDbTvVsB6wTBb9tJ7xPcwTYGb5GyfZ_jwD0KjiYbCDthYjkWmfiaHph6m-RPa4cv5M525iea1ppoKc5Hng\"],null,[71,227,250,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.thefree.gosplash\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.thefree.gosplash\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.tripledot.spades\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9uG8gxzLlOwzecNcd9p_wDQYC