xnceWhHkQMP6smpMowFffnEGyOm\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Gw8Xwzx2_fp-J_xXMNxoY-t2eTQ4ZsUeXhFhnpuz11FfCv2No_SJSbRGtAIs-pA6cKnKnRKWHL2J6PsGugqSyg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kAzcO0NCRlJdMBPekK-w7bJ-QyiQiOSQ9aAC63HsdwP_jBQqNLtdqu4-P1JTd2y6Rw0UXFZeK2RRb2Ws9hsb\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GcpYhH0G09wBq5kqhq4t_fNj0rlFNtIFL-qjQk3KNTnu9guxNte6Auapzk0fP1xLZ7NAp4niTZCEg8kjbNCx\"]]],\"Spades - Classic Cards\",[\"4.9\",4.859375],\"Card\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.spades\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tripledot.spades\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.spades\"]],[\"qgJfGl0IlAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjAKGgoUY29tLnRyaXBsZWRvdC5zcGFkZXMQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Join the Ultimate Card Playing Community and Experience Spades Like Never Before!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the world of Spades! Spades adult card games offer an unparalleled experience, bringing you the classic card game with modern twists and exciting game modes. Whether you\\u0026#39;re a seasoned player or a beginner, there\\u0026#39;s something for everyone! Enjoy the thrill of one of the best offline card games with the timeless fun of classic cards games like Spades.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAmazing Graphics and Smooth Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy stunning graphics and crisp card animations that make classic card games a visual treat. Our intuitive interface and seamless gameplay ensure you have the best Spades classic card game experience on your mobile device. Each playing cards deck has been beautifully designed to give you the best experience possible. Whether you\\u0026#39;re playing online or Spades offline, our game offers the ultimate offline games experience for fans of classic card games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures\\u003cbr\\u003eClassic Games: The card games you love, reimaged for the 21st Century\\u003cbr\\u003eDifficulty Levels: Choose from various difficulty settings to match your expertise in card games.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy thrilling classic card games for every mood\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlimited Hints and Undos: Learn and perfect your Spades card game with helpful hints and the ability to undo moves. The ultimate way to become one of our Spades masters \\u003cbr\\u003eAuto-Save: Never lose your progress with auto-save, ensuring you can pick up right where you left off \\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Spades Offline: Play anytime, anywhere with Spades offline mode\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Wait? Join the Spades Revolution Now!\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you love classic games? Playing card games has been reinvented with Spades. Whether you\\u0026#39;re here to relax and enjoy a casual game or to compete and become one of our Spades masters, our app has it all. Play Spades your way and elevate your card game experience! Experience one of the best classic cards games online or enjoy offline card games anytime. Play the Spades card game your way and elevate your Spades classic card game experience. With Spades offline, you can enjoy one of the top offline games anytime, anywhere!\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover why millions of players can’t get enough of our immersive card games experience. From the nostalgia of classic games to the challenge of modern twists, Spades offline game offers entertainment for all skill levels. Whether you’re relaxing at home or competing against friends, our game delivers the excitement and sophistication that fans of adult card games love. Join the action, sharpen your strategy, and make every hand a memorable one\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to dive into the ultimate Spades card game experience? Whether you\\u0026#39;re a fan of classic cards games or looking for the best offline card games, our app has everything you need. Enjoy endless fun with Spades offline, and take your skills to the next level with one of the top offline games. Plus our adult card games are designed specifically to be easy to pick up and hard to put down. Perfect to train your brain and focus your mind. Download now and join millions of players in the best Spades classic card game adventure today!\"],\"Tripledot Studios Limited\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zVakaM1GDgiuN05_xU2cYLIbU75HgtyhMWr8082_-qALQRcHXFSVtmELi7p9YCfIM2VZU7Kp5UwCT1iUzb3Tng\"],null,[5,138,1,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tripledot.spades\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tripledot.spades\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[