OxikGo9AQaOijgP50RY6XttMz5LCy\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FGsnC_RYeb_8Tm9_6OPy-RxPrFLfGAHS8y5UdMA7Eb6_pvqa-yzJ6PI7Qqx0sufxQpKR7PRG2dWDUsFe1DGLpw\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SGJDYQhIwbDc0nqZK7s8N9noflqt0YeZytdIQJAWB6KgWXWdUhinzkJfTHU6G8ydPBNaHVr4r2_Y0LsVkq1I\"]]],\"My Perfect Hotel\",[\"4.6\",4.553668],\"Arcade\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.master.hotelmaster\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.master.hotelmaster\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.master.hotelmaster\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIlQFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6ARcKFQjEwuvd7+zkj0MSCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMgocChZjb20ubWFzdGVyLmhvdGVsbWFzdGVyEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"6rcVjMYFwg8\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:6rcVjMYFwg8?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:6rcVjMYFwg8\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezl9kZslYyzqjMQrwKizrFzKe69UPWv5URXbexqlAH7mfdfHbwiaDzybeJdqb0fkvrHOE4j50vA5tDfTiJqLClXr5Uneu6TLFTH9BevfHMvkyUtbbBRQiIzyEYPocCEFR-lcGsSYiGDoLIjRxg44vFO6wbLhpcHM7PYItzNFMckPGrGzC_5wFBG__FxOQXl2QqPvQV4fddhDnIfUOsEtbzpj-P2_KARcdB2b8c7Uiihr1wN5GqJoSIp_VJX3KRYqOC4Wj96X7p-GRemEpIpZvuUQehWEwtBYHtc0rQ49Yo3v_g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6rcVjMYFwg8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"😍 \\u003cb\\u003eA GAME TO KEEP YOU FULLY OCCUPIED\\u003c/b\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEver dreamed of running your own hotel? Start from the ground up in this fun and fast-paced time-management game where the aim is to build an accommodation empire and demonstrate your dedication to hospitality.  \\u003ci\\u003eShow your skills as a hotel manager, invest wisely in staff and property improvements, and work your socks off to become a hospitality tycoon in this addictive and entertaining casual simulator.\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFIRST-CLASS SERVICE\\u003c/b\\u003e 🎩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧳 \\u003cb\\u003eClimb to the top:\\u003c/b\\u003e Start the game as a simple bellhop single-handedly cleaning rooms, greeting guests at reception, collecting payments and tips, and keeping the bathroom stocked with toilet paper. As your bank balance expands, upgrade rooms and facilities, and employ new staff to help keep up with the growing demand at your hotel. Your guests may be sleeping comfortably, but there’s no time to rest for a determined hotel tycoon.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏨 \\u003cb\\u003eBuild an empire: \\u003c/b\\u003eThere are several hotels to explore and expand, each with dozens of different unique upgrades to make before you reach five-star perfection. Open hotels on the coast, in beautiful mountains, and deep in the tranquillity of a forest setting. Demonstrate your competence as a manager in each location, then get promoted to get a new and bigger property, and continue your path to becoming a true hotel tycoon. Each hotel has its own style and atmosphere too.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔑 \\u003cb\\u003eKeep going: \\u003c/b\\u003eIf you want success in this high-stakes industry, you can’t just stroll around your property at a leisurely pace. Upgrade your and your employees’ movement speed to work faster and provide your guests with all the services they need ASAP — it’ll boost your revenue too.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💰 \\u003cb\\u003eAmenities are the answer: \\u003c/b\\u003eMaximise profits and get more funds to invest in this fun simulator by ensuring your hotels have all available amenities. Bathrooms are the first step, but work hard and you’ll soon have the opportunity to add vending machines, restaurants, parking lots, and swimming pools to your properties. Guests will pay extra for each facility, boosting your revenue. Though remember each facility also needs staffing, so get hiring or you’ll soon run off your feet with angry guests left standing in line for each amenity.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👔 \\u003cb\\u003eHuman resources: \\u003c/b\\u003e: It also takes work to run each facility: the bathrooms must be stocked with toilet paper, guests must be granted access to the parking lot, in the restaurant customers need to be served and the tables need clearing after they’ve eaten, and at the pool you need to ensure a constant supply of clean towels and tidy sun loungers. You won’t have time to do it all yourself, so hire new staff, or you’ll soon have angry guests left standing in line. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎀 \\u003cb\\u003eGrand designs: \\u003c/b\\u003eUpgrade accommodation to improve guests’ experience of your property and choose from a range of different room designs in each location. In this engaging simulator, you’re not just a manager, you’re an interior designer too!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e ⭐ \\u003cb\\u003eFIVE-STAR FUN\\u003c/b\\u003e ⭐\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for a time-management game that’s original and simple to play and provides endless hours of entertainment? Dive straight into the fast-paced world of hospitality provision and develop your skills as a manager, investor, and designer. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cu\\u003eDownload My Perfect Hotel now and get to work building an accommodation empire.\\u003c/u\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l0H3kNG-9-8y3DHj9GUv1Vtk6XsS5nEZg6xmSiGonVwDUehcxiZoR59_eNFOjaOB1TnRmtoOINgp_SsAfkcDCA\"],null,[254,217,135,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.master.hotelmaster\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.master.hotelmaster\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Arcade\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Simulation\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Tycoon\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.tfgco.apps.coloring.free.color.by.number\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XRROCU10EenYkIVwgELctilhZRq4n9EX-G5aCaW4LaAgTVyczXN93lukhtq2RhyNV4Kzy5mKohW8VVhKJfTA9Q\"],null,[245,245,245,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XJt6V1T16npWkar_9ObRag9F52Pgi1Rkws0u8aX9tTBP8AVHJCuWK04DK1E98wGADtYUf7xManDEbu41t_usZw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gRiFr7rSlGKtZ1YaOtPTdif48lLAp7lh9l_K_SE-OqrBUAGL5-TBpFPJ9VyUVXZ_TWh25pvrVVHNg6upiEgwhw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jMuhf9-WqPxU8pwRRsrvpONHo93sn6QQmw3J_keC4fYElUPYv5afq67fKBVztnNo7Hher_jfYCb5anp1zczI