y\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsorting.games.goods.sort.triple.match3d.puzzle.stuff\\u0026rdid\\u003dsorting.games.goods.sort.triple.match3d.puzzle.stuff\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsorting.games.goods.sort.triple.match3d.puzzle.stuff\"]],[\"qgJ/Gn0ImAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AlAKOgo0c29ydGluZy5nYW1lcy5nb29kcy5zb3J0LnRyaXBsZS5tYXRjaDNkLnB1enpsZS5zdHVmZhABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"YlkgdLyM67A\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:YlkgdLyM67A?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:YlkgdLyM67A\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkub14zJGQuwvggbfds6vekgagoKqd5hRIRVrISjIAFEAKYS8Kw_N0BvjiIKK5GmjEQ2-117Xhcu_cgk-vcbVurnMkETEeVjq1V_sHUoPfyCMjk0dRIW7CXi8EwrZb0m91sV1Ol-Qf7w2rn5Bk0al6bd7_JLNGJ6NMUMw9RZVizDfpJMvYnzg-lF-BsxG60gKXDbQ6nye49TyfaBbJcB_SfAalVdkd2rt5CblCm2CLAcILdIQlZalFLCOgyW4uh5BMZ8aH3JEk5TihG8Cjoju5qSUmZs9ex2C_8E7t8LMvWmA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YlkgdLyM67A/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eGet ready for an exciting matching adventure like never before in Goods Puzzle: 3D Sorting Games!\\u003c/b\\u003e Sort multiple goods, organize the shelves, and enjoy your leisure time to become a 3D sorting game master!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍒🍒🍒Looking for relaxing sorting games where you can sort, match, and explore? Curious about your skills in turning chaos into order within a time limit? Then this FREE and addictive triple sorting game is sure to provide you with a perfect experience. It combines triple-match gameplay, strategic sorting games, 3D matching, and engaging puzzle elements. It\\u0026#39;s time to match, solve challenging puzzles, and enjoy the fun of sorting goods!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌼🌼🌼In the classic triple match and sorting games, your task is to help sellers sort and classify a wide range of goods on the shelves. Match 3 identical goods to eliminate them and make room for new challenges. But remember, time is ticking! Perfectly organize everything before time runs out and win the sorting games for free. Sort goods, test your speed, and clear your mind now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 \\u003cb\\u003eCool Features of Goods Matching Games\\u003c/b\\u003e 🎁\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍔 FREE to play captivating sorting puzzle games\\u003cbr\\u003e🥤 Engaging 3D graphics and intuitive triple-match gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e🍭 Tons of challenging levels with varied difficulty\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 300 types of 3D goods in visually appealing categories for sorting games\\u003cbr\\u003e🍊 Enjoy endless sorting fun with dozens of unique shelving arrangements\\u003cbr\\u003e🌻 Super boosters to help you overcome obstacles \\u0026amp; clear levels\\u003cbr\\u003e🎭 Simple tap-and-drag controls for a smooth experience in match 3D sorting games\\u003cbr\\u003e🌀 Time-based sorting games that enhance quick-thinking skills\\u003cbr\\u003e🍧 Play Goods Triple Match: Sorting 3D anywhere, anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e🍎 Stress-relieving and mind-healing sorting games for adults\\u003cbr\\u003e🍉 A great way to improve your memory, attention, and problem-solving skills\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 \\u003cb\\u003eHow to Play Sorting Games\\u003c/b\\u003e 🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Drag and drop 3D items to several shelves for triple-match\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Collect 3 identical items to clear them\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Use powerful boosters strategically to manage more difficult sorting games or to freeze time\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Sort all goods before time expires to earn rewards and unlock new sorting games\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGoods Puzzle: 3D Sorting Games offers countless levels with vivid 3D object designs, from delicious snacks🍰 and refreshing drinks🍹 to adorable figurines🧸 and everyday essentials🥫. With intuitive 3D gameplay, simple but stunning graphics, and abundant rewards in match 3 games, you can not only experience the joy in the shopping mall but also step into a world of triple tile sorting games with brain challenges and mind relaxation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you up for the fun and enjoyable match 3D sorting games? Unlock a wide variety of goods and challenge your brainpower in this delightful mix of 3D matching and sorting games journey!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://goods.gurugame.ai/policy.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://goods.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html\"],\"Guru Puzzle Game\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6SduFYlqFA2Jp-nhyn1afgB7ulBK2fOwdAXeN1-Hnv1Q31ixFkM9MCWmEF_I61HK6yJ1M-TCLpHbC1ywEBAtoQ\"],null,[216,184,188,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dsorting.games.goods.sort.triple.match3d.puzzle.stuff\\u0026rdid\\u003dsorting.games.goods.sort.triple.match3d.puzzle.stuff\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CA