u003cbr\\u003e【Extreme battles in 10-minute matches】\\u003cbr\\u003ePrepare your firearms, respond to the call for battle in PUBG MOBILE, and fire at will.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Tons of maps and modes】\\u003cbr\\u003ePUBG MOBILE has many maps and gameplay mechanics that give you a thrilling survival experience. Find your friends and play the new modes together! Play however you like and fire at will!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Play anytime, anywhere】\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax and play PUBG MOBILE to your heart\\u0026#39;s content! Enjoy the smoothest gunplay for an unparalleled gameplay experience.Feel the call of duty, move forward with courage, and lead your friends to victory\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Made especially for mobile phones】\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures customizable controls, training mode, and voice chat with friends. Experience the smoothest control experience and the most realistic firearms on your phone.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePUBG MOBILE has the highest fidelity items and gameplay experience. PUBG MOBILE can fulfill any wish you might have. Choose from countless firearms and test your marksmanship. New items, maps, and modes are constantly being added to the game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePUBG MOBILE offers the most intense multiplayer battles on your mobile phone. Join the battle, gear up, and play to win. Survive in epic 100-player battles in Classic Mode, Payload , fast-paced 4v4 Arena battles, and Infection Mode. Survival is all that matters. Be the last one standing. Accept missions and fire at will!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e【Follow us】\\u003cbr\\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/pubgmobile\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/PUBGMOBILE\\u003cbr\\u003eTwitter: https://twitter.com/PUBGMobile\\u003cbr\\u003eYoutube: https://www.youtube.com/pubgmobile\\u003cbr\\u003eTiktok: https://www.tiktok.com/@pubgmobile\\u003cbr\\u003eReddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/PUBGMobile/\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/pubgmobile\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease contact customer service if you encounter any problems: service@pubgmobile.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease read PUBG MOBILE\\u0026#39;s Privacy Policy and User Agreement\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: http://pubgmobile.proximabeta.com/privacy.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTencent Games User Agreement: https://www.pubgmobile.com/terms.html\"],\"Level Infinite\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UMXHLHm5Hnhtayn0h_hd5U8E3NYlJpfY6LUNwXXJfdUqvyGc7s5_xG8fQZwy3eW_EEeTLC0pStlwQntLkp9LoA\"],null,[39,51,68,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Violence, Blood\"],[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xl04GurQer374yogi24hRkvUcXtMStMOcOo86Sprmrid9j6wQHF0d9xMh73CwUEg57lbsGIwpOXgrJ927Q\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tencent.ig\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tencent.ig\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.29 - $199.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Tactical shooter\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Multiplayer\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Intense\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,