lGIuSLnZmG9IiziPDJQg2ygOU\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6F6QKOllzfqk3L8P-VNwcxiPV3uJpuKJXp1NOrZ4ZOVHOpmAhNTZiMqxnB06MU1mdDUPs1AVcohjUMHHkUumJg\"]]],\"Chess - Play and Learn Online\",[\"4.7\",4.6872215],\"Board\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.chess\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.chess\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.chess\"]],[\"qgJUGlIIoAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AiUKDwoJY29tLmNoZXNzEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,\"LJeB5njvaLs\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:LJeB5njvaLs?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:LJeB5njvaLs\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlRrbA3Z9UI3waoTpXPtGB8odJAlj-4ufx_SafTc3WYH123EkgdzCulQoOSddZHtSVdv1JIT_ZmsmM5ky3GWLLn7WuJDLm7mTH_KyjPXenEV3AoMTFeApmzVhuPUxLdBwCgC3nqamcFHLfeqHwA0YRUIvdsuo34ib_u_fEGxy5DQe9HXLyx_CGx2Zh1CG9c9Pe7i-nO1wggUX5Nfjdyn64ZHFou0G6YXcMjhHs5nxb_B6Jrg_JZ-xJooUeGYFeMKTq2JNpMs3SmHiDOAn9JeGDnd0m3TYtwhQd4gziLK-OBaA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LJeB5njvaLs/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cfont color\\u003d\\\"#69933F\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003ePlay chess lessons online with over 265 million players from around the world!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChess is known as the best strategy board game in the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy unlimited 3D offline pocket chess games and improve your chess rating with 500,000+ puzzles, more than 20 million chess games a day, lessons, and over 100 powerful bot opponents. Unlock your inner chess master today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e♟ PLAY CHESS ONLINE:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- 2 Player online chess mode is entirely free to enjoy with your friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join tournaments with players online or friends and become a master.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play games in real-time from one minute per game to 30 minutes or longer with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Review your strategy and game lessons and lay out daily correspondence in online chess.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play exciting chess variants in our app: chess960 (Fischer-Random), blitz chess, puzzle rush, bullet chess, puzzle battle, or blindfold.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🧩 CHESS PUZZLES:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy 500,000 + unique puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rated mode automatically adjusts to your skill level to help you improve.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Race the clock with a timer to beat your high score in Puzzle Rush.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Practice puzzles with specific themes in this strategy board game (checkmate in 1, in 2, in 3, blindfold, endgames, fork, skewer, sacrifice, timer, etc.)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📚 CHESS LESSONS:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of quality chess lessons and online videos made by masters (Learn and practice your skills with chess problems)\\u003cbr\\u003e- Interactive puzzles tutorials with tips and game recommendations.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Learn all the chess rules and strategies in a step-by-step lesson plan (opening, endgame...)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎓 CHESS COACHING:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Learn from helpful and immersive visual chess coach lessons.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Review your games with the coach and learn the strategy of the board game for every move.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play games with the coach, who will guide you through the fundamentals move by move and provide helpful hints as you play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e📟 PLAY CHESS ONLINE AGAINST THE COMPUTER:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose the level of computer opponent you want to play and set a timer.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Analyze your chess games offline and learn to see where you went wrong and how you can improve.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🏰 CHESS COMMUNITY:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Join a community of more than 200M online chess players. Find friends! \\u003cbr\\u003e- More than 20M games played each day.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete to get your own rating and try to join the best player online chess leaderboards against other players.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Watch the most popular superstars: Hikaru, GothamChess, or Magnus!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e✅ ... and MUCH MORE:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play chess games offline against the computer and the clock with a timer.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Articles by the best coaches and masters.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore openings like Queen´s Gambit or Sicilian Defense.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenge and play with your friends in an online chess game.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose from 20+ board themes and 3D pieces.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Get in-depth performance stats about your games, puzzles, and lessons.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🎖 Playing pocket chess online has never been so easy!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChess.com is the place to play chess games online with your friends and other players!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShare your suggestions and comments. Our support team is happy to help you 24 hours a day, 365 days a year!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e ABOUT CHESS.COM: \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChess.com was created by chess players and people who love ❤️ chess! \\u003cbr\\u003eTeam: http://www.chess.com/about\"],\"Chess.com\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xVVWPbrMIiKQVJKD8Rt1GI1V6ERwpxwcwpSuCXFbPbSholzahjlRzz7EGMHqeeb8vE436DmGTxiIRXXWRT7igQ\"],null,[49,46,43,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5