ull,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.flyingwhalegames.carout\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.flyingwhalegames.carout\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.flyingwhalegames.carout\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIogFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjcKIQobY29tLmZseWluZ3doYWxlZ2FtZXMuY2Fyb3V0EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dtsn9-3YG5Bo\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tsn9-3YG5Bo/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Car Out! is a 3D traffic jam puzzle where a single tap sets a car in motion. The parking lot is gridlocked, cars are blocking every exit, and it is your job to clear the chaos. Tap a car and it drives off in the direction it is facing, so the real challenge is working out the right order to move everything and free the way out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePart puzzle, part parking simulator, Car Out! is easy to pick up but keeps you thinking. Can you untangle every traffic jam and become the ultimate parking master?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e• Every level is a packed parking lot or a jammed junction.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Check which way each car is pointing, then tap to send it forward.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Move the blockers out in the right sequence to open a path.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Guide all the cars out and clear the board to win.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 One-tap controls: tap a car to drive it out. No fiddly gestures, just pick up and play in seconds.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚦 Hundreds of levels: puzzles start gentle and build into real head-scratchers as new vehicles, lanes and obstacles arrive.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Brain-training fun: plan ahead, think a few moves deep and sharpen your logic with every jam you solve.\\u003cbr\\u003e🅿️ Two difficulty modes: stay relaxed with casual levels, or switch to Hard for a tougher traffic escape.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Daily and monthly challenges: finish special puzzles to earn limited-time cars and grow your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚙 Cars to collect: unlock a whole garage of vehicles as you progress, from city runabouts to trucks and sports cars.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌆 Crisp 3D graphics: clean, colorful lots and smooth animations make every solved jam feel satisfying.\\u003cbr\\u003e📴 Play offline: no Wi-Fi needed, so you can solve puzzles on the bus, on a plane or anywhere you go.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY PLAYERS LOVE CAR OUT!\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin more than 10 million players worldwide. With a 4.7 star rating, Car Out! has become a go-to for anyone who loves a satisfying, relaxing brain teaser to dip into any time, whether you have five minutes or an hour.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to beat the gridlock? Download Car Out! and start clearing the traffic jam today.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCar Out! brings together everything you want from a car puzzle: tricky traffic jam levels, parking jam challenges, unblock-style logic and a relaxing traffic escape you can enjoy offline. If you love brain games, logic puzzles and casual games, this one is for you.\"],\"Tripledot Studios Limited\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VWsQwO3kHCwNtsY2TfYlBfk2lcbLLbBRj7caOsakpzMYaTvJ9-WB8-Z0rQBGuyMaiFWqG_L90zDjRBaCx1W8Fg\"],null,[238,239,232,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AO