l2qxtH0td3ld7GiiGw3Q3RytEcgWWmTV8yxztQ4FCFqpt7kbTyXV1xTtQ\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Mj7akYUbx_prVgnAfoFNehk3h53EkFRWx5GHFTVRMjwrZeALa0-b5H_x3EB-pRvgtuD1esc0VtbkCpvXL5pJbw\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sXl_0WvsZM3qBvhv9l8yQsoUbIcHAUE6VmHJ8B07saKZ9q1B8d9XyW7FyzNLnxo9aHDRWJimJWhsOKnV5xdjFq4\"]]],\"Wool Crush™\",[\"4.7\",4.6975527],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\"]],[\"qgJzGnEIpQFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6ARcKFQjpkZi+qYG7j0MSCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPAomCiB3b29sLm1hdGNoLmNvbG9yLnNvcnQuamFtLnB1enpsZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Wool Crush – Logic Color Sort Puzzle Master\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter a puzzle-focused world where every challenge in wool sort, yarn sort, and color sort requires careful deduction and step-by-step reasoning. Wool Crush – built on 3D wool sort structure and enhanced by wool knitting interactions – delivers a pure puzzle solving journey shaped by sequence planning, grid analysis, and logical clarity. Every level is a handcrafted wool sort color puzzle that guides you to analyze, deduce, arrange, and match patterns with precision.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Solve Logic-Driven Wool Sort Challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e • Each stage in this wool sort game is designed as a deterministic color sort logic puzzle where you must evaluate positions, predict sequences, and execute exact steps.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Levels blend yarn sort and car jam game ordering rules with controlled challenge escalation.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Car jam game mechanics add strategic blocking patterns, creating layered puzzle constraints without reducing clarity.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Progress through hundreds of puzzles in a complete logic progression, mastering patterns across car jam, yarn sort, and color sort structures.\\u003cbr\\u003e • Every puzzle rewards analytical thinking—ideal for players seeking puzzle-first gameplay rather than action or reaction-driven mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Play – Puzzle Analysis First\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Identify the correct cannon color and follow deterministic 3D wool sort logic to weaken the wool knitting dragon.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Apply car jam and car jam game style sequencing to remove obstacles in perfect puzzle order.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Use controlled yarn sort decisions to protect the cats and solve each stage’s specific logic pattern.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Puzzle-Focused Features – Designed for Brainteaser Enthusiasts\\u003cbr\\u003e 🧠 Pure Puzzle Framework:\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery car jam interaction reinforces logic rules in wool sort games. Each yarn sort step is deliberate and solvable without randomness.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Easy Rules, Deep Challenge:\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple controls make color sort puzzles accessible, while advanced car jam layouts require thoughtful sequencing and logical planning.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Color Ordering Logic:\\u003cbr\\u003eCombines yarn sort, 3D wool sort, and structured color sort reasoning to form coherent, progressively complex wool craze puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Clear Puzzle Objectives:\\u003cbr\\u003eSort correctly, resolve block patterns, analyze grids, unlock pathways, and complete each wool sort color puzzle through pure logic.\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Structured Puzzle Progression:\\u003cbr\\u003eNew mechanics, car jam constraints, and sequence-based rules continually refine your reasoning across the puzzle journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Relaxing but Fully Logical:\\u003cbr\\u003eNo timers, no pressure—just clean puzzle solving built around car jam, yarn sort, and color sort mastery.\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into Wool Crush and embrace puzzle clarity: thoughtful yarn sort moves, precise  color sort matching, and structured car jam logic.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy true wool sort puzzle challenges, Wool Crush delivers the perfect brain-teasing experience.\"],\"Astrasen Global\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EHfQVty7HjYHUvrJsu9KjdU2iEIG_77IhOG62sQS_jFvxoZDv__ZpPoy4gnXn0InaQAEEOU0TNkfW3n954yGMN8\"],null,[111,203,254,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dwool.match.color.sort.jam.puzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.49 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Logic\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Offline\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Single player\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.readygo.barrel.gp\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"h