ll,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.starplay.wreckracing\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.starplay.wreckracing\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.starplay.wreckracing\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIpwFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjQKHgoYY29tLnN0YXJwbGF5LndyZWNrcmFjaW5nEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,\"hVIeNpnbpdM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:hVIeNpnbpdM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:hVIeNpnbpdM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmRFtnMXtitw6NCAaQHpOZ7mEr5cyp402FCZ2MFYuLaNeiZZnw4B8WbyBHUPwyPnvFJgKxFk6fHW8T2q04P8P7UZEUo_caZs5qaF_P1ccBLnUP2owN2s635fz8LaUE3HZIrJ_Nxk7yggtU1zzTG8hhdvh6Gb6rVLFI5-rxDSIURmh_Ne_iPPpdGAGsexJR9h7EgN8DuH436OpjNbo4rnmRkBFHtlmmNCweTSZrxZPOWo2IgOdmy-qxM-4Z2PGRa8UzvIwZ8jpsmnzKqLSfPvNaFTV816TpbTntEWVPvQ9k_Zw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hVIeNpnbpdM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"⚡ TURBO CAR FOOTBALL AT ROCKET SPEED ⚡\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Cars Royale — the wildest car sports arena on mobile! Fire your boosters, launch across the field, and smash the giant ball into the net. Fast cars, huge goals, pure colorful chaos.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is car football like you\\u0026#39;ve never played it. Join a driving league packed with rivals from around the world and battle in real-time PvP matches where you score, defend, and crash your way to the top of the arena. Every match is fast, loud, and impossible to put down.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 EPIC GAME MODES\\u003cbr\\u003e- Football — classic car soccer with a turbo twist. Boost, jump, and smash epic goals past your rivals in fast 3v3 arena battles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- American Football — grab the ball, dodge tackles, and hit the end zone before the clock runs out.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Bomb Mode — the ball is a ticking bomb. Land your hit and pass it fast, or get blown to pieces in an explosive crash.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Demolition Derby — no rules, no mercy. Crash, wreck, and smash rivals in an all-out car battle until one machine is left standing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 SMASH, HIT, CRASH\\u003cbr\\u003eRam opponents at full boost and watch cars crash apart in a shower of sparks. Time the perfect hit, send rivals flying, and steal the ball. Every collision counts, every smash and every hit brings you closer to the win. This is demolition-fueled soccer built for pure adrenaline.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔧 UPGRADE YOUR RIDE\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock and customize dozens of cars. Boost your speed, power, and turbo thrust. Wild paint jobs, wheels, and boost trails — build a machine that smashes harder, hits stronger, and drives faster than any rival on the field.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👊 REAL-TIME PvP BATTLES\\u003cbr\\u003eGo head-to-head in online multiplayer against live players. Team up in 3v3 matches, take on rivals worldwide, and dominate the league table. Quick rounds, instant action, endless replay value — the ultimate car battle experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ WHY YOU\\u0026#39;LL LOVE CARS ROYALE\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fast, colorful, arcade-style car football and soccer\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explosive crashes, satisfying hits, and bone-crunching smashes\\u003cbr\\u003e- Multiple modes — football, derby, bomb, car battle, and more\\u003cbr\\u003e- Real-time PvP and online multiplayer against live rivals\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to play, hard to master\\u003cbr\\u003e- Free to download and packed with nonstop action\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrab the wheel, hit the boost, and smash your way to glory. The league is waiting — can you crush every rival, win the tournament, and become the ultimate champion of the arena?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Cars Royale now — free! Score epic goals, crash hard, smash rivals, and rule the PvP football league! 🏆🚗💥\"],\"Starplay FZCO\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dwAt6gpZxv-WL3HNTS2dYD_PUPaAE4D2epwn9mHeSU_z2rCmlswfCSyCj9YVoPhmQprC_HMfOcuU0nBTv2xNZw\"],null,[87,199,247,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.starplay.wreckracing\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.starplay.wreckracing\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.brain.logic.joygame\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7aYxCcMDJzeRgpJjX62onFcXjtEUO6MnIU9sQ1MaMDf0XpOtPtcM5t9sxq1s6cSWP5jOKqB0N5fgQVkqq71wvQ\"],null,[100,121,142,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Mzpw-_5DU28i1G6ZI8mFndvJXpJoLinrKYfusWnRmF6GTAIx7-QtfV4h0al4UgA1OaahFRNJsl_QsxmnNx1xkQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IjnlCeeGJ8GX-Wn_1eiJ4O9uXj7P2r4hQj7P8cVAQGfJo5TV_NjvzO4-wvrsOPtm69PZyglSc5khbGi_UI0a1Q\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/REX56DF-_cL4jm_2Tc6zpVWf6rY6ogrPwwsIyPz3NvWxnfAlLSbB1Hq72LT2Lrhu5qU24ibm14bQrSugDHm2mA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L9dXLR2LTeFAQTsrloVU5boLgNUhn0SdwQjB_iaEZ-SxnKYTlcJTZ5KtvFUky7GIGiWqDhMhrP-YJVnCD_E1\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fiBbylFYnjeY5Cfs-Y5vaqBNNgvhvh-YGHdV1zI2iXe3FJlQf-wJxA7f3JcsUT2EjeR5D6xgcGxQIwA3xILVGA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C3Aj-UC7AntUsjF2w0jSKtoMKtgA8RdyR7cxl3ADccdJg8UeZGkEFbmXCyoDNwwvKDoxTwxKha8WFFTPjKCi9Q\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d6rLkmsviVQggJfW6Vc1lrO8-8VQt7EGpRB2bBuKg_-1143y9vMU2yh935l24uKIgKiLqPcmeWrdbfd9iH5tZko\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4yzAkLGdmWRKobKpAn-B0FRFLMdBKn_4IgSm4I8j8E82aDN80m59DwEtf3igAesVlkcNC7J7oGTwx2_hRyHp\"]]],\"Brain Puzzle 2: Logic Twist\",[\"4.6\",4.6354914],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.brain.logic.joygame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.brain.logic.joygame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.brain.logic.joygame\"]],[\"qgJiGmAIqAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjMKHQoXY29tLmJyYWluLmxvZ2ljLmpveWdhbWUQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"This time, we’re continuing the humorous storytelling and brain-teasing design of the first game, bringing you an even richer and more surprising puzzle-solving experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this brand-new sequel, you\\u0026#39;ll follow quirky plot lines and make clever use of clues and interactive elements to crack a series of bizarre yet cleverly constructed levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach scene is packed with carefully designed puzzles, unconventional logic, and unexpected twists—making you think outside the box and enjoy a perfect mix of reasoning and creativity.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo complex systems needed—just tap, swipe, and explore! It\\u0026#39;s a fun and accessible brain challenge that anyone can enjoy. And if you get stuck, don’t worry—our trusty “Brain Buddy” will give you playful hints to spark new ideas and help you move forward.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌻Game Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBigger, Weirder Stories – Absurd scenarios mixed with trending jokes and clever twists, sparking laughs and wild creativity!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink Differently – These puzzles aren’t what they seem... flip your logic and find the unexpected solution.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, Fun Controls – Tap, drag, and solve. No learning curve—just dive in and play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlimited Hints – Stuck? Get as many helpful hints as you need\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin us now and challenge the limits of your imagination! Use your creativity and wit to conquer this absurd and delightful puzzle adventure, and feel the thrill of every solution.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 This is just the beginning! More levels and crazy stories are on the way—stay tuned!\"],\"JoyGame Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JRgjmEBkmzrcPdWzcn9LEfpwUqz5Fq7oC6BFd18YoMr9Vh-Ei6p2HEdjfgUPhIY5sshwmAnOTMV_uDBVNntO\"],null,[247,227,190,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence, Blood\"],null,[null,\"\\u