g2on8m8FQwJ1CSRZykVKuT3pv-dtB99CS8Kv6U5nYbnSookbm0-ntQ1_vo_kL9viddhsCNqOGx9ovVDs\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uiGGgK5mTxGTgL9JSxA-g09efcjwK5NQkakQtT5J9XP5iq2G3VaLoJV_7HMCw4ijJ_Ll8UcsgZDNix2QfTINkA\"]]],\"UNO!™\",[\"4.3\",4.328835],\"Card\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.matteljv.uno\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.matteljv.uno\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.matteljv.uno\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIqQFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6ARcKFQiEg9XQku7IiUMSCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLAoWChBjb20ubWF0dGVsanYudW5vEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"UNO!™ is now mobile! Take the classic card game from the kitchen table anywhere! Now with new rules, world series tournaments, modes of play, and much more. Whether you’re at home, on the go, an UNO!™ veteran or completely new, UNO!™ has something for everyone in the family. UNO!™ is a fun and memorable family-friendly card game wherever and whenever.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady. Set. UNO!™\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play the classic card game, UNO!™, or select from a variety of house rules to play in real-time matches\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete in tournaments and events to win free rewards and top the leaderboards\\u003cbr\\u003e- Partner up with friends or family, play in 2v2 mode, and collaborate to win\\u003cbr\\u003e- Connect anytime, anywhere with family and friends from around the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Classic Game at your Fingertips\\u003cbr\\u003eNew to UNO!™ or wanting to play your favorite card game? Tap Quick Play and start up a new game with classic UNO!™ rules. Get ready for new monthly rewards and events!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with Friends\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with friends or family! Set up your own house rules and play your way. UNO!™ is a family-friendly party that makes it free and easy for anyone to join!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuddy Up\\u003cbr\\u003eFind a friend or family and partner up to battle in 2 player teams. Help each other reduce your hand (or your partner’s) to zero as quickly as possible to beat the other team!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect, Chat, Shout UNO!™\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect with your buddies in UNO!™ with clubs and send each other gifts. Make a strategy and remember to shout UNO before anyone else.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNew Challenges at Every Level\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete in World Series tournaments and special events to win free rewards. Top the leaderboards and show off to your friends and family! Then spin the wheel and try your fortune to get free rewards every day!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGo Wild – No, Really\\u003cbr\\u003eThis no-holds-barred mode is as wacky as UNO!™ gets. Forget the classic mode - house rules on, two-deck play, and free winnings up to 600 times what you put in to make you the coin master! But beware, in this wild game mode, you win big or go home empty-handed! Are you up for the challenge?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUNO Championship Series\\u003cbr\\u003eClaim your daily tournament invitation to the official UCS Digital Qualifiers!\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers who master all three Digital Qualifier Tournaments will earn their spot as a UCS Finalist and a chance at the title of UNO World Champion!\\u003cbr\\u003eCompete with the best of the best in Classic UNO—with a new Special Rules twist!\\u003cbr\\u003eNO PURCHASE NECESSARY. Open to legal residents of the 50 US/DC, age 18+. Qualification Rounds end at 4:59 pm PT on 9/26/26. See Official Rules for details: https://championship.matteluno.com\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit our official site at www.letsplayuno.com\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow us on Facebook for more updates: www.facebook.com/UNOnow\"],\"Mattel Game Studios HK Limited\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J_1gkc_jyqnYT-ANFPFMjVowGtXsUxw5Qa9GQ5geYDhEV6UIBvc-FXKJQQ1pSiI3vW3k890_Z5ULy5i4Ac3kIg\"],null,[172,2,13,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.matteljv.uno\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.matteljv.uno\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.29 - $299.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Card\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Last card\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Multiplayer\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.starplay.spider.fighter.openworld\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jSHpomdddSm_gdAjnSzjdq_5DeDvrCEHuSHeEaRm3jXYDKhpxcfkV6JxhFz4Giq4QrQP6yWIVaU9DM4hx1VyQQ\"],null,[250,183,132,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CDSnCGgpf8Lc1bf79bTgbQf-qJlJXTR8lh3TJVllRTEq-zy3OHs