87V1DwyBVg\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:y87V1DwyBVg?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:y87V1DwyBVg\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmZgFtrLNeDpJqy9zNYFcZUjJIatVlBMk-dwbxdEf-aGt3rOkbb1N6AyHYf6wbOMEj2LahO5KR-EroNnAV1WP9EXw6PjRAXHkEXBU_aq3EVRkGFQEx8d-c-bJR8RFGIosxG06i-Yg-SioCuVDxmG-oqdgDscPt--cKR07ZmPkxgEMhutUxYvI04l5XgHzs2b2-0vO_YurGbn2njDMhygaFVU9zcYxmhzPtEGlqRa_5GflF9GWH_6Nw2py1w3D3wczsYN0zSwxCG15vPZODofuWzc5-uQgs8pbW4HOSUbqLnYw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/y87V1DwyBVg/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Every heart holds a magnificent spark, ready to shine. Your creativity, unique style, and confidence deserve a radiant place to glow.\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Rebel Glam, an inspiring fashion simulation where beauty and imagination come to life. This is more than ordinary dress up games—it is a glorious celebration of self-expression and artistic design. Discover vibrant aesthetics, explore global trends, and create exquisite outfits that reflect your authentic personality.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom E-Girl energy to Red Carpet glamour, every style you design becomes a triumphant moment. Enjoy the freedom to master the art of fashion, makeup, and magical makeover transformations that make every avatar feel truly special.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✂️ DESIGN \\u0026amp; CUSTOMIZE YOUR STYLE\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy follow trends when you can curate your own? Explore a massive wardrobe of Y2K fashion, gothic chic, and luxury couture. Cut custom patterns, dye fabrics with vibrant colors, and stitch unique silhouettes to mix and match textures. Customize every detail of your avatar—from stunning hairstyles to professional makeup combinations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👗 IMMERSIVE CREATIVE DRESS UP GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love creative dress up games, Rebel Queen offers endless inspiration. Engage in deep styling mechanics, experiment with fresh outfits, and enjoy relaxing fashion challenges. Each new look you design becomes a vital part of your personal fashion journey.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💄 MASTER THE MAKEUP \\u0026amp; MAKEOVER MAGIC\\u003cbr\\u003eExpress your artistry with professional makeup tools and complete beauty makeover features. Blend colorful eyeshadows, contour with highlights, and style iconic hair designs. Every makeover helps transform your model into a confident fashion icon through realistic cosmetic simulation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📸 CAPTURE \\u0026amp; SHARE STUNNING MOMENTS\\u003cbr\\u003ePose your model in immersive scenes and capture high-definition photos. Add creative filters, fun stickers, and share your favorite fashion looks with the global community. Celebrate your creativity, gain Aura Points, and inspire others with your beautiful masterpieces.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate amazing outfits, master stylish makeup, and let your inner brilliance shine brighter than ever.\"],\"31 Dress up Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RUNeuEiEBCEfv5bCVwMUdCCJXXW5u5c0l_5PkXLjV18VYeAWJC1o9aSXczBki3YjWm1-cbZsyrcvrQB34rY5\"],null,[254,215,224,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u0