s/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Playing Wordscapes 10 mins a day sharpens your mind and prepares you for your daily life and challenges! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis text twist of a word game is tremendous brain challenging fun. Enjoy modern word puzzles with word searching, anagrams, and crosswords! Immerse yourself into the beautiful scenery backgrounds to relax and ease your mind.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNow available in 5 languages! Enjoy the Wordscapes experience in English, Spanish, German, French, and Portuguese. Challenge yourself to connect letters and find as many hidden words as you can in relaxing games! Unlock stunning landscape backgrounds to escape from home and relax your brain.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’ll never experience a dull moment after you try this addicting word puzzle game! Play this crossword puzzle once and just you won’t be able to put it down. Enjoy word connect and word find games? This is your final destination!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e►Escape and play relaxing games while visiting the beautiful destinations of Wordscapes!\\u003cbr\\u003e► Show your vocabulary power by connecting letters and finding all the hidden words.\\u003cbr\\u003e► Get your word hunt on with over 6,000 crossword puzzles!\\u003cbr\\u003e► Challenge your brain and vocabulary – this crossword puzzle starts easy and becomes challenging fast!\\u003cbr\\u003e► Think you can beat these anagram word puzzles? They start simply but ramp up fast!\\u003cbr\\u003e► Take each level at your own pace with unlimited tries. Simply fun and relaxation!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWordscapes is the word puzzle game for adults that over 10 million people just can\\u0026#39;t stop playing! It\\u0026#39;s a great fit for fans of crossword, word connect, spelling games, and word anagram games, combining word find games and crossword puzzles. Not to mention our relaxing games have  gorgeous landscapes to visit!\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for a break that still feels productive? These brain games offer just that! Wordscapes is a great puzzle game for adults who love words and beautiful visuals.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you\\u0026#39;re looking for brain games that aren’t stressful, Wordscapes is a great pick. It’s smart, satisfying, and one of the most calming puzzle games for adults you’ll find.\\u003cbr\\u003eWordscapes gives you that “just one more level” feeling. It’s no surprise it’s a favorite among brain games \\u003cbr\\u003eand a go-to choice for fans of puzzle games for adults\\u003cbr\\u003eWordscapes an exciting word puzzle game that’s easy to pick up and hard to put down. With calming visuals and clever levels, it’s a refreshing way to unwind while keeping your mind young.\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of service: https://www.peoplefun.com/terms\"],\"PeopleFun\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eRxuW-QdLZLyLbTgMeqBHh8ElXll67d4xz7s_CSI0AZoTrzliOVxFMjXXfeSGWlAg1lCTdVCj1Ax7U7v__BV6BM\"],null,[242,244,241,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.peoplefun.wordcross\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.peoplefun.wordcross\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"Cg