ZuQVKEE7PQy_A\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mrG9plS-ToJOMcvKJWydu3CcOYydfqenKiQBbVK767AR689mFUtgYT8zwzbDtieabNNBesyAa63yOdchbRs9IA\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5YryBqXU19Qrx6XNUt_OE-Lhi8DQ484WHosQgH1RI2r2JGeUO4V2tp9pMzw8C3nbdOYio-Kzr2f6oozTylgZDQ\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fxzmsi5ZN_IPvl1Qg11L4l7qNwnlnITBzDCtkjxdwy-B1VkzFvj0WH7eHL6OAfa0ntBK7IqxrKAgVWpfcW4Ov2o\"]]],\"Cube Tap Sort\",[\"4.7\",4.702905],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zm.pickpack\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zm.pickpack\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zm.pickpack\"]],[\"qgJaGlgItgFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AisKFQoPY29tLnptLnBpY2twYWNrEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAB\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003dzTXnz5rex4A\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zTXnz5rex4A/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Can You Clear the Blocks Before the Buffer Fills Up?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCube Tap Sort is a fresh and addictive color sort puzzle game that will challenge your logic, focus, and strategy. Your mission: dismantle a vibrant 3D structure of colored blocks in the correct order. Sounds easy? Think again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play This Block Puzzle Game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level presents a unique 3D layout of colorful blocks. At the top of the screen, active order boxes display specific colors. Your goal is simple:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap blocks that match the color shown in an active box\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clear them in the correct sequence\\u003cbr\\u003e• Manage your moves strategically to avoid overflowing the buffer\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTap a block without a matching active box? It moves to your buffer and waits. But be careful: your buffer has limited space. If it fills up, the level is over!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Color Sorting Puzzle That Rewards Strategy\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn\\u0026#39;t just another casual game—it\\u0026#39;s a brain training puzzle where thinking beats\\u003cbr\\u003etapping:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Analyze the 3D block layout before you make a move\\u003cbr\\u003e• Decide which colored blocks to clear first\\u003cbr\\u003e• Avoid unnecessary taps and keep your buffer under control\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery move matters. One wrong tap can end your run.\\u003cbr\\u003e  \\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing Visuals \\u0026amp; Addictive Sorting Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Eye-catching 3D block structures with bright, colorful designs\\u003cbr\\u003e• Smooth, responsive tap controls\\u003cbr\\u003e• Increasingly challenging puzzle levels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Satisfying animations as you dismantle structures piece by piece\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures of This Color Block Puzzle:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of handcrafted sorting puzzle levels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Progressive difficulty that keeps you engaged for hours\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple one-tap controls with deep strategic gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Perfect for quick brain game sessions or relaxing puzzle marathons \\u003cbr\\u003e• Free to play and fun for all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to Learn, Hard to Master\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJump in instantly with intuitive tap-to-sort mechanics. But mastering the perfect color sequence takes real skill, patience, and clever thinking. This is the ultimate logic puzzle for adults and casual gamers who love a satisfying brain challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you keep your buffer under control and clear every block puzzle level? \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload this free color sorting puzzle now and put your skills to the ultimate test!\"],\"Tripledot Studios Limited\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OmvG_NA-xjWhK-iqCF2wJlXj61iXP00gHb18uz_2krnFP87P_WxC5SdPA9vfv1vhvJYYybKTczTvnDO8yNDPig\"],null,[128,179,18,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zm.pickpack\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zm.pickpack\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$1.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Puzzle\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.ps.burger.stack.master.cooking.games\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cGEkJwcYLunhWsulffVIrenDTQq4_F3pOBlbx9xaSqMcWe8-H_baIPR99PjiJ3gHzgFFFydA14H4c3UZjiW5\"],null,[246,36,15,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.goog