xABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAg\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"-bfYHisxauM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:-bfYHisxauM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:-bfYHisxauM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkBmSCS5pEsCXtBETQlq4QkMnVoCrKTgOpNgn6rLDfvOLDEf-Gg2MtbJn_OlZ2-DaIdNFC95TpYlg0UHWuAT4aWZg4bYqMLYMI13sxEVGSL77XOlssXaYLQC0itKI5VcLyndxBBr_USO3nfwKeYAqmEfMUhdSOoHM70_xy0ZSSWaTNuRDQUQfnUL6BunMSiHH4eJKI8cHkZlBsFVMK67WKvXY_ox4lxeAHK-4oBZDHRXlLZwS9Oy0pWXZqq7eN7zWHlmFVnppAGBMZ9VQR8xX8_crPUjcUwksn0M12dWznWag\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-bfYHisxauM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"If you love playing cooking games and enjoy creating tower burgers, giant burgers, or stacked burgers with juicy meat and tasty ingredients, then this is the game for you! Jump into the fun of burger making — choose your ingredients wisely to keep your customers happy and enjoy this exciting burger runner game that’s perfect for all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCook, stack, and serve your way to burger greatness!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRun through the platform, collect ingredients, and build the biggest, tastiest burgers. But be careful — you need to choose your items wisely! Make sure your burger stack looks amazing and makes your customers happy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to play:\\u003cbr\\u003eRun through the Platform\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect fresh ingredients\\u003cbr\\u003eStack your burgers tall and tasty\\u003cbr\\u003eServe your happy customers\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock new levels, toppings, and fun surprises!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy you’ll love this burger game:\\u003cbr\\u003eFun and easy to play\\u003cbr\\u003eColorful, cartoony graphics\\u003cbr\\u003eTons of ingredients to choose from\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying cooking and stacking gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for fans of casual cooking games, food runner games, and burger making fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you want to build a giant burger, master a perfect stack, or just enjoy the fun of cooking games — this is the perfect game for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and start your burger-making adventure!\"],\"Play Stove\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q89NJ36IZZdfJlA72vSbMg3QlakVEuFRShxALdH041f-FNFhYHK0Wmx0i4n0FTtBVyK2n4SpXwqKq4odIJOU\"],null,[254,241,182,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ps.burger.stack.master.cooking.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ps.burger.stack.master.cooking.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.09 - $9.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Action\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Platformer\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"find.out.hidden.objects.seek.puzzle.games.free\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,nul