vVfp6K2XtMpWkSTQYOobdF49u-5FNYKXZy8\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/og03zkogKDUGnx9fm70RKCDZ8aK5xBrtBllNVKzlimS351oLyp79sDxdwTZ-E2NXqOzFK5davYCiitE5eEC-2ms\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CLcx7VwNTNhF5Wjpz-_lbY8L5q0H71sHTF6FZzddMD9f_xc8UuDsA50bTtqqGZWr2CmVjl2PPsjNQNUDiVE5l6c\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kD_5K2bncMmyXJ20oUiDEQTSnrK1Tzz-cIwhAoP48ocn32Ch7eeCfMQtMYa6aBiKEulMeDUnuBC-xiCB8NgTogU\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O1EPiJAewPrhjqoidENdQlPho2HRupcKm4nKj5q24IdP_zVb6FEkW2_TYfkWqf6NFCXtXXnBwrK5pmvozdHVdw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z8hAIMtQbTjUkALvxkIYIb8dpXE_dTrYlNNCIrTwfxbDLtavJ2o2RMdqc51oK7eHY2chFFOmpJF58ZLByOQM\"]]],\"Food Hunt: Pixel Puzzle\",[\"4.4\",4.3935266],\"Puzzle\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vigafun.funfinity.foodhunt\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.vigafun.funfinity.foodhunt\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.vigafun.funfinity.foodhunt\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIugFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjoKJAoeY29tLnZpZ2FmdW4uZnVuZmluaXR5LmZvb2RodW50EAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBAE\"],null,[null,\"A giant feast is waiting, and your ants are hungry!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLead colorful swarms of ants on an exciting food-hunting adventure. Every level is packed with tasty treats made from colorful pixels. Choose the right color, unleash your ants, and watch them march into action as they gobble up every matching piece of food in sight.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOne bite becomes ten. Ten bites become hundreds. Before you know it, the entire picture has disappeared beneath a hungry ant invasion!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍽️ BUILD THE PERFECT FEAST\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle is a giant food map waiting to be cleared. Pick the right ant swarm, plan your moves carefully, and help your colony collect every last crumb.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐜 UNLEASH THE COLONY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tap a color to release a matching ant swarm\\u003cbr\\u003e• Watch your colony rush toward matching food pixels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clear every piece of that color from the board\\u003cbr\\u003e• Free up space and chain into the next color\\u003cbr\\u003e• Last pixel gone — level clear!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 INSIDE FOOD HUNT\\u003cbr\\u003e• Unique ant-swarm puzzle gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Satisfying food-clearing action with every tap\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of colorful pixel art puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing gameplay with real strategic depth\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cute animations and charming ant personalities\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy to pick up, hard to put down\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom tiny snacks to giant feasts, no food is safe from your hungry colony.\"],\"EVERFUN\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ddG8zRUxLsIVRIWzzE_ZE_jrBOTiZjLZR_u-foviiC-IBV27DCrxndpmqdyI0367wS31S-aau1eZeIqdl4AcFA\"],null,[201,143,90,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,[null,\"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kY