ull,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.easybrain.brick.balls.blast\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.easybrain.brick.balls.blast\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.easybrain.brick.balls.blast\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIwAFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjsKJQofY29tLmVhc3licmFpbi5icmljay5iYWxscy5ibGFzdBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQBA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"PF2DQ0Fh6U8\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:PF2DQ0Fh6U8?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:PF2DQ0Fh6U8\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznA5OiKYP0H81W1CU_bmNDdjsTHw-pvYvV9TVBzIPRGLV5iEbtdzx-wwJBzmVdLugIlid1JG32gHkSmduNs_-sl4rI_po7apPT29nMIqeIRGuYXHj1kug2waXTyJSLxhRDW8VLN5KYZ1G85WEWCWzaBvKZoa9ySodYqUqK14GxPehEKuqOqtXQUOs0nePGeRpPFSSaECHHVOo0peXUw66pYHdmhpx1snzH-n-cDG5R8PTwzsPK9N32AVsw5Mc_FRkOo2QexCmQE5VlavrRqUwCGxZnjg4QuNDR2asrfR4gL0g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PF2DQ0Fh6U8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Brick Blast - Brick Breaker is an engaging bricks and balls game with simple rules, a hint of challenge, and plenty of effortless fun. Pick your angle, shoot the balls, and watch them blast through every brick in their path.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBrick Blast - Brick Breaker delivers pure enjoyment with no rush or pressure. Play at your own pace and enjoy smooth, dynamic gameplay that will help you unwind while training your logic and focus.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play Brick Blast:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe goal is simple: break the bricks and keep the board clear. Swipe to aim and release to shoot—the ball shooter sends glowing balls flying across the screen, bouncing off walls and smashing through colorful blocks. Plan your shots wisely to hit the best angles, clear multiple bricks at once, and watch the balls bounce out across the board in dazzling chains of glowing hits before the blocks reach the bottom line.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover power blocks that make this block breaker even more exciting:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Laser shoots across rows or columns, damaging all blocks along its path.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Multiplier triples your balls for massive combos.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Redirect changes the path to reach tricky angles.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Extra Ball gives you more power until the end of the round.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse power blocks skillfully to enjoy mighty ball blasts and brick-breaking chain reactions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You’ll Love Brick Blast:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ An easy-to-play brick breaker game with a modern look and smooth graphics.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Dynamic levels packed with special blocks, combos, ball blasts, and glowing brick breaker effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ A calming pastime—no pressure, no time limits, just pure focus and pleasure.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ A fun way to unwind while honing your strategy skills—perfect for players who love puzzle quests and brick-breaking games.\\u003cbr\\u003e✔ Endless ball breaker gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake a break, play Brick Blast - Brick Breaker, and feel the joy of every perfect shot!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://easybrain.com/terms\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://easybrain.com/privacy\"],\"Easybrain\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NaeaU1xXpz4HtpoJGhVAZyr1gSmNl2JMtOGhpcwM84eF8EQtEAGek-TRzzH3ZmklTYS4j2kdzBYjcpMTkqnC\"],null,[38,46,100,255]],null,[\"Teen\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq\"]],[null,\"Partial Nudity\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"]