LW24Ty2vXq_6Z4ZaDiWEdOBTJkYSpGUkeqYqz47UJEKbvCK2vOOAWi7XyEYDXh89uOl3STzaJKVfi8qzMzq8vDY3KKiorgvl5kKP2p4_qvnsiMqdEf5x8Jija8m6KHQk2vRusqq6VDgEvM50tqm7L2UL5MWYFPwMGmCIpUiCmWJaMyLjlPchKGdRn6G_EJNRL32S47fDzb1Z1CF10tZxemHV6Se8EL514VItmbX3KEq0ANVQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q-SiTHoSaW8/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Farkle Dice Roll – The Ultimate PvP Dice Game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLove the thrill of dice games like Yahtzee or Balut? Farkle Dice Roll is here to take your dice-rolling adventures to the next level! Packed with exciting features, this game combines strategy, risk, and fun for players of all skill levels. Challenge friends, family, or players worldwide in thrilling PvP matches where luck and skill go hand in hand.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You’ll Love Farkle Dice Roll:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Strategic Gameplay: Decide whether to secure your points or roll again and go for that lucky win!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Duels: Engage in one-on-one battles to prove your dice mastery.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Journey Mode: Embark on exciting challenges and unlock unique rewards as you progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Leagues: Compete globally, climb the leaderboards, and show everyone you’ve got what it takes.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Achievements: Hit milestones and show off your skills as a Farkle pro.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with Buddies: Easily connect with friends and family for hours of fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Perfect for fans of dice games like Balut and Yhatzee.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fast, thrilling PvP gameplay with exciting twists.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A mix of skill, strategy, and lucky rolls in every game.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Global leaderboards and leagues to compete with the best.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A sleek, user-friendly interface for smooth gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you have what it takes to outsmart your opponent? Play it safe or roll for glory—the choice is yours!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKnown by many names like Zilch, Hot Dice, Greed, or 10,000, Farkle is a timeless classic loved by dice enthusiasts everywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Farkle Dice Roll now and dive into the ultimate PvP dice game experience. Luck, strategy, and endless fun await!\"],\"FunCraft Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zQLQrhhQwzOL-EKSI0TBpaTpM3D48ZoS0TUdJ35dvYgjQgFLazPiHpYuj25T1E7Ec2Hs83kzXGcNi9DHI0RjeJc\"],null,[246,236,228,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.funcraft.farkle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.funcraft.farkle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $49.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Board\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Dice\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Multiplayer\"]],[null,null,null,[\"Competitive\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.MojoGames.EraEvolution\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuserconten