Evolution\"]],[\"qgJlGmMIxQFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLVVTEAC6AjYKIAoaY29tLk1vam9HYW1lcy5FcmFFdm9sdXRpb24QARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAQ\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\\u003d_FiZDTFOkHI\"]],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_FiZDTFOkHI/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Join the ultimate gun runner adventure! Lead your crowd through thrilling obstacle courses, shoot through gates, and evolve your team to conquer new eras!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNavigate dynamic courses by swerving left and right, shooting through gates and bricks. Recruit powerful members to your crowd, enhancing your strength with each addition. Utilize upgrades to boost your team\\u0026#39;s capabilities and unlock new eras filled with unique challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dynamic Gun Runner Gameplay: Experience fast-paced action as you lead your crowd through challenging courses.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Crowd Evolution Mechanics: Recruit and upgrade members to build an unstoppable team.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Obstacle Course Challenges: Test your reflexes and strategy against a variety of obstacles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Era Unlocking System: Progress through different historical periods, each with unique visuals and challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Upgrade and Merge System: Enhance your team\\u0026#39;s abilities through strategic upgrades and merging.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Play Timeline Up?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you\\u0026#39;re a fan of games that combine action, strategy, and progression, Timeline Up offers an engaging experience. Lead your crowd, overcome obstacles, and evolve through time in this thrilling runner shooter!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Timeline Up now and embark on your epic journey!\"],\"Rollic Games\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,nul