id\\u003dcom.bhe.gardenmatch\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bhe.gardenmatch\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bhe.gardenmatch\"]],[\"qgJeGlwIxgFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6AQ8KDQgAEgkKBWVuLUdCEAC6Ai8KGQoTY29tLmJoZS5nYXJkZW5tYXRjaBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Garden Match: Earn Real Rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003eGrow your rewards just by playing the game you love. Garden Match takes the satisfying flow of tile-matching and plants it in a sunny garden: match flowers, gnomes, veggies and fruit, clear the board, earn gems, and redeem for e-vouchers at your favourite stores. No deposits. No tricks. Just tiles, skill, and rewards waiting at every level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA whole garden to match, from blooming flowers and cheeky gnomes to fresh veggies and ripe fruit, Garden Match is the most rewarding matching game you\\u0026#39;ll find!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTile Matching, Garden Style\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple, satisfying matching mechanics, faithfully crafted for mobile. Clean visuals, lightning-fast responsiveness, and intuitive controls that feel natural from your very first game. Whether you\\u0026#39;re a longtime puzzle fan or matching your first pair, Garden Match meets you where you are.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn Real Rewards As You Play\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level you beat earns you gems. Gems fill your Piggy Bank. When it\\u0026#39;s full, redeem for real e-vouchers at leading retailers. The more you play, the more you earn, it\\u0026#39;s that simple. No deposit required, no hidden conditions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBonus Reward Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eSpecial bonus rounds bloom as you advance, with extra opportunities to earn more gems and reach your next redemption faster. Every board cleared is a step closer to your reward.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTrain Your Brain\\u003cbr\\u003eMatching games have long been celebrated for sharpening focus, memory, and strategic thinking. Garden Match is built with that in mind. Each level introduces fresh tile layouts that challenge your pattern recognition and keep your mind engaged. The kind of game you pick up for five minutes and put down an hour later, feeling sharper for it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHundreds of Handcrafted Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery layout is unique, carefully designed to challenge and delight. Early stages ease you in; deeper levels will test everything you know. New challenges and seasonal content are added regularly, so there\\u0026#39;s always a fresh garden to clear.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDynamic Boosters \\u0026amp; Power-Ups\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen a layout gets tough, strategic boosters are there to help. Unlock new power-ups as you progress and use them to clear harder boards, earn more gems, and reach your next reward faster.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuilt for Every Player\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing enough for a five-minute break. Deep enough to keep you coming back for months. Garden Match is accessible on day one and still rewarding hundreds of levels in! Perfect for new players and seasoned puzzle fans alike.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to clear the board and claim your rewards? Download Garden Match now and start your garden matching adventure today.\"],\"Bear Hug Entertainment Limited\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GL46vh8M6S9HgvVCM44doe77fYxC18Mfnd9F2Vec7DwxX7EhKzjHqRJly9P-iLxPP5R4a-yEDZl-SPF1WiJ7Ow\"],null,[33,90,49,255]],null,[\"Mature 17+\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YX4IU7qLML-be7Xl25J-YkRBNgSZhVhJIsxeLdke3SaX1QBSFEKLbdcWORAwahq0oI4rrjz5YnWiVdb5\"]],[null,\"Cash Rewards\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\