yIp8ecMbZQp81mdLNCw\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ut5hfFFoKVx0RUrhqueTR5a40WL4DjID3RnrOntiCTJpvPdH1TRc-Q5T1RWlVn7mCzP6w3sBmrt39TK9Dh8nPg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lfv-xTjGZ-MB0Xoe5ZZ_iNGQ3cD7aCIkZFEZrCLANS0acPfBrQlvxGPVuDMXEl9rui4CppMpf2-wgiDA6HH3ZHI\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JRXT-RSpIbBWteILIaPbeY6VFObdnzZMtYmHTZaaxcywhhxWqr7C25JiosuVHuK38nxyHhqtp7pVJhbRcAoT\"]]],\"Animals \\u0026 Coins Adventure Game\",[\"4.9\",4.851919],\"Adventure\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.innplaylabs.animalkingdomraid\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.innplaylabs.animalkingdomraid\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.innplaylabs.animalkingdomraid\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIIxwFKEwitldb9jr+WAxWFeYQGHSiCKVL6ARcKFQjbtKue/djdjUMSCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPQonCiFjb20uaW5ucGxheWxhYnMuYW5pbWFsa2luZ2RvbXJhaWQQARgDEhIKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAM\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Join players around the globe in this animal adventure game. Build treasure islands and bridges, raid your friends’ bases, collect coins, unlock new pet characters, and go on a journey to explore the legendary animal kingdom!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBuild animal treasure islands\\u003c/b\\u003e 🏝️\\u003cbr\\u003eConquer different islands, steal coins from other players, including your friends, win mini-games to find loot, and become the true ruler of the animal kingdom!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEven better, you can unlock more pet characters, from the bear and the pig to the rabbit and the deer. All are so cute, but how many can you unlock?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🗺️ REVEAL DIFFERENT KINGDOM ISLANDS\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild bridges, solve mini puzzles, loot coins and treasures from others, build your dream island, unlock more adventures, and explore the animal kingdom.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💣 STEAL COINS \\u0026amp; RAID LANDS\\u003cbr\\u003eYou can win coins and treasures, cash, or gems by raiding other players’ animal islands. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕹️ PLAY AGAINST YOUR FACEBOOK FRIENDS\\u003cbr\\u003eAttack your friends and other players, raid lands, steal coins and treasures, and defend your island from ongoing attacks. Looking for revenge? You can raid other players and steal their gold coins and treasures! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐿️ COLLECT ANIMAL CHARACTER CARDS\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore islands and kingdoms and find unique animal cards. Once you finish the collection, you’ll win prizes including island coins and exclusive power-ups - plus the cute pets!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLike to play multiplayer raid games? In this exciting social coin game where you can raid lands and other animal islands to find millions of coins and loot or treasure chests.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHOW TO PLAY ANIMALS \\u0026amp; COINS TO BECOME THE KING OF COINS\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Tap and hold to build a bridge\\u003cbr\\u003e* Release to drop the bridge onto the adjacent platform. Hold for the perfect duration to earn extra cool rewards, island coins, gems, and more! Your running animal will show you the way with every bridge you build.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Earn and collect coins from each successful bridge to spend on gear for your island. \\u003cbr\\u003e* Collect all animal cards to win exclusive prizes!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin millions of players worldwide and become the next master of coins!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnimals \\u0026amp; Coins is intended for those 18 and older. Animals \\u0026amp; Coins may also contain advertising. You may require an internet connection to play Animals \\u0026amp; Coins and access its social features. You can also find more information about the functionality, compatibility, and interoperability of Animals \\u0026amp; Coins in the above description and additional app store information. By downloading this game, you agree to future game updates as released on your app store or social network. You may choose to update this game, but if you do not update, your game experience and functionalities may be reduced.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnimals \\u0026amp; Coins does not require payment to download and play, but it also allows you to purchase virtual items with real money inside the game, including random items.\"],\"Innplay Labs\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YVw2cWg_mVlElJzBo0zFc8PZs7VkuEklnd23oW-GT6M6NxJspAplLXHJuXp5sPl7sj-Ivi_0PQiFyTewGjCL5PU\"],null,[97,196,243,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i\"]],[null,\"Mild Fantasy Violence\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],false,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.innplaylabs.animalkingdomraid\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.innplaylabs.animalkingdomraid\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $299.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null